<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Miwera</book>
  <para style="h">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="toc2">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Matayo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matayo</para>
  <para style="imt">Bokweya ta buku</para>
  <para style="ip">Mokomi, bato bakomea ibo, esika e ekoma ibo ko yanga ekoma ibo:</para>
  <para style="ie">Mokomi:</para>
  <para style="iex">Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Matayo bodii bwɛndi bo boso ta tei e Mɛndi Mapele manɛi; boisama ta mbangi e buku dji Mokongo Moyeene. Bwɛndi Bopele bomina bobalakadea ta tina e bomɔ bo Yesu bo kpɔtɔ. Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Matayo bodii Bwɛndi bomɔti ta tei e Mɛndi Mapele masato, makatubane midjɔ midii mondumba momɔti ko makuanake (Matayo, Malako ko na Luka). Ta Bwɛndi bomina Bopele, ebalama bonɔ ta tina e bileho bi Yesu ko na isɔsi di nde ta dii Bayudha. Bwɛndi ibubu Bopele bokomama na Matayo, iyo adii temo o midjɔ mimina misɔngɔmɔdea. Boso bɛngi aimee motingami adaaka moputedji o puti; na tina emina akomi na esipoli esusu ko na e ikɔkɔ di Bayudha. Bokimana buku e nde, mokomi o Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Matayo asainedjakadea ondingo moto o mokanda o Bayudha; ko aimei mokilito asapi na Makomi ko aimei molehi ta bohomba «Bosipodja» bato Yesu; akpekpeaka oko ta mondumba mo bosalela bileho bi Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ie">Esika ekoma ibo:</para>
  <para style="iex">Endelo esika ekoma bo Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Matayo bobwani bodaa ta ekomi e Sili kaoko ta Penesi.</para>
  <para style="ie">Yanga ekoma ibo:</para>
  <para style="iex">Bwɛndi bomina Bopele bokomama mbuti na yanga e 70 ngɔngɔ dji bobotama bo Yesu Kilito; bokomamaka mo ehole mokɛkɛ boso bo bobukama bo tepelo e Yelusalɛmɛ.</para>
  <para style="ie">Ilɔndi di buku:</para>
  <para style="iex">Mokomi o Bwɛndi ibubu Bopele akomea Bayudha bɛngi badhime bo Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ adii Kilito, Kumu ko Moheledji o bobo; apalaka bobasipodja isɔsi di Yesu ta dii Bayudha ko ta tei e Yesu ekokedjamakadea mibalo mi batɛli ba Mokongo Moyou ta tina e Masiya. Buku iyeye ekomama ta tina e badhimi ibia badonga ta dii Bayudha. Matayo akpekpeakadea ta tina e Makomi, Mobeko mo Mose, ko na bokɔkɔ bo Bayudha; Matayo adiiti e botingodja mɛko minɛnɛ ondingo Malako (10, 6; 15, 24). Endelo mobeko mo Bayudha motungi bokokedjama bo Makomi imo mɛnɛ makainedje misala na bomoto bo Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ie">Bikenge binɛnɛ bi buku:</para>
  <para style="iex">Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Matayo bodii bokabanake na bikenge binɛnɛnɛnɛ bitano:</para>
  <para style="ili">Bileho ta ngomba (5, 1-7, 29).</para>
  <para style="ili">Elomu e batingami (9, 35-10, 42).</para>
  <para style="ili">Bikuanedji bi Bokumu bo busa (13, 1-52).</para>
  <para style="ili">Bato ba Bokumu bo busa (18, 1-35).</para>
  <para style="ili">Bokebedjama ta tina e bato ba ndango e mongi ko na bimbete bi suka e ngondo (23, 1-26, 1).</para>
  <para style="ie">Mondumba mobɔngedjama buku:</para>
  <para style="ili">1, 1-4, 11: Mbangi.</para>
  <para style="ili">4, 12-26, 46: Mosala mo Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ili">26, 47-28, 15: Sambi, bogwa ko bosisoa ta bogwa bo Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ili">28, 16-20: Batingami ta mɔɔngɔ na Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Bakɔkɔ ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3, 23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Indja buku e molɔngɔ mo bakɔkɔ ba Yesu Kilito, motitani o Dhapiti, ko na Abalayama.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abalayama abota Isaka, Isaka abota Yakobo, Yakobo abota Yudha ko na baana ba nango ba baami; <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yudha na Tamale babota Palɛsi na Djela, Pɛlɛsi abota Esilɔne, Esilɔne abota Alame; <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Alame abota Aminadabe; Aminadabe abota Nasɔni, Nasɔni abota Salamɔni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salamɔni na Laaba babota Boadji, Boadji na Luta babota Obɛdi, odaaka sange o Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Obɛdi abota Yese. Yese abota mokondji Dhapiti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Dhapiti na mwali o Ulia, babota Sɔlɔmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Sɔlɔmɔ abota Loboame, Loboame abota Abiya, Abiya abota Asa; <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa abota Yodjapate, Yodjapate abota Yolame, Yolame abota Odjiasi; <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Odjiasi abota Yotame, Yotame abota Akadje, Akadje abota Edjekiasi; <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Edjekiasi abota Manase, Manase abota Amɔni, Amɔni abota Yodjiasi; <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yodjiasi abota Yekonia ko na baana ba nango ta ehole ekweya bo ibuli ta Babilɔne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 2Ba 24, 12-16. </char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Ngɔngɔ dji bokɛɛ ta ibuli ta Babilɔne, Yekonia abota Seatiɛlɛ, Seatiɛlɛ abota Djolobabɛlɛ; <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Djolobabɛlɛ abota Abiude, Abiude abota Eliakime, Eliakime abota Adjɔle; <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Adjɔle abota Sadoke, Sadoke abota Akime, Akime abota Eliude; <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliude abota Eleadjale, Eleadjale abota Matani, Matani abota Yakobo; <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobo abota Yosepu, moomi o Malia, ko Malia adaaka nange o Yesu Kilito.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Enɔɔmɔ mbota doomi na inɛi donga Abalayama mbunoko ta dii Dhapiti, mbota doomi na inɛi donga ta dii Dhapiti mbunoko ta ibuli di Babilɔne ko mbota doomi na inɛi donga ta ibuli di Babilɔne mbunoko ta dii Kilito.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bobotama bo Yesu Kilito</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2, 1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Indja mondumba monɔɔmɔ ta bobotama bo Yesu Kilito. Nango Malia, adaaka mosamba mo Yosepu; boso bo boputoana bo bobo alwa deemi na ngulu e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Mosamba mo nde Yosepu, odaaka moto o bodju ko aipalaka bosambodja Malia ta boso bo bato; iboa atomba meko ebomoyanedja na mbombi. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Ta ehole elɛnɛkɛ yo modjɔ momina, obwɛndi o Kumu aso amoimania ta tei e ndjɔti ko abala nande bo: «Yosepu motitani o Dhapiti, pɛpɛ bobanga oko botomba Malia mwali o wɛ, modjɔ mo mwana odii ta sɔpɔ dji nde adongi ta dii Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Abotadea mwana moomi, ko omobakeadea kombe e Yesu, modjɔ mo edii yo moto osikoadea bato ta tei e pekato dji bobo.» <verse eid="MAT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Midjɔ imia misusu mikɔɔmɔ bɛngi bo eka ebala Kumu na ndjea e motɛli ekokedjame:<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />«Moseka odii pɛpɛ bodjeba baami alwadea deemi ko abotadea mwana moomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">ko bamobakeadea kombe e Emanuɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 7, 14.</char></note>.» Etingodjakadea bo «Ndjakomba engbanga na su».<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Asama sisoa Yosepu, akɔɔ oko ndenge emopa obwɛndi o Kumu mitindo ko atomba mwali o nde Malia. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Endelo baiputoana na nde mbunoko ta ehole e bota yo mwana moomi; Yosepu amobakea kombe e Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Banganga ba ndjɔtɔ badoi aindja Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobotama bo Yesu ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta mondumba mo Sam 16, 1. Bɛtɛlɛmɛ edii ngando e botama Dhapiti.</char></note>, e Yudhea, ta ehole e mokondji Elode, banganga ba ndjɔtɔ ba dɔɔngɔ dikangɔe modaakabusa badua ta Yelusalɛmɛ <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />ko baso bawadja bo: «Adii mokondji o Bayudha osabota bo djɔ? Modjɔ mo iso loɛni mondjɔtɔ o nde ta pamba ekangɔe modaakabusa ko loso lodoi akwa magbunda ta boso bo nde.» <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Ehole eoka mokondji Elode mwako momina, asatungea, engbanga emɔti na Yelusalɛmɛ mosusu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Aputoanedja banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ basusu ko na balehi ba mobeko, bɛngi abawadje esika ndani ebwani Kilito bobotama. <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, e Yudhea. Modjɔ mo ekomama na ndjea e motɛli bo:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“Ko wɛ, Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, ta ekenge e mokili mo Yudha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">odiiti mɛnɛ na taka e tɛtɔ ta tei e iputo di ngando dji Yudha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">modjɔ mo Mobanei omɔti aimanadea ta tei e wɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">odaadea abanea ekomi e mbi e Isalɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mik 5, 1.</char></note>.” »<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Iboa Elode abea banganga ba ndjɔtɔ na mbombi ahombaka bɛngi bamodjebedje ehole eimana mondjɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Ngɔngɔ djimina abaloma ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ko abala na bu bo: «Kɛɛ asipoeni midjɔ misusu bopele mɛnɛ ta tina e mwana; ehole emotaneadea ino oso odoeni atɔndeanini, bɛngi mbi pongono nakɛe amokumea.»<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobo bosola na mokondji, baso bakɛɛ. Enakoboa mondjɔtɔ oɛnɛkɛ bo ta dɔɔngɔ dikangɔe modaakabusa adalaka boso bo bobo, asamayo imea ta diko di esika edaka mwana, aso aema. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Asama bo ɛɛnɛ mondjɔtɔ, baluma na sepi enɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Bakwea ta ndako ko baɛnɛ mwana na nango, Malia. Ko bakwa ta mako ma nde bɛngi bamokumee; badipoa tɔmbi epeaka bo ko bamobondjea wolo, paka e malasi ko na mile. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Ndjakomba abainedja na ndjɔti bo badae pɛpɛ bosɔmbɔ naikina ta dii Elode, basɔmbɔ ta ekomi e bobo na ndjea ebuki.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosepu na Malia bati na Yesu ta Edjipito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Ngɔngɔ dji boyana bo banganga ba ndjɔtɔ, obwɛndi o Kumu aimanea Yosepu ta ndjɔti ko aso abala na nde bo: «Angɔɔ, tomba mwana na nango, ko tia ta Edjipito dikama iho mbunoko ehole eobaleakadea mbi ohule. modjɔ mo Elode ahombadea mwana bɛngi amoowoe.» <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Yosepu aangɔ, atomba mwana na nango na bulu, ko atia ta Edjipito. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Ko adikama iho mbunoko ehole egwa Elode. Midjɔ imia mikɔɔmɔ bɛngi eka ebala Kumu na ndjea e motɛli ekokedjame bo: «Donga ta Edjipito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ose 11, 1.</char></note> nabea mwana o mbi.»<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elode aowedji baana ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Ta ehole eɛnɛ Elode bo banganga ba ndjɔtɔ bamokosei, aluma na kɛlɛ enɛnɛ. Apa mitindo ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ko ta ngando dji mbuti mbuti bo, baowoe baana baami basusu bobanga bianga bibae mbunoko botita; ta ngɔngɔ dji ehole iyena eokanaka iyo na banganga ba ndjɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Iboa midjɔ mibala motɛli Yilimia mikokedjama:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />«Moholi mookama ta Lama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">biyo ko na miyeano minɛnɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Edii wɛtoko Lasɛlɛ moto oyeakadea baana ba nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">aipala bato bamogɔmbedje ta tina ebo baana ba nde badiiti naikina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yel 31, 15.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihule di Edjipito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Ngɔngɔ dji yogo e Elode, obwɛndi o Kumu aimanea Yosepu ta ndjɔti ta Edjipito. <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />Ko abala na nde bo: «Angɔɔ tomba mwana na nango ko yana ta ekomi e Isalɛlɛ, modjɔ mo bato bahombaka baowoe mwana bagwi.» <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Iboa Yosepu aangɔ, atomba mwana na nango ko ayana ta ekomi e Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Endelo ehole eoka iyo bo Alekelausi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alekelausi: mwana moomi ko motitani o Elode o Monɛnɛ; akondja banga yanga e ba 4 boso bo bobotama bo Yesu Kilito mbunoko ta yanga e 6 ngɔngɔ dji bobotama bo Yesu kilito.</char></note> aimea mokondji ta Yudhea ta polo e sango Elode abanga bokɛɛ iho. Amayo tɔndeama na Ndjakomba ta ndjɔti, aso ayana ta Galileya. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Ko akɛɛ adikama ta ngando enɛnɛ ebeakabo Nadjalɛtɛ bɛngi bo eka ebalama na batɛli ekokedjame: «Bamobeabi moto o Nadjalɛtɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">moto o Nadjalɛtɛ: adii moto omɔti odonga ta Nadjalɛtɛ. Kombe iyeye ebeamaka ta tina boinedja Yesu (boɛngɛ Mat 21, 11) ko djikamoaka ta boinedja pongono bakilito ba boso (Bik 24, 5). </char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Eleho e Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mal 1, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3, 1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoa 1, 19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Yoane Mobatisi aimana ngɔngɔ dji masu manɛnɛ, ko aso alehaka ta etengelenge e Yudhea: <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />«Sɔmbɔtɔnɔni milema, modjɔ mo Bokumu bo busa bodii mbuti!» <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yoani edii moto iyona obalaka motɛli Isaya bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">«Moholi momɔti mogamakadea ta etengelenge bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">Bɔngedjani ndjea e Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">ninodjani ndjea dji nde dji kɛkɛkɛkɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 40, 3. </char></note>!»<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yoane adaaka na esendja e ngungi dji tito okabee bo kamela ko na mosenge mo yobo e tito ta bongo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 2Ba 1, 8.</char></note>; ayakaka katangenge na mosua mo pɔki. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Iboa bato ba Yelusalɛmɛ, bato ba Yudhea basusu ko bato ba ekenge e mokili mo mbuti mbuti na madiba ma Yɔlɔdane basusu bakɛkɛ ta dii yo. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Ko batubeaka pekato dji bobo, ababatisaka ta madiba ma Yɔlɔdane.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Iyana aɛnɛ Yoane bo Bapalisai banɛnɛ ko na Basadukai badoi atomba batisimo; abala na bu bo: «Ibota di mimbitɔ moto ndani oinedjini mondumba mobotia ta kɛlɛ e kɛkɛ adoe? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Botani mbuma djibwani boinedja bo osɔmbɔtɔnini mida mi bino <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />ko pɛpɛ bolɛdjɛni ko na bobala bo: “Abalayama adii kɔkɔ o biso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Yoane 8, 33, 37, 39.</char></note>.” Modjɔ mo naotɔndeakadeani bo Ndjakomba abwani boimedja batitani ba Abalayama ta tei e mabanga imimi. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Soka esi bokwea ta nginga dji mele: mole mosusu modii pɛpɛ bobota mbuma dji pele mokwɛlɛmɛdea ko motumbamadea ta mosa. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Mbi naobatisakadeani na madiba, ta tina e bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ mida; endelo Iyona okɛkɛ adoe ngɔngɔ dji mbi anɔi mbi na bopilo. Ko mbi nabwaniti nongo bolodja mikpulu mi sapato dji nde: iyo aobatisadeani na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko na mosa. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Apeli inyɔngɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edii ekɔmeli e miino ondingo ikanya ekakɔmedje ta tina bonyɔngɛlɛ ble bɛngi ekabanake mbuma na poso. </char></note> ta ebɔ e nde, ta tina e bosɛnodja esabalaka, bɛngi adedje mbuma dji ble ta esika e mbombi, endelo atumbadea poso ta mosa mokadae pɛpɛ bodimea.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batisimo ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mal 1, 9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3, 21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Iboa Yesu adonga ta Galileya ko akɛɛ ta Yɔlɔdane, bɛngi Yoane amobatise. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Endelo Yoane alonaka modjɔ momina ko abala bo: «Edii wɛtoko mbi moto odaki na posa bo nadie batisimo ta dii wɛ ko wɛ odoi ta dii mbi!» <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Endelo Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Yɛɛ bo ekɔɔme oko boa edɛdiyeye. Modjɔ mo edii bopele ta tina e biso bokokedja midjɔ misusu mi bodju.» Iboa aso akina ekɔɔme oko boa. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Asamatomba Yesu batisimo, ko na boduboa ta madiba. Iboa busa bodipoama tina e nde: Aɛnɛ Mwembo mo Ndjakomba botita ondingo embenga ko botita ta diko di nde. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Ko moholi momɔti modonga ta busa mobala bo: «Iyoo adii Mwana o mbi o epaeli; nasepi na nde bobuke mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndj 2, 7; Isa 42, 1.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu amekami</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mal 1, 12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4, 1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Iboa Yesu atombama na Mwembo ta etengelenge, bɛngi amekame na djabulu. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Ngɔngɔ dji bokɔ mongilo mo masu tuku inɛi na bulu ko tuku inɛi na moi, aso aoka ndja. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Momeki adua adii yo ko aso abala bo: «Okadaa Mwana o Ndjakomba, pa mitindo bɛngi mabanga imimi maimee mwɛmbɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yesu asɔmbedji bo: «Ekomama bo: “Moto abwaniti bohela oto na mwɛmbɛ, endelo na mobalo mosusu mokaimane ta monɔkɔ mo Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dit 8, 3.</char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Iboa djabulu amotomba mbunoko ta ngando e nɛnɛ esɛnɔke, amobakea ta sɔngɔ e tepelo <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />ko aso abala na nde bo: «Okadaa Mwana o Ndjakomba, sadumba nase; modjɔ mo ekomama bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“Apadea babwɛndi ba nde mitindo tina e wɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">ko baotombadea ta mɔmɔ ma bobo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">ta botiedja bo eko ewɛ esakalana na ibanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 91, 11-12.</char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Ekomama pongono bo: “Obwaniti bomeka Kumu Ndjakomba o wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dit 6, 16.</char></note>.” »<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Djabulu amotomba naikina ta diko di ngomba enɔkɔ boyai, amoinedja bokondji bosusu bo ngondo ko na bikumu bi dju, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />ko abala na nde bo: «Naopadea leka ilulu losusu okakwa magbunda ta mako ma mbi bɛngi okumeeni.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Iboa Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Satana donga ena! Modjɔ mo ekomama bo: “Obwani bokwa magbunda oko ta boso bo Kumu Ndjakomba o wɛ ko boangɔnɔ oko iyo mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dit 6, 13.</char></note>.” » <verse eid="MAT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Iboa djabulu amokina ko babwɛndi baso badua ko bamokɔmedjaka.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abangi mosala mo nde ta Galileya</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mal 1, 14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4, 14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Ta ehole eoka Yesu bo baisi Yoane ta bɔlɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yoane aisama ta bɔlɔkɔ: edii wɛtoko Yoane Mobatisi. Boindja ta 14, 3.</char></note>, akɛɛ ta Galileya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Akina Nadjalɛtɛ ko aso akɛɛ adaa ta Kapalanaume edii ta mokula mo ibeke di Galileya, ta ekenge e mokili mo Djabuloni ko Nepitali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Djabuloni ko Nepitali: mabota ma boso mabae ma Isalɛlɛ.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Ekɔmɔ iboa bɛngi ekokedjame mondumba mobala motɛli Isaya bo:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />«Ekenge e mokili mo Djabuloni, ko na ekenge e mokili mo Nepitali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">ta pamba e ibeke, dɔɔngɔ di kina di Yɔlɔdane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">Galileya ta polo ekadikame bato ibia badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Bato ibia bakadae ta tei e modidi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">baɛni bohu bonɛnɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Ko ibia bakahelame ta tei e modidi mo ekomi e bato bago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">bohu bo baimanei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 8, 23–9, 1.</char></note>!»<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Oko ta ehole emina, Yesu abanga botɔndea bo: «Sɔmbɔtɔnɔni midaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmbɔtɔnɔni midaa: ta mobala mokina sɔmbɔtɔnɔni malɛi kaoko sɔmbɔtɔnɔni milema.</char></note> mi bino, modjɔ mo Bokumu bo busa bodii mbuti!»<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei batingami ba boso</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mal 1, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5, 1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu adalaka ta mokula mo ibeke di Galileya, aɛnɛ menga babae, Simona iyona akabeebo Petelo, ko mwana o nango Andele; badaaka baoweli baswi ko badumbaka modjanga ta ibeke. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesu aso abala na bu bo: «Tingamani ngɔngɔ dji mbi ko naoimedjadeani bahombeli ba bato.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Na mbala emɔti, bakina midjanga mi bobo ko baso bakimana Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Asama bo dala naikina moo bohali ko Yesu aɛnɛ baami bakina babae, Djake mwana o Djebede, na Yoane mwana o nango badaaka na sangwabu ta bwato babɔngedjaka midjanga mi bobo. Yesu aso ababea; <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Na mbala emɔti, bakina bwato bo bobo ko na sangwabu bakimana Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alehi ko aheledji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu akweanaka ta Galileya mosusu, alehaka ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ dji Bayudha, atɔndɔkɔ Bwɛndi Bopele bo Bokumu ko aheledjaka bato na bego dji bobo djisusu ko na biɛmɛ dji bobo djisusu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Gala e nde enangana ta ekomi e Silia mosusu, ko bamolwɛkɛ bato ba bego tungu na tungu na bato ba minɔngɔ: bato ba membo mibe, bato ba mako makatatake; ko na bato ba bego dji kpukpukpu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">epeko e kpukpukpu: moto okapeke na yogo e misisa mi molo mikasatubane ko na isiesie (Boindja Mat 4, 24 ko na nase).</char></note> basusu Yesu abaheledja. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Emumu e bato banɛnɛ bamokimana, bodonga ta Galileya, ta Dekapole, ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ta Yudhea ko ekenge e mokili edii ta dɔɔngɔ di kina di Yɔlɔdane.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Bileho tina e bodieli ta diko di ngomba (bikenge binɛnɛ 5-7)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Ta ehole eɛnɛ Yesu bimumu bi bato, aso aiweya ta diko di ngomba ko aso adaa na mobondo. Batingami ba nde basalinda mbuti na nde <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Iboa aso abanga bobaleha bo:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Bodieli bo sooti mɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6, 20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />«Mongandi ta dii bakwali ba mwembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:3">modjɔ mo Bokumu bo busa bodii bo bobo!<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Mongandi ta dii ibia bayeakadea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:4">modjɔ mo badaadea bagɔmbedjamake!<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Mongandi ta dii ibia badii na milema mititatake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:5">modjɔ mo basangoabi kpɔtɔ!<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Mongandi ta dii ibia badii na ndja ko na posa e bodju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:6">modjɔ mo bagolabi!<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Mongandi ta dii ibia badii na pɛhɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:7">modjɔ mo badiabi pɛhɛ!<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Mongandi ta dii ibia badii na molema mosɛnɔke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:8">modjɔ mo baɛnɛbi Ndjakomba!<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Mongandi ta dii ibia bakahombe bogo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:9">modjɔ mo babeamabi baana ba Ndjakomba!<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Mongandi ta dii ibia banɔngɔmɔkɔdea ta tina e bodju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:10">modjɔ mo Bokumu bo busa bodii bo bobo!<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Mongandi tadii ino ta ehole eosingakadeani bo, baonɔngedjakadeani ko babalakadea na nu bobe ta mindumba misusu ta tina e mbi. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Sepani ko daani na mongandi, modjɔ mo iputi i bino idadea inɛnɛ ta busa. Edii oko mondumba momina momɔti monɔngedjabo batɛli banɔɔ boso bo bino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 2Kl 36, 16; Bik 7, 52.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Monana ko na bohu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mal 9, 50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14, 34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />«Ino bato badii monana mo ngondo. Endelo monana mokasia edjɛ e mu, babwani bosɔmbedja edjɛ emina mondumba nda? Etungi oko bamodumbe sokolu ko bamodalakake na mako.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />«Ino odiini bohu bo ngondo. Ngando enɛnɛ iyena ebaki ta diko di ngomba ebwaniti bobolama. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Tebabwanedjake molinda bɛngi bamoise ta nase dji poke, endelo bakamobakee ta ebakeli e mu, ko bɛngi moinedje bohu tadii bato basusu ibia badii ta tei e ndako <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Ta tina emina, yɛɛ bo bohu bo bino bongɛse ta boso bo bato, bɛngi bo baɛnɛ mikɔ mi bino mipele ko bakumedje Sangwanu odii ta busa.»<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho e Yesu ta tina e mobeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />«Pɛpɛ bolɛdjɛni bo mbi nadoa ta tina e bodongedja Mobeko kaoko bileho bi batɛli. Naidoa amodongedja endelo akokedja. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Modjɔ mo naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: boso bo diko na kpɔtɔ bodimoa pɛpɛ nongo itɔnɔ imɔti ta makomi kaoko molɔngɔ momɔti mobwani bohakoama ta mobeko, mbunoko midjɔ misusu mikokedjame <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Ta tina emina, moto iyona odabi pɛpɛ bosuma nongo elomu emɔti enɔi na bokɛkɛ ko alehi bato bakina bakɔe boa, adaabi moto o pɛpɛ tɛtɔ ta Bokumu bo busa. Endelo iyona osumabi ko olehabi bato bakina bakɔe boa bamoimedjabi monɛnɛ ta Bokumu bo busa. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Modjɔ mo, nabalakadea na nu bo: bodju bo bino bomiti nɔɔ ibua bo balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalisai otakweabini ta Bokumu bo busa.»<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho e Yesu ta tina e kɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />«Ookani ebalama na bakɔkɔ bo: “Otaowabi moto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boi 20, 13; Dit 5, 17.</char></note>; moto mosusu obwani boowa moto atungi asambedjame.” <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Endelo mbi naotɔndeakadeani sooti bo: moto mosusu obwani bokangea mina nde kɛlɛ atungi bosambedjama; moto iyona osingadea mina nde: “Endanga!” Asambedjamadea ta boso bo Ikita dinɛnɛ; iyona obaladea na mina nde bo: “Moto o igboma!” Adumbamadea ta mosa mo ipelu. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Ekadaa bo okapa ibondja di wɛ ta etumbelo, ko iho okalɛnɛ bo odii na modjɔ na mwangwao, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />kina ibondja di wɛ ta boso bo etumbelo, ko pete kɛɛ boso abɔngedja na mwangwao, ngɔngɔ djimina oso odoe apa ibondja di wɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />«Okadaa na modjɔ na moloni o wɛ, bɔngedja pɛpɛlɛ mɛnɛ na moto odii na wɛ na modjɔ ta ehole edii ino oko na ndjea. Esakadaa bo aopunde ta dii ba djudji basakaoimedja ta dii mbulu bahindo ko basakaoisa ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Naotɔndeakadea sooti mɛnɛ bo: Otaimanadea iyana omiti puta nyongo e wɛ mbunoko ta pata e palanga e suka.»<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho e Yesu ta tina e bɔɔli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />«Ookani babala bo: “Otakɔkɔɔbini bɔɔli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boi 20, 14; Dit 5, 18.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Endelo mbi, nabalakadea na nu bo: Moomi mosusu omungoi mwali akɔi na nde bɔɔli ehele ta molema mo nde. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ekadaa diiso di wɛ di ebɔ e baami di olomakadea ta pekato, didongedja ko di dumba bohali na wɛ: modjɔ mo edii bopele otake nongo e nama ewɛ emɔti e mokuku ka te bo mokuku mosusu mo wɛ modumbame ta ipelu. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Ekadaa bo ebɔ e wɛ e baami eolomakadea ta pekato, elena ko edumba bohali na wɛ: modjɔ mo edii bopele ta tina e wɛ botaka enama e wɛ emɔti e mokuku endelo te bokɛɛ mokuku mosusu ta ipelu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho e Yesu ta tina e bobɔtɔ bo moki</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19, 9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mal 10, 11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16, 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />«Ebalama pongono bo: “Moomi odongedji mwali o nde amopɛ mokanda mo bobɔtɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dit 24, 1.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Endelo mbi, naotɔndeakadeani sooti bo: moomi mosusu odongedji mwali o nde, dongedja oko akamodia na modjɔ motingi na bɔɔli adjebe bo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 18, 6-18.</char></note>, amodipoi ndjea e bokɔɔ bɔɔli, ko moomi iyona oasɔi mwali odongedji bo ta moki akɔi pongono bɔɔli.»<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho e Yesu ta tina e seleka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />«Ookani pongono ebalama ta dii bakɔkɔ bo: “Pɛpɛ bokata seleka e bokuta, endelo kokedja ndikano e dikanedja wɛ na ndjea e seleka ta boso bo Kumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 19, 12; Mit 30, 3; Dit 23, 22-24. </char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Endelo, mbi nabalakadea na nu odaeni pɛpɛ bokata nongo seleka e mɔti: edae ta kombe e busa, ta tina ebo busa bodii kiti e bokumu bo Ndjakomba; <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />edae ta kombe e kpɔtɔ, ta tina ebo kpɔtɔ djidii esika ebakeli e mako ma nde, edae ta kombe e Yelusalɛmɛ elɔkɔ ebo edii ngando enɛnɛ e Mokondji o monɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Pɛpɛ bokata nongo seleka ta molo mo wɛ mɛnɛ, modjɔ mo obwaniti boimedja moswee mo wɛ momɔti mombwi isa bomoimedja mohindo. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Yɛɛ bo, modhimo mo wɛ modae “modhimo”, ko ngasa edikame oko “ngasa”, modjɔ mo mobalo mosusu mobwani bobakeama modongi ta dii Mokosi.»<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho e Yesu ta tina e bobukanedja</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6, 29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />«Ookani ebalama bo: “Diiso tina e diiso ko diino tina e diino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boi 21, 24; Lew 24, 20; Dit 19, 21.</char></note>”. <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Endelo, mbi nabali na nu bo pɛpɛ bobukanedjani bobe ta dii moto o bobila. Moto akaoboma epapata ta mobanga mo baami, mopa pongono mobanga mo bali. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Moto akapala aopunde ta dii badjudji tina e botomba simisi e wɛ, mopa pongono mokoto mo wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Ekadaa bo moto aolomi na ngulu odale kilomɛtɛlɛ emɔti bodala engbanga emɔti na nde kilomɛtɛlɛ ibae. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Pa eka ta dii moto oowadjakadea; pɛpɛ bodaa na molema mopipo ta dii moto iyona opalakadea bobeka eka ta dii wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho e Yesu ta tina e epaeli e baloni</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6, 27-28</ref>.<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />«Ookani ebalama bo: “Pala mina wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lew 19, 18.</char></note> ko lona moloni o wɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Endelo, mbi naotɔndeakadeani sooti bo: Palani baloni ba bino ko angɔnɔni ta tina e bato ibia bakaonɔngedjeni. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Na boa odadeani baana ba Sangwanu iyona odii ta busa. Modjɔ mo akayedje busa ta tina e bato bapele ko na babe, ko akadumbe mbua ta tina e bato ba bodju ko na ibia ba taka e bodju. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Modjɔ mo okapalani ibia bakaopaleni tɛtɔ mɛnɛ ebolodjadea ino nda? Baputedji ba puti te bakɔe pongono iboa! <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Ko okaiseanani oto na denga di bino, modjɔ mo bokamwa mɛnɛ mokɔi ino nda? Bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha te bakɔe ibo bɛnɛ pongono iboa! <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Naboa, odaadeani bato babwanake, oko mondumba modii Sangwanu odii ta busa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Lew 19, 2; Dit 18, 13.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s2">Eleho e Yesu ta tina e makabo ma bakwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />«Kebani, pɛpɛ bokɔɔni oko bodju bo bino ta miso ma bato, bɛngi baonɛni. Emiti daa boa, otadiabini iputi di Sangwanu odii ta busa. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Okapa ikabo di pɛhɛ ta dii bakwali, pɛpɛ bohueya mondulɛ, mondumba mokakɔe bato ba ndango e mongi ta tei e ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha ko na ndjea: bɛngi bato ba babakumedje. Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: Babolodji iputi di bobo ehele. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Endelo okapa ikabo di pɛhɛ, ebɔ ewɛ e bali edae pɛpɛ bodjeba eka ekɔkɔdea ebɔ e baami. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Iboa etungi ikabo di wɛ di pɛhɛ ipame ta mbombi; ko Sangwao, iyona okaɛnɛ midjɔ mi mbombi, aopute.»<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho e Yesu ta tina e miɔngɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11, 2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />«Ehole eangɔnɔkɔdea ino, pɛpɛ bodani ondingo bato ba ndango e mongi: ibia bakasepe boangɔnɔkɔ ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ baemamaki ko na ta matano ma ndjea djinɛnɛnɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Luk 18, 10-14.</char></note> bɛngi bato babaɛnɛke. Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: badiabi iputi di bobo ehele. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Endelo wɛ, okapala boangɔnɔ, kwea ta ekenge e wɛ e ndako, dipa modipe ko angɔnɔ Sangwao odii ta esika e mbombi; ko Sangwao okaɛnɛ ta mbombi, aoputadea.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />«Ta ehole eangɔnɔkɔdea ino, pɛpɛ botubani milɔkɔ miyai miyai ondingo bato ibia badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha: ibia baka dingedje bo babwani bobaokea bato na milɔkɔ miyai miyai. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Pɛpɛ bobakwanani, modjɔ mo Sangwanu adjebakadea eka ndani ekambakadea na nu boso bo bo omowadjeni. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Indjani mondumba ndani mobwani na nu boangɔnɔkɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">“Sangwasu odii ta busa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">yɛɛ bo Kombe e wɛ edae esɛnɔke,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />yɛɛ bo Bokumu bo wɛ bodoe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">yɛɛ bo bolulea bowɛ bokɔme iyaya ta kpɔtɔ ondingo ta busa.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Lopa busabubu boyaka bo biso boengi busa.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Loyɛɛ na mabe ma biso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:12">ondingo aka yɛɛ iso ibia bakalokɔe bobe.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Pɛpɛ bolokina oko lokwee ta tei e mameko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">endelo lotingoa ta bobe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">[Ta tina ebo adii wɛ edina bokumu, bopilo, ko na ekumu kɔbili na kɔbili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makomi madii ta ndanda e kolosɛ, obwaniti bomatanea ta makomi mayou. Boindja 1Kl 29, 11-13. </char></note>.]”<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />«Modjɔ mo okama yɛɛni bato na pekato dji bobo, Sangwanu odii ta busa aoyɛɛbini pongono. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Endelo omiti yɛɛni bato, Sangwanu ataoyɛɛbini pongono pekato dji bino.»<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho e Yesu ta tina e mongilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />«Ta ehole ekɔino mongilo, pɛpɛ bodaani na boso bo ndjokwa mondumba mokakɔe bato ba ndango e mongi: bakainedje ndjokwa ta mbanda dji bobo bɛngi bainedje moto mosusu bo badii ta mongilo. Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: babolodja iputi i bobo ehele. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Endelo ta ehole esakɔɔ wɛ mongilo, sopea malasi ta molo mo wɛ ko sosa boso bo wɛ, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />bɛngi bato badae pɛpɛ bodjeba bo odii ta mongilo. Endelo dongedja oko Sangwao odii iho, ta esika e mbombi, ko Sangwao, okaɛnɛ, ta mbombi aoputadea.»<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Bodieli bo busa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12, 33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />«Pɛpɛ boboleani oko bodieli iyaya ta kpɔtɔ, ta polo ebwani sɛɛ na ngusu bonɛlɛkɛkɛ, ta polo ebwani baibi bobuka bɛngi baibe. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Endelo boleani bodieli bobino wɛtoko ta busa, iho abwani sɛɛ na ngusu bodaa pɛpɛ bonɛlɛkɛkɛ kaoko, baibi babwaniti bobuka bɛngi baibe. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Modjɔ mo iho ta polo edii bodieli bo wɛ, molema mo wɛ modaadea oko iyana.»<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Diiso didii bohu bo mokuku</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11, 34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />«Diiso didii molinda mo mokuku. Diiso di wɛ dikada bopele, mokuku mo wɛ mosusu modadea na bohu; <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />endelo diiso di wɛ dikadaa na epeko, mokuku mo wɛ moimeadea na modidi. Ekadaa bo bohu ibubu bodii ta tei e wɛ boimei modidi, modidi momina modaadea mopipo mɛnɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ndjakomba kaoko palanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16, 13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />«Pɛpɛ moto omɔti obwani bosalea bakumu babae: modjɔ mo ndelo ekina alonadea omɔti kaoko apaladea okina; kaoko aokanadea na omɔti ko atsioladea okina. Obwanitini bosalea Ndjakomba ko na Palanga engbanga emɔti.»<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Boisa molema ta dii Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk 12, 22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />«Ta tina emina naotɔndeakadeani bo: Pɛpɛ bosatungeanioko ta tina e bomɔ bo bino, na eka eyakadea ino kaoko eka emwakadea ino, kaoko esendja e bolwa ta mokuku. Bomɔ bonɔi mia maboyaka ko mokuku monɔi bisendja, ediiti oko iboa? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Pete indjani mbulu ba diko: te baane ko te babuke mbuma, badiiti na bibombelo bi mbuma, endelo Sangwanu odii ta busa akabayakedje! Iboa ino onɔitini mbulu na tɛtɔ? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Omina obwani bobakea nongo moo ehole mokɛkɛ ta bomɔ bo nde ta tei e bino ta tina e miyeano mi nde nda?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />«Ko tina ndani ebwani na nu bosatungea ta tina e bisendja? Indjani mondumba mokakandoe pulɛlɛ dji gbie: te djisale ko te djitonge bisendja. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Enakoboa naotɔndeakadeani sooti bo edae nongo Sɔlɔmɔ, ta tei e ekumu e nde esusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1Ba10.</char></note>, ailwa esendja epele ondingo pulɛlɛ emɔti ta tei e dju. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Iboa ko Ndjakomba alwadjakadea ndjani dji gbie idii iya busɛbubu puma badjidumbi ta mosa: abwaniti bokɔɔ na bonɔɔ ta tina e bino? Bato ba bodhima bokɛkɛ! <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Iboa pɛpɛ bosatungeani oko na bobala bo: “Eyakadea iso nde? Emwakadea iso nde? Elwadea iso nde?” <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Iyena esusu edii leka lokahombe bato bakadae pɛpɛ bodjeba Ndjakomba na pɛpɛ boɛmbɛ. Modjɔ mo Sangwanu odii ta busa adjebakadea bo odiini na posa na lu. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Hombani boso mɛnɛ Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ko na bodju bo nde, iboa ilua losusu losadika lopamadea na nu. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Ta tina emina pɛpɛ bosatungea na disu di puma: ta tina e bo puma esatungeadea iyo mɛnɛ. Engi busa na momina moya.»<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s2">Pɛpɛ bosambedja bato bakina</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6, 37-38</ref>.<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />«Pɛpɛ bosambedjani binanu, bɛngi bo badae pɛpɛ bosambedjani. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Modjɔ mo baosambedjabini oko mondumba mosambedjakadea ino binanu; ko baongɛbini oko na mwɛngi imua mokaengɛe na nu bato bakina. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Tina ndani oɛnɛkɛdea ebumbu e epɛtɛ edii ta diiso di mwangwao, ko otaɛnɛkɛdea ibaya isulu idia idii ta diiso di wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Kaoko ndenge ndani obwani bobala na mwangwao bo: “Amba nadongedje ebumbu e epɛtɛ edii ta diiso di wɛ”, enakoboa ibaya i sulu idii ta diiso di wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Moto o ndango e mongi, dongedja boso mɛnɛ ibaya di sulu ta diiso di wɛ iboa ngɔngɔ oso odjebedea bodongedja ebumbu e epɛtɛ edii ta diiso di minɔ.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />«Pɛpɛ bopani mia madjongoamake ta dii mbwa, basaka sɔmbɔ bootswani; ko pɛpɛ bodumbani leka lo bino lomotswiya ta boso bo ngulu modjɔ mo basaka lodalakaka.»<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ingbangba ta miɔngɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11, 9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />«Wadjani ko baopadeani; hombani ko odiadeani; bomani modipe ko bamoodipoadeani. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Ta tina ebo moto mosusu owadjabi bamopaabi, iyona ohombabi abolodjabi ko iyona obwani boboma ta modipe bamodipoabi. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Moto ndani ta ndanda e bino obwani bopa mwana o nde ibanga akamowadja mwɛmbɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Kaoko iyona obwani apɛ mwana o nde epakapengi akamowadja moswi? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Ko ekadaabo ino bato babe odjebini bopa leka lopele ta dii baana ba bino. Ndenge ndani Sangwanu iyoo odii ta busa abwaniti bopa leka lopele ta dii ibia bamowadjakadea!<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />«Ino pongono kɔɔni ta dii binanu eka ndani epalakadea ino baokɔeni: tina e bo iyena edii eleho e Mobeko ko e bileho bi Batɛli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Lom 13, 8-10.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho e modipe mo embamba</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13, 24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />«Kweani ta modipe mokɛkɛ modjɔ mo! Modipe monɛnɛ ko imua molomakadea bato ta bobedjama; endelo bato banɛnɛ bakweabi ta mu. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Endelo modipe mokɛkɛ kaoko edii ndjea iyena ekakɛe ta bomɔ edii ekototake; ko edii na bato bakɛkɛ ibia baka edie.»<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Batɛli ba bokuta</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6, 43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />«Kebani na batɛli ba bokuta. Bakɛkɛdea adoe ta dii ino bakalwae bisendja bɛngi baeɛnɛme olongo bhata endelo ta tei e bobo badii mɛɛnɛ swa baluma na kɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Obadjebabini na misala mi bobo. Ndenge ndani obwanini bodongedja mbuma dji vino ta mole mo ndjubɛ kaoko obuke mbuma dji pigi ta mole mo ndjubɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Mole mosusu mopele mokabote mbuma dji pele endelo mole mokadaa na yogo mokabote oko mbuma dji be. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Mole mo pele mobwaniti bobota mbuma djibe kaoko mole mo yogo mobwaniti bobota mbuma dji pele. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Mole mosusu mobwani bodaa pɛpɛ bobota mbuma dji pele ba molenadea ko bamodumbadea ta mosa. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Iboa, odjebadeani batɛli ba bokuta na mikɔ mi bobo.»<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Batingami ba sooti</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13, 25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />«Ediiti bo bato ibia bakabeeni “Kumu, Kumu”, bakweabi ta Bokumu bo busa, oko bato ibia bakakɔe bopala bo Sesa iyona odii ta busa. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Bato banɛnɛ babalabi na mbi ta busa ibua bo Sambi bo: “Kumu, Kumu, iso loitɛlɛkɛ na kombe e wɛ, ko loibenganaka membo mibe na kombe e wɛ ko loikɔɔkɔ midjɔ mi bokamoa minɛnɛ na kombe e wɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Naboa nabatɔndeabi bo: “Naiodjebani nongo; dongani mbuti na mbi bakɔmeli ba midjɔ mibe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndj 6, 9.</char></note>!” »<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ekuanedji e batongi ba ndako babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6, 47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />«Iboa, moto mosusu okadea mibalo imimi mibalakadea mbi ko akamisa ta mosala adadea ondingo moto o dii na ndjɛnɛ eyai osapika ndako e nde ta diko di mabanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Ta ehole ekwii mbua ipɛtɔ ko na mipɛpɛ mikwei ta ndako, endelo ndako ebukeiti, modjɔ mo ndako epiki ta diko di mabanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Endelo moto mosusu iyona ookadea mibalo mi mbi ko amisiti ta mosala adii ondingo endanga iyona opika ndako ta diko di djɛlɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Mbua akakwa, ipɛtɔ ko pwea ekumbi ta diko di ndako emina ko ekwi: enangani esusu.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bokondji bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Ta ehole esidja Yesu bobala mɛko imia, bato basusu bakamoa na bileho bimina; <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Modjɔ mo abalehaka na kpati esusu botikoana na mondumba mo balehaka balehi ba mobeko.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto o mabha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Ta ehole etita yo ta diko di ngomba, bimumu bi bato bamokimana. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Iboa moto o mabha omɔti asabatea mbuti na nde, akwa magbunda ta boso bo nde ko abala na nde bo: «Kumu, okapala obwani bosɛnodjani.» <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu aninodja ebɔ, amobɛndjɛ ko abala bo: «Napalakadea modjɔ momina, sɛnɔɔ!» Na mbala emɔti moto omina asɛnɔɔ na mabha ma nde. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Iboa Yesu abala na nde bo: «Hokamedja: pɛpɛ botɔndea moto modjɔ momina. Endelo kɛɛ asainedje ta dii nganga o Ndjakomba, ko pa mabondja bobwana na mobeko moloma Mose bɛngi bo edae tati ta miso ma bobo bo oheli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 14, 2-32.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji mosali o kapita omɔti o bosodha mokama</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7, 1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:43-54">Yoa 4, 43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Naboa ta ehole ekwea Yesu ta kapalanaume, kapita omɔti o bosodha mokama abatama mbuti na nde, amoangɔnɔ, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />ko abala bo: «Kumu, mosali o mbi asambi ta ndako, binama bi nde bikatatai ko apekakadea bobuke mɛɛnɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Mbi, nakɛkɛdea amoheledja.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Endelo kapita o basodha mokama asɔmbedja bo: « Kumu, nadiiti mobwanake bɛngi okwee ta ndako e mbi. Endelo bala oto kɔpi emɔti pɛ ko mosali o mbi aheladea. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Modjɔ mo mbi mɛnɛ nadii ta nase dji bokondji bo ibia banɔini ko nadii na bosodha badii ta nase dji bokondji bo mbi. Nakabala na omɔti bo: “Kɛɛ!” Ko adii bokɛɛ; nakabala na okina bo: “Doa!” Adii bodoa ko nakabala na mosali o mbi bo: “Kɔɔ iboo!” Adii bokɔɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Ehole eoka Yesu kɔpi emina akamwa bobuke ko abala na bato ibia bamohokamedjaka bo: «Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: napakina songana na moto o edhimeli mondumba imumu ta Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Naikina nabalakadea na nu, bato banɛnɛ badongabi ta pamba ekangɔe modaakabusa ko ta pamba ekasame modaakabusa bɛngi badae ta mesa na Abalayama, Isaka ko na Yakobo ta Bokumu bo busa. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Endelo basangoli ba Bokumu bo busa badumbamabi sokolu ta modidi, iho bayeabi ko bakpɛkɛnɛbi miino.»<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Iboa Yesu abala na kapita o basodha mokama bo: «Yana ta ndako ewɛ, yɛɛ bo ekɔɔme bobwana na bodhima bowɛ!» Oko ta ngonga emina mosali o nde aso ahela. <verse eid="MAT 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu akɛɛ naikina ta ndako e Petelo. Iho aso atanea bokiyo bo Petelo o mwali asambi na pɛpɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yesu amobɛndjɛ ta ebɔ ko pɛpɛlɛ eso emokina; aangɔ ko abanga bomokɔmedja.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Iyana aimea busa mɔkɔmɔkɔ, bamolwɛɛ bato banɛnɛ ba membo mibe. Oto na mobalo momɔti Yesu abengana membo mibe ko aheledja bato ba bipeko basusu. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Naboa ekokedjama oko mondumba mobalama na motɛli Isaya bo: «Atomba muna mo yɛɛmɛ dji biso ko aloheledja na bego dji biso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Isa 53, 4. </char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bato ibia bapali bokimana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Ta ehole eɛnɛ Yesu bimumu bi bato bamohiki, apaa mitindo bo bakatise ta dɔɔngɔ dikina di ibeke. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Molehi omɔti o mobeko adoa ko abala na Yesu bo: «Molehi, naokimanadea ta bisika bisusu binɔdea wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Bibanga badii na kota ko mbulu ba diko badii na moopo, endelo Mwana o moto adiiti na esika e bosambea molo.» <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Omɔti, ta tei e batingami ba nde, abala na nde bo: «Kumu, paani ndjea na pete kɛɛ apusea sesa.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Endelo Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Kimanani ko yɛɛ bo bato bago bapuseane ibo na ibo.»<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asii pweya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Yesu atitea ta bwato ko batingami ba nde baso bamokimana. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Na mbala emɔti, pweya ekumba ta ibeke, ko bibuku bi mbonge bikweaka ta bwato. Ko Yesu awɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Iboa batingami ba basalinda mbuti na Yesu ko bamosidja babala bo: «Kumu, loheledja! Lohombakadea logwɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Tina ndani ebangakadea na nu iboa? Bato ba bodhima bokɛkɛ!» Iboa aangɔ, agamea mipɛpɛ ko na mbonge, ko bogo boso bokwea. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Bato ibia badaaka ena baso bakamoa ko babalaka bo: «Imumu mondumba mo moto nda edae mipɛpɛ na bibuku bi mbonge lomosumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndj 65, 8; 89, 10; 107, 23-32.</char></note>?»<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato babae ba membo mibe</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mal 5, 1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8, 26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Ta ehole eimea yo ta dɔɔngɔ di kina di ibeke, ta ekenge e mokili mo Bagadhaliɛniɛsi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bagadhaliɛniɛ: Badii bato bakadae ta Gadala; Gadala edaaka ekenge e mokili e bato badaaka pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha ta kilomɛtɛlɛ 10 ta dɔɔngɔ di kasame modakabusa ta pamba e ibeke di Genedjalɛtɛ isa ta Galileya. </char></note>, bato babae ba membo mibe baimana ta makila badoa asongana na Yesu. Bato bamina badaaka na bobila ko bato badaaka babanga bonɔɔ ta ndjea emina. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Bagama bo: «Iso nawɛ modjɔ nda Mwana o Ndjakomba? Odoi iyaya alotungea boso bo ehole ebɔngedja bo?»<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Enakoboa, bwela bo ngulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 5, 11 ko na nase.</char></note> bodaaka boahua moo bohali. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Membo mibe mimina miangɔnɔkɔ Yesu bo: «Okapala olobengane loloma ta bwela ibuao bo ngulu.» <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Abala na bu bo: «Kɛɛni!» Membo mibe miimana ta dii bato ko mikwea ta dii ngulu. Na mbala emɔti, bwela bo ngulu bodonga ebango tomba diko di ngomba mbunoko ta ibeke ko ibo basusu badinda ta madiba. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Babanei ba ngulu bamina batia; ko bakɛɛ atɔndea ta ngando enɛnɛ midjɔ misusu minɔɔmɔkɔ na bato ba membo mibe babae batingoama. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Iboa bato ba ngando enɛnɛ basusu baimana asongana na Yesu; ehole e moɛnɛ bo bamoangɔnɔ bo aimane ta kpɔtɔ dji bobo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto o binama bikatatake</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mal 2, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5, 17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu atitea ta bwato, ko ameela naikina dua enɛnɛ akɛɛ ta ngando enɛnɛ e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta bokimana Mal 2, 1. Kapalanaume edii ondingo ngando enɛnɛ e Yesu. Boindja Mat 4, 13. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Bamolwɛɛ moto o binama bikatatake asambi ta diko di bokaki. Ta ehole eɛnɛ Yesu bodhima bo bobo, abala na moto o mako makatatake bo: «Sapingedja, mwana o mbi! Pekato dji wɛ djikutubani!» <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Enakoboa ndambo e balehi ba mobeko basabaleana ta milema mi bobo bo: «Moto iyo asingakadea Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Lew 24, 16.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yesu asipoa malɛi ma bobo ko abala na bu bo: «Odiini na malɛi mabe ta milema mi bino tina nda? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Modjɔ ndani monɔi bopɛtɛpɛtɛ ta tina e bobala bo: “Pekato dji wɛ djikutubani”, kaoko bobala bo: “Angɔɔ ko dala”? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Endelo bɛngi odjebeni bo Mwana o moto adii na bokondji bo bokutubanedja pekato ta kpɔtɔ.» Iboa abala na moto o binama bikatatake: «Angɔɔ, tomba bokaki bo wɛ ko yana ta ndako e wɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Moto omina aangɔ ko ayana ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ehole eɛnɛ bimumu bi bato iboa, biluma na bɔɔ, bakumedja Ndjakomba opa bato bokondji bo mondumba imua.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mal 2, 13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5, 27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu akina esika iyena ko adaaka akɛkɛ akɛe, aɛnɛ moto obeakabo Matayo adii ta bilo e puti. Abala na nde bo: «Kimanani!» Matayo aangɔ ko amokimana. <verse eid="MAT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Iyana adaaka Yesu ta mesa ta ndako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikomi di monɔkɔ mo Bagɛlɛki ibalakadea oto ndako. Endelo edii eapala bobala ndako e Matayo, endelo ediiti ndako e Yesu. Boɛngɛ Luk 5, 29.</char></note>, baputedji ba puti banɛnɛ ko na bato ba pekato badoaka adaa ta mesa engbanga emɔti na Yesu ko na batingami ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Amabo ɛnɛ iboa, Bapalisai bawadjaka na batingami ba nde bo: «Tina ndani molehi o bino ayakakadea na baputedji ba puti ko na bato ba pekato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ milɔngɔ mi 10-11 ko na Luk 15, 1-2.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Endelo Yesu aoka ko aso abala bo: «Bato ibia badii na mikuku mipele te bakambe na monganga endelo edii wɛtoko bato ba bipeko ibo bato bakakambe na monganga. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Kɛɛni aikoe tina e mibalo imimi: “Nakapale molema mo pɛhɛ bonɔɔ mbeka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ose 6, 6.</char></note>.” Modjɔ mo naidoa ta tina e bohomba bato ba bodju endelo bato ba pekato.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko na mongilo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mal 2, 18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5, 33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Iboa batingami ba Yoane badoa ko bawadja Yesu bo: «Tina ndani iso na Bapalisai lokakɔe mongilo, ko batingami ba wɛ te bakɔe mongilo?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Bato ibia babeami ta tina e tɛkɛ e moki babwani bodaa ta ilaka ta ehole edii moomi o moki ta ndanda e bobo? Naboa masu mangɔdjɔmɔdea moomi o moki; atadadea na bu naikina engbanga iboa baso bakɔebi mongilo.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />«Pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti obwani bola ebolo e esendja eyou na itina di esendja eyeene; ta tina ebo ebolo e esendja eyeene ealadea epasa e esendja eyou ko ipese di imeadea dinɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Te baise vino eyeene ta mbola djiyou; ta tina e bo mbola ebwani bobatoa, ko vino esopei ko mbola ibwani bobeha. Bakaise vino e yeene oko ta mbola eyeene ko boa losusu lobaneamadea bopele.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu anɔi epeko ko na yogo na ngulu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mal 5, 21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8, 40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ta ehole ebalaka Yesu iboa, mobanei omɔti o Bayudha asabatea ko akwa magbunda ta boso bo nde ko abalaka bo: «Mwana o mbi o mwali akɛkɛ ahule agwa oko edɛdiyeye; endelo doa abakee ebɔ e wɛ ta diko di nde ko aheladea naikina.» <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu aangɔ ko amokimana engbanga emɔti na batingami ba nde.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Enakoboa mwali omɔti, adaaka na yogo e botanga makiya, ko yogo e nde ekokedja bianga doomi na ibae, abatama ta sangɔngɔ dji Yesu ko abɛndjɛ sɔngɔ e esendja e nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Modjɔ mo asabaleaka bo: «Nakabɛndjɛ oto sɔngɔ e esendja e nde, naheladea». <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu ahombana, amoɛnɛ ko aso abala bo: «Sapingedja, mwana o mbi o mwali! Bodhima bo wɛ booheledji.» Oko ta ehole iyena, mwali aso ahela.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Ta ehole eimea Yesu ta ndako e mobanei, ko aɛnɛ iyo babomeli ba mindulɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babomi ba mindulɛ, bapakeaka bali adaaka na mosala mo boyeya na ndjokwa epipo ta ndako e ilaka e bangaka.</char></note> mikɛkɛkɛkɛ ko emumu e bato badaaka na moyeke ko na dhaka, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />abala na bu bo: «Imanani, modjɔ mo mwana mwali agwiti, awɛli hiɔ.» Endelo ibo bamosɛkɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Ta ehole eimana emumu e bato sokolu, Yesu akwea apea mwana mwali ta ebɔ, ko mwana mwali omina asisoa. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Gala enangana ta ekenge e mokili iyena esusu.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato ba miso mago babae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Ta ehole edaka Yesu akɛkɛanɔe, bato ba miso mago babae bamokimana na bogama bo: «Mwana o Dhapiti, lookea pɛhɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Ta ehole eimea Yesu ta ndako, bato ba miso mago basalinda mbuti na nde ko Yesu abala na bu bo: «Odiini na bodhima bo nabwani bokɔ midjɔ miwadjakadeani ino?» Basɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, lodhimi.» <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Iboa Yesu abapea ta miso ko abala bo: «Kinani bo ekɔɔme bobwana na bodhima bo bino!» <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Ko miso ma bobo madipoama. Iboa Yesu abakebedja bo: «Hokamedjani bopele, moto omɔti adae pɛpɛ bodjeba.» <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Endelo asamaboimana bonanganedja gala e nde ta ekenge e mokili iyena esusu.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji emimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Iyana aimanaka baami ibia babae, balwɛɛ Yesu moto o imea emimi modjɔ mo apeamaka na mwembo mobe. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Yesu abengana mwembo mobe, ko emimi aso abala. Ko emumu e bato eso eluma na bokamoa ko babalaka bo: «Loɛnɛkini modjɔ mondumba imumu ta tei Isalɛlɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Endelo Bapalisai babalaka bo: «Edii mokondji o membo mibe iyo moto omopakadea kpati e bobengana membo mibe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 12, 24.</char></note>!»<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aokei bimumu bi bato ndjokwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu anɔɔkɔ ta ngando djinɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na djikɛkɛkɛkɛ; alehaka ta ndako dji bobo dji miɔngɔnɔ atɔndɔkɔ Bwɛndi Bopele bo Bokumu ko aheledjaka bego djisusu ko na biɛɛmɛ bisusu. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Ama iyo ɛnɛ bimumu bi bato molema mo nde moso moluma na ndjokwa tina e bu, modjɔ mo badaaka batungeamake ta milema ko na bwɛmbu ondingo bhata ibia bataki mobaneli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mit 27, 17; 1Ba 22, 17. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Iboa abala na batingami ba nde bo: «Gbie edii enɛnɛ, endelo basali badii bakɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Angɔnɔni moswa gbie alome basali ta gbie e nde.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bapɔsɔlu doomi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mal 3, 13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu abea batingami ba nde doomi na babae ko abapa kpati e bobengana membo mi pita ko boheledja bipeko bisusu ko yɛɛmɛ djisusu. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Indja kombe dji bapɔsɔlu ba mina doomi na babae: boso mɛɛnɛ Simona okabeebo Petelo, ko Andele mwange o Petelo; Djake mwana moomi o Djebede, ko Yoane mwange o nde; <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Pilipo ko Balatelemi; Tomasi ko Matayo, moputedji o puti; Djake mwana moomi o Alipe, ko Tade; <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simona odaaka omɔti ta iputo di Badjeloti ko Yudhasi Isikaliote iyoo okaba Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elomu e bapɔsɔlu doomi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mal 6, 7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Iyena edii bato doomi na babae ba loma Yesu, ngɔngɔ dji bobapa mitindo imimi: «Pɛpɛ bokɛni oko ta dii bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha ko pɛpɛ bokweani ta ngando emɔti enɛnɛ e Samalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Endelo kɛɛni ta dii bhata ibia babungea ndjea ta bana ba Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Tɔndeani bato ndjea ndjea bo: “Bokumu bo busa bodii mbuti!” <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Heledjani bato ba bipeko, sisodjani bato bago, sɛnodjani bato ba mabha, benganani membo mibe. Obolodjini ngasa, pani pongono ngasa. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Ta tei dji mabenga ma bino pɛpɛ botombani wolo, pɛpɛ pata dji bibende ko na palanga dji boisa ta mosenge; <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />ta tina e mɔɔngɔ, pɛpɛ botombani tɔmbi, simisi dji bae, pɛpɛ botomba sapato edae pango. Ta tina e bo mosali atungi boyaka ta mosala mo nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 1Ko 9, 14; 1Ti 5, 18.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />«Ta ngando enɛnɛ esusu kaoko ngando ekɛkɛ ekweadea ino, hombani moto obwani boasɔni ko dikamani ta ndako e nde mbunoko ehole edongadea ino iyana. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Ko ehole ekweadea ino ta ndako emina baiseani na bobala bo: “Bogo bodae na nu.” <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Ndako emina ekabwana bo odikameni, yɛɛ bo bogo bo bino bodikame ena; endelo emiti bwana, bogo bo bino bosɔmbe ta dii ino. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Ehole eloni bo boasɔni ko bamiti oka mibalo mi bino, imanani ta ndako kaoko ta ngando enɛnɛ emina ko bhubholani idutu di bigbota bi bino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Mal 6, 11 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: Ta busa bo Sambi, etumbu e bato ba ngando enɛnɛ emina enɔɔbi ekenge e mokili mo Sɔdɔmɔ ko na Gomɔla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔdɔmɔ ko na Gomɔla: Boindja Mba 18-19.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Minɔngɔ mikɛkɛdea adoe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />«Mbi, naolomini ondingo bhata ta ndanda e swa. Daani na kebisi ondingo ndjɔ ko bwɛli ondingo embenga. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Tomakebani na bato, modjɔ mo baopundadeani ta sambi ko baobomadeani ta ndako dji bobo dji miɔngɔnɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Ta tina e mbi, baolokadeani ta boso bo bagupɛlɛnɛlɛ ko na bakondji; ta tina emina, edaadea bɛngi obaleni tati e mbi ta boso bo bobo ko ta boso bo bato ba bikomi bikina. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Endelo ehole eopundini ibo, pɛpɛ bosatungeani ta tina bohomba mondumba ndani mobwani nanu bosamba ko eka ebwani na nu bobala; midjɔ mibwani nanu bobala miopamadeani oko ta ehole emina: <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />modjɔ mo ino otabaladeani, endelo Mwembo mo Sangwanu mobaladea ta polo e bino. <verse eid="MAT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Mwange moto akababi mwanango ta yogo, sange o moto akababi mwana o nde; baana baleloabi na baboti ba bobo ko bakɔbi bo ba bapɛ etumbu e yogo. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Olonamabini na bato basusu ta tina e kombe e mbi. Endelo iyona oikabi molema tee mbunoko suka ahelabi. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Bakaonɔngedjani ta ngando enɛnɛ iyeye, tiani ta ngando enɛnɛ ekina. Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: otamadjadeani bosomba ta ngando djinɛnɛnɛnɛ djisusu dji Isalɛlɛ boso bo Mwana o moto adoe.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />«Motingami ta nɔe molehi o nde; edae mosali ta nɔe moswa nde. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Naboa etungi na motingami adae ondingo molehi o nde ko mosali adae ondingo moswa nde. Bakabea moswa ndako Bɛlɛdjɛbule <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɛlɛdjɛbule: kombe epa ibo na djabulu odii mokondji o milimo mibe.</char></note> edadea ndenge ndani na bato bakadikame ta ndako emina!»<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyona otungi bo bobanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12, 2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />«Ta tina emina pɛpɛ bobangani moto, modjɔ mo pɛpɛ eka emɔti ebolama etakabi bohuodjama, ko pɛpɛ eka emɔti e mbombi etakabi bodjebama. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Eka iyeye ebalakadea mbi nanu ta modidi, ebalani ta busa boyake; ko eka ebalakadea bo na popoli ta itoi, egamani ta mbalasani etonga bo diko di ndako. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Pɛpɛ bobangani ibii bakaowoe mokuku ko babwaniti boowa mwembo; bangani endelo Iyona obwani boowa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dja 4, 12.</char></note> mikuku ko na membo ta ipelu. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Te batɛke midengudengu babae na motswiya mo palanga djinɔi bokɛkɛ? Naboa pɛpɛ nongo omɔti ta tei e bobo obwani bokwa ta kpɔtɔ emiti daa Sangwanu adae pɛpɛ bopala. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Ta tina e bino, motswiya mo swee dji bino dji molo djisusu djidii djilangamake. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ta tina emina pɛpɛ bobangani, onɔini midengudengu basusu na motswiya.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bopa tati ta tina e Yesu Kilito kaoko bomoingana</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luk 12, 8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />«Moto mosusu otatolabi ta boso bo bato ta tina e mbi, mbi pongono natatolabi ta boso bo Sesa o dii ta busa; <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />endelo moto akainganeani ta boso bo bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 2Ti 2, 12.</char></note>, mbi pongono na moinganeadea ta boso bo Sesa o dii ta busa.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɛpɛ bogo, endelo etumba</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12, 51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14, 26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />«Pɛpɛ bolɛnɛni bo mbi nadoa aisa bogo ta kpɔtɔ: mbi naidoa aisa bogo, endelo nadoa aisa mɔmbi. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Adii mo oko boa, mbi nadoa abɔtodja mwana moomi na sango, mwana mwali na nango, mwali o moki na bokiyo bo nde o mwali; <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />moloni o moto edaabi oko bato ba ibota di nde iyo mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta milɔngɔ mi 35-36, boindja Mik 7, 6.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Moto akapala sango kaoko nango bonɔ mbi abɔngiti na mbi; moto akapala mwana o nde o moomi kaoko mwana o nde o mwali bonɔ mbi abɔngiti na mbi. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Moto odai pɛpɛ botomba ekulusu e nde ko akimaneni abɔngiti na mbi. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Moto opalakadea abolodje bomɔ bo nde abobungedjabi; ko moto obungedjabi bomɔ bo nde ta tina e mbi abobolodjabi.»<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maputi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mal 9, 41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />«Moto iyo oasɔini asɔi mba; ko moto iyo oasɔi mbi asɔi Iyona o lomani. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Moto oasɔi motɛli na kombe e motɛli adiabi iputi di motɛli; ko moto oasɔi moto o bodju ta kombe e moto o bodju adiabi iputi di moto o bodju. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: moto iyo opabi oto kɔpɔ e madiba mapiɔ ta kombe e mbi, adii omɔti o dii mokɛkɛ ta tei e batingami ba mbi ta tina e bo adii motingami o mbi adiabi iputi di nde.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Balomami ba Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7, 18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Ta ehole esidja Yesu bopa mitindo ta dii batingami ba nde doomi na babae, adonga iyana bɛngi akɛɛ aleha ko botɔndea Bwɛndi Bopele ta ngando djinɛnɛnɛnɛ dji bobo.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Enakoboa Yoane, ta bɔlɔkɔ, aokaka babala ta tina e mikɔ mi Kilito. Iboa aso aloma batingami ba nde <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />bawadje Yesu bo: «Ediwɛ Masiya okɛkɛdea adoe kaoko lotungi loambe moto okina?» <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Kɛɛni atɔndea Yoane eka eoki ino ko eka eɛni ino: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />bato ibibi baagwa miso basɔmbi boɛnɛ, bitumbɛ badalakadea, bato ba mabha basɛnɔkɔdea, bato ba matoi mago baokakadea, bato bago basisoakadea ko Bwɛndi Bopele botɔndeamakadea ta dii bakwali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 35, 5-6; 61, 1.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Ko mongandi ta dii moto iyo odaabi pɛpɛ bodumba edhimeli e nde ta tina e mbi!»<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Ta ehole eyana batingami ba Yoane, Yesu abanga bobala na emumu e bato ta tina e Yoane bo: «Eka ekɛkino aindja ta etengelenge nda? Mososongo mokumanaki na mopɛpɛ? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Iboa ekɛkino aindja nde? Moto omɔti alwaki bisendja bipele? Endelo bato bakalwae bisendja bipele bakadae ta ndako dji bakondji. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Ekɛkino aindja nde? Motɛli? Sooti, nabalakadea na nu, iyo anɔi motɛli. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Modjɔ mo ekomama ta tina e nde bo: “Nalomadea mwana o elomu o mbi boso bo wɛ, ta tina e bobɔngedja ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mlk 3, 1.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: ta tei e bato basusu ba botama na mwali, ediiti na moto omɔti onɔi Yoane Mobatisi; enikoboa, moto odii mokɛkɛ ta Bokumu bo busa amonɔi. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Banga ta ehole elehaka Yoane Mobatisi mbunoko busa ibubu, Bokumu bo busa boimea ikambo di boika molema ko edii oko bato ibia banakadea ta edhimeli badii bokwea iho. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Modjɔ mo batɛli basusu edae Mobeko ibo basusu batɛlɛ mbunoko ta ehole e Yoane. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Ko okapalani bosipoa, djebani bo Yoane adii Eliya iyo otungi adoe. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Yɛɛ bo iyona odii na matoi ma booka, aoke!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />«Moto ndani obwani na mbi boɛngɛ na bato ba busa ibubu? Babwani na baana ibia badii ta esika e masaka manɛnɛ, ko badii badumbeana na bakina: <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“Iso lobomeini mindulɛ mikɛkɛkɛkɛ ko obuitini! Loembeini ndjembo dji ilaka ko obakeitini mɔmɔ ta molo!” <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Modjɔ mo, Yoane adoa, aiyakaka ko aimwakaka ko ebalama bo: “Adii na mwembo mobe!” <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana o moto adoa, ayaka ko amwaka babala na nde bo: “Indjani moto iyo akadjebe oto boyaka ko na bomwaka, iyo adii modjebani o baputedji ba puti ko na bato ba pekato!” Endelo konga e misala mi nde einedji bo adii bodju.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngando djinɛnɛnɛnɛ djiloni bodhima</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10, 13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Iboa Yesu abanga bodosa ngando dji nɛnɛnɛnɛ idjia djikɔmɔ midjɔ mi bokamoa, ta tina ebo baipalaka bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ milema: <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />«Ndjokwa e wɛ, Koladjini! Ndjokwa e wɛ Betesaida! Modjɔ mo midjɔ mi bokamoa misa kɔɔmɔ ta dii wɛ miso mikɔɔmɔ ta Tile ko ta Sidona, ka bato bakadikame iho basɔmbɔtɔnɔ milema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Koladjini ko na Betesaida: ngando djinɛnɛ dji mbuti na Kapalanaume. Tile ko na Sidona: boɛngɛ Isa 23, 1-18; Edjek 26; Yl 4, 4-8; Ams 1, 9-10</char></note> mi bobo banga ehele, ko babwanaki bodjinedja na bolwa bisendja bi pili ko na bosasua mihulu ta molo. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Ta tina emina nabalakadea na nu, ta busa bo sambi etumbu e bino enɔbi bopipo bonɔ Tile ko na Sidona. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Ko wɛ Kapalanaume, olɛdjɛkɛ bo oangɔdjɔmɔbi mbunoko ta busa? Otitedjamadea mbunoko ta ngando e bato bago. Modjɔ mo midjɔ mi bokamoa misa kɔɔmɔ ta dii wɛ miso mikɔɔmɔ ta Sɔdɔmɔ, ka ngando enɛnɛ emina edii mbunoko busa ibubu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 14, 13-15. Sɔdɔmɔ: boindja Mba 19, 24-28.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Ta tina emina, naotɔndeakadea bo, ta busa bo Sambi etumbu e wɛ edaabi epipo bonɔɔ ekenge e mokili mo Sɔdɔmɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abeakadea bato ibia balwali mina</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10, 21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Oko ta ehole emina iyena, Yesu abala bo: «Oo Sesa, Kumu o busa na kpɔtɔ, naokumedjakadea ta tina e bo obomba midjɔ imimi ta dii bato ba bwanya ko na bato ba bowɛi ko omiinedji ta dii baana bakɛkɛkɛkɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 1Ko 1, 17-29.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Oko boa, Sesa ta tina e bo opala bo edaame oko iboa.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />«Sesa apani leka losusu. Pɛpɛ moto okadjebe Mwana dongedja oko Sesa ko pɛpɛ moto okadjebe Sesa dongedja oko Mwana, ko iyona osepadea Mwana bomoinedja Sango.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />«Doani ta dii mbi ino bato basusu baɛmbɛi na muna ko naopadeani iheme. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Tombani muna mo mbi molwani ko ikoani ta dii mbi modjɔ mo nadii na molema mo bwɛli ko bosatitadja, ko obolodjadeani iheme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Yil 6, 16.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Modjɔ mo muna mo mbi modii na mandi ko modii mopele ta bolwa.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko na sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mal 2, 23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Ta ehole iyena, Yesu akatisa gbie dji mbuma dji ble ta busa bo sabata. Batingami ba nde badaaka ndja; babanga bobuka mihɔngbu mi ble ko bayaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Dit 23, 26.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Ehole eɛnɛ Bapalisai modjɔ momina, babala na Yesu bo: «Indja batingami ba wɛ bakɔkɔdea midjɔ misiama ta busa bo sabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 34, 21.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Endelo Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Oilangani eka ekɔɔ Dhapiti busa bomɔti iyo na bato badalaka na nde adaaka bo na ndja? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Akweya ta ndako e Ndjakomba, ko ayaka mapa imia mapamaka iyo na bato badalaka na nde; a bonie baipama ndjea e bomayaka dongedja oko banganga ba Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayaka mapa: Boindja 1Sa 21, 2-7. Epama ndjea oko adii banganga ba Ndjakomba: Boindja Lew 24, 9.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Kaoko na ikina, oilangani ta mibeko bo, ta busa bo sabata banganga ba Ndjakomba ibia bakasale ta tepelo te basume mobeko mo sabata, ko batakwaka na mobeko momina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mit 28, 9-10.</char></note>? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Enakoboa naotɔndeakadeani bo, iya lodii na moto onɔi tepelo! <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Oso sipoani eka epalaka kɔpi iyeye botingodja: “Mbi nakapale molema mo pɛhɛ bonɔɔ mbeka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ose 6, 6.</char></note>”, obwanakitini bopa etumbu ta dii bia badii pɛpɛ bodaa na modjɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Modjɔ mo Mwana o moto adii Kumu o sabata.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto o ebɔ ekatatake</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mal 3, 1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6, 6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu akina ena ko akɛɛ ta ndako e bobo e miɔngɔnɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Edaka na moto omɔti ena adaaka na ebɔ ekatatake. Bapalisai bawadja Yesu bo: «Ebwani bopama ndjea bo baheledje moto ta busa bo sabata?» Iyena edaaka mondumba mo hombaka bo bamopunde. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Ekadaa omɔti ta tei e bino akadaa na bhata o nde omɔti ko bhata omina akakwa ta mombɔndɔ ta busa bo sabata, abwaniti bomodubodja? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Singandeloko moto onɔi bhata na motswiya! Iboa elomama bokɔɔ bopele ta busa bo sabata.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Iboa abala na moto omina bo: «Ninodja ebɔ.» Aninodja ebɔ ko eimea bopele ondingo iyena ekina. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Bapalisai baimana ko baso bakɔɔ inginda bɛngi bahombe mondumba mo bomowa.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mosali ohɔɔmi na Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Endelo Yesu amayo djeba modjɔ momina, adonga ta esika emina ko bimumu bi bato banɛnɛ bamokimana. Aheledja bato ba bipeko basusu, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />endelo abatuba matoi badae pɛpɛ botɔndea eka edii iyo. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Akɔɔ iboa bɛngi eka ebala motɛli Isaya ekokedjame:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />«Indja mosali o mbi ohɔɔ mbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Mopalani o mbi ko iyoo nasepi na nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Naisabi Mwembo mo mbi ta dii iyo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">ko atɔndeabi bodju ta dii bikomi.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Atanoanabi na bato ko atagamabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">ko moto omɔti ataokabi nongo moholi mo nde ta ndjea djinɛnɛnɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Atabukabi mososongo moɛmbɛke mosia boimbama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">ko atadimabi esendja e molinda mokaimedje mididi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Mbunoko abolodje bodju bolongake;<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Ko bikomi biisabi elɛndɛ ta kombe e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 42, 1-4.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asɔmbedji ta pundi e mopunda bo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 3:22-30">Mal 3, 22-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11, 14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Iboa balwɛɛ Yesu moto apeamaka na mwembo mobe adaaka na miso mago ko adaaka pongono emimi. Amoheledja, ta mondumba mo bo emimi aimea bobala ko na boɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Bimumu bi bato basusu bakamoa, ko babalaka bo: «Iyoo te Mwana o Dhapiti?» <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ta ehole eoka Bapalisai, babalaka bo: «Abenganakadea membo mibe na ngulu e Bɛlɛdjɛbule<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 10, 25 ko na nase.</char></note>, mokondji o membo mibe!» <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Endelo Yesu asipoa malɛi ma bobo; iboa aso abala na bu bo: «Bokondji bosusu bokabotɔɔ ta tei e bu bɛnɛ bokabehe. Ko ngando enɛnɛ esusu ko na ndako esusu edii bato bayu pɛpɛ bookana ebwaniti bombimbima. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Ekadaa Satana abengani Satana, iyana aimei bosanedja iyo mɛnɛ; bokondji bo nde bobwani bombimbima ndenge nda? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Ko ekadaa bo mbi nabenganakadea membo mibe na ngulu e Bɛlɛdjɛbule; ko batingami ba bino babenganakabi na ngulu e nda? Ta tina emina ibo bɛɛnɛ badaabi ba djudji ba bino! <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Endelo ekadaa bo mbi nabenganakadea membo mibe na Mwembo mo Ndjakomba, etingodjakadea bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba boimei ta dii ino.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />«Mondumba ndani mobwani moto bokwea ta ndako e moto o ngulu bɛngi akatoe leka lo nde amiti nanga moto omina mbɔti; endelo ngɔngɔ dji bomonanga mbɔti akatoadea leka losusu lo ndako e nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Moto odii pɛpɛ bodaa engbanga emɔti na mbi adii moloni o mbi; ko moto okadae pɛpɛ boputoanedja na mbi aka nangakake. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Ta tina emina naotɔndeakadeani sooti bo: pekato djisusu ko na masinga masusu makasinge bato Ndjakomba makutubanabi, endelo moto obwani bosinga Mwembo Mosɛnɔke abwaniti bodia ekutubanedji. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Moto obwani bobala bobe ta tina e Mwana o moto adiabi ekutubanedji; endelo moto obalabi bobe na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke atadiabi ekutubanedji edae ta ngondo iyeye, edae ta ngondo ekɛkɛdea adoe.»<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mole ko mbuma dji mu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6, 43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />«Mole mo pele, mokabote mbuma dji pele; mole mobe mokabote mbuma djibe. Modjɔ mo bakadjebe mole na mbuma dji mu. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Ibota di mimbitɔ! Obwanini bobala midjɔ mipele mondumba nda, abo odiini bato babe? Modjɔ mo mibalo mi moto mikainedje malɛi madii ta molema mo nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Moto mopele akabale midjɔ mipele mikadonge ta molema mo nde mopele; moto mobe akabale midjɔ mibe mikadonge ta molema mo nde mobe. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Naotɔndeakadeani bo: ta busa bo Sambi, bato basambabi na mibalo mi pɛpɛ sɔngi mi balaka ibo. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Modjɔ mo mibalo mi wɛ mɛnɛ mibwani bolongedja isa mibwani boodumba.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɛngi e embete e modjɔ mo bokamodja</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mal 8, 11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11, 29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Iboa bakina balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalisai babala na Yesu bo: «Molehi, lopalakadea oloinedje embete emɔti.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Mbota ebe ko e bɔɔli ehombakadea embete, endelo bataopadeani embete ekina oko embete e motɛli Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Modjɔ mo, abo Yona akɔɔ masu mayake ko na madipake masato ta sɔpɔ dji moswi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Yna 2, 1.</char></note> monɛnɛ, Mwana o moto pongono akɔɔdea masu mayake ko na madipake masato ta molema mo kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Ta busa bo Sambi, bato ba Niniwe baangɔbi ko bapabi bato ba mbota iyeye etumbu, modjɔ mo basɔmbɔtɔnɔ milema ta ehole eokabo eleho e Yona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niniwe: kombe e boso e ngando e mokondji o monɛnɛ e Asilia, ta dɔɔngɔ dika angɔe modakabusa ta dua e Tigele. Bato ba Niniwe basɔmbɔtɔnɔ milema: Boindja Yna 3, 5.</char></note>. Enakoboa iyaya edii na Iyona onɔi Yona! <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Ta busa bo Sambi, mokondji mwali o Satina apabi bato ba mbota iyeye etumbu, adonga ta suka suka e ngondo ta tina e bohokamedja konga e Sɔlɔmɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1Ba 10, 1-10.</char></note>. Enakoboa iyaya edii na Iyona onɔi Sɔlɔmɔ!»<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bosɔmbɔ bo mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11, 24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />«Ta ehole ekaimane mwembo mo pita ta dii moto, mokakɛe apukane ta bitengelenge ahombe esika e iheme. Endelo te mobolodjake, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />naboa akasabalee bo: “Nasɔmbe ta ndako e mbi, iyena ekinakabi mbi.” Ta ehole eimeadea iyo ko aetanei pɛpɛ eka otei, baambɔ, ko ebɔngedjami bopele. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Iboa akɛdea atomba membo mibe mikina sambo mimonɔi na bobe; bakweadea ena ko badikamadea. Mondumba mo moto iyona moimeadea mobe bonɔ modaki iyo boso. Ko edabi oko mondumba momina momɔti ta tina mbota iyeye ebe e busa ibubu.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na nango ko na baangi i nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mal 3, 31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8, 19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Iyana abalaka Yesu naikina na bimumu, nango ko baangi i nde baemaka sokolu bahombaka mwɛngi mo bosola na nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Moto omɔti abala na nde bo: «Ngwao na baana ba ngwao ba baami badii sokolu ko bakambakadea basole na wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ imumu modiiti ta makomi manɛnɛ mayou. </char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Endelo asɔmbedja moto iyona obalaka na nde bo: «Odii nange o mbi nda ko baangi i mbi banda?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Iboa aninodja ebɔ ta dii batingami ba nde ko abala bo: «Indja nange o mbi ko bangi i mbi. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Modjɔ mo moto mosusu okakɔe bolulea bo Sesa iyona odii ta busa edii iyo moto odii mwange o mbi, ngɛnɛ o mbi ko nange o mbi.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e moaneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mal 4, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8, 4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Ta busa ibua, Yesu aimana ta ndako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 2, 1 ko na nase.</char></note> ko adaa ta mokula mo ibeke. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Bimumu bi bato biputoana mbuti na nde, Yesu atitea ta bwato ko adaa na mobondo ta bwato o tei. Iyana bato basusu baema ongondo. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Abala na bu bobuke mɛnɛ na bikuanedji bo: «Moaneli omɔti akɛkɛ ta tina e boana. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Ta ehole eanaka iyo, mbuma djikwaka ta mokpɛngɔ mo ndjea: mbulu ba diko badoa ko badjikoma djisusu. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Djikina djikwaka ta diko di ndeke ta esika e pɛpɛ kpɔtɔ djinɛnɛ. Djibota na mbala emɔti ta tina ebo mokpɔtɔ momina moidaaka mo mbɛngɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Endelo ta ehole eimana moi, moboma na ngulu ko djikakana ta tina e bo djiidaka na nginga. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Djikina djikwa ta esika e ndjubɛ. Ndjubɛ djikandoa ko djimbambamedja mbuma. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Djikina djikwa ta kpɔtɔ dji pele ko djibota mbuma dji pele: djikina djibota mbuma mokama, djikina tuku djisamano ko djikina tuku djisato.» <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Ko Yesu abala naikina bo: «Yɛɛ bo iyona odii na matoi aoke!»<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tina ndani Yesu akabale na bikuanedji</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mal 4, 10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8, 9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Batingami babatama mbuti na Yesu ko baso bamowadja bo: «Tina ndani obalakadea na bu na bikuanedji?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Edii tina e bo ino obolodjani midjɔ mi mbombi mi Bokumu bo busa midii tina e bino, endelo eipama na bu. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Modjɔ mo bapaadea ta dii moto iyona odii na eka ko aimeadea na leka lonɛnɛ; endelo ta dii moto iyona odii pɛpɛ eka bamokatoadea nongo eka epeli yo. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Indjani tina ebabaleakadea mbi na bikuanedji: ta tina e bo baindjakadea ko bataɛnɛkɛdea, baokakadea ko batasipoakadea. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Naboa mobalo mo motɛli Isaya mokokedjame ta tina e bobo bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“Okadeani bopele, endelo otasipoadeani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">oindjadeani bopele, endelo otaɛnɛdeani.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Modjɔ mo milema mi bato ibibi midii mipipo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">baditei matoi ma bobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ko badipi miso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">bɛngi badae pɛpɛ boɛnɛ na miso ma bobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ko matoi ma bobo madae pɛpɛ booka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">milema mi bobo midae pɛpɛ bosipoa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ko iboa bahombedje milema, bɛngi nabaheledje<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 6, 9-10.</char></note>.”<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />«Endelo ino, odiini bato ba mongandi: ta tina e bo miso ma bino maɛnɛkɛdea ko matoi ma bino maokakadea! <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: batɛli banɛnɛ ko na bato ba bodju bahombaka baɛnɛ eka iyeye eɛnɛkɛdea ino endelo baɛniti, bahombaki baoke eka iyeye eokakadea ino ko baeokiti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 1Pi 1, 10-12.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atingodji ekuanedji e moaneli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />«Hokamedjani eka epalakadea botingodja ekuanedji e moaneli. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Ta ehole eoki moto mobalo mo Bokumu ko asipoiti: Mokosi akadoe adongedja eka eanamaki ta tei e molema mo moto omina. Iyo adii ondingo kona iyena ekwa ta mokpɛngɔ mo ndjea. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Iyona oana mbuma ta mokpɔtɔ mo ndeke: edii moto iyo ooki Mobalo ko amoasɔi mbala emɔti na mongandi. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Endelo djidiiti na nginga ta tei edju, dji dii oko moo ehole mokɛkɛ. Ta ehole e bomekama kaoko minɔngɔ ta tina e Mobalo asundoli mbala e mɔti edhimeli e nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Iyona oana mbuma ta esika e ndjubɛ: edii wɛtoko moto iyoo ooki Mobalo, endelo posa djibe dji ngondo na bokoso bo madieli bombambamedji Mobalo ta tei e nde iboa mbuma idjia ibwaniti bobota naikina. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Iyona oana mbuma ta kpɔtɔ djipele: wɛtoko moto iyoo ooki Mobalo ko amosipoi; abotadea mbuma ko ekina eboti mokama, ekina eboti tuku djisamano, ekina eboti tuku djisato.»<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e mondjani mobe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu abatɔndea ekuanedji ekina bo: «Bokumu bo busa bokuani na moto iyoo oanaka kona dji pele ta gbie e nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Na bulu, moloni o nde akɛɛ ana mondjani mobe ta ndanda e ble ko aso anɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Ta ehole ekandoa kona e ble ko eboti mihɔngbu, mondjani mobe pongono motɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Basali ba moswa gbie bakɛɛ abala na nde bo: “Kumu, wɛ oiana kona dji pele ta gbie e wɛ? Adongaka ndjani idjidji djibe djɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Abasɔmbedja bo: “Edii moloni moto odjiani.” Iboa basali baso bamowadja bo: “Obwani bopala bo lokɛe adjibikoa?” <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Asɔmbedja bo: “Ngasa, pɛpɛ bokɛni oko ta tina ebo ta ehole edongedjadea ino ndjani djibe osaka bikoani pongono ble. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Kinani djisusu djikandoe polo emɔti mbunoko ta ehole e bobuka ko ta ehole emina iyena nabaladea na babuki ba mbuma bo: Dongedjani boso mɛnɛ ndjani djibe djinangani kata bɛngi odjitumbeni, ngɔngɔ djimina obukeni ble odjiseni ta esika e mbombi.”»<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e mombuma mo mutalade</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mal 4, 30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu abatubanea ekuanedji ekina bo: «Bokumu bo busa bokuani na mbuma e mutalade etomba moto omɔti ko aso aana ta gbie e nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Edii kona emɔti enɔi bokɛkɛ ta tei e kona djisusu; endelo ta ehole ekandoi iyo, eimeadea kona enɛnɛ bonɔ kona djikina ta tei e gbie: eimeadea mole, ta mɛti na bo mbulu ba diko badoadea akɔɔ moopo ma bobo ta tape dji mu.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e bole bo levile</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13, 20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu abatubanea ekuanedji ekina bo: «Bokumu bo busa bokuani na bole bo mapa ibubu bokabeebo levile, bokatombe mwali omɔti ko aisi ta kilo dji paline tuku djibae na itano, mbunoko anila o mapa mosusu ahaloe.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndenge ndani Yesu abalaka na bikuanedji</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mal 4, 33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu abalaka na bimumu bi bato midjɔ imia misusu na bikuanedji; ehole ebalaka iyo na bu aitakaka bobabalea na bikuanedji. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Akɔɔkɔ iboa bɛngi bo eka ebala motɛli ekokedjame:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">«Natombadea kɔpi bɛngi na babalehe na bikuanedji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">naotɔndeadeani midjɔ mi mbombi banga ta bokɔɔmɔ bo ngondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 78, 2.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atingodji ekuanedji e mondjani mobe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Iboa Yesu akina bimumu bi bato ko akwea ta ndako. Batingami ba nde bakɛɛ amowadja bo: «Lotingodja ekuanedji e mondjani mobe ta gbie.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Moto okaane kona epele, edii Mwana o moto; <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />gbie edii wɛtoko ngondo; kona epele edii baana ba Bokumu bo busa; mondjani mobe edii wɛtoko baana ba Mokosi; <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />moloni oani edii djabulu; ehole e bobuka edii wɛtoko suka e ngondo; babuki ba mbuma, edii wɛtoko babwɛndi. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Iboa, oko mondumba modongedjakadea bo ndjani djibe ta tina e bodjidumba ta mosa, oko mondumba momina momɔti modaabi ta suka e ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana o moto alomabi babwɛndi ba nde badongedjabi ta tei e Bokumu bo nde eka esusu ekalome bato bakina bakɔe pekato ko na bato bakakɔe mabe, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />ko abadumbabi ta ibonge di mosa mopipo; iho edakabi oto biyo ko na bokpɛkɛnɛ miino. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Iboa bato ba bodju bangɛsɛbi ondingo modaakabusa ta Bokumu bo Sangwabu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dan 12, 3.</char></note>. Yɛɛ bo iyona odii na matoi aoke!»<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e bodieli bobolamake bo tɛtɔ ko na iyaka di motswiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />«Bokumu bo busa bokuani na bodieli bobolama ta gbie. Moto o sa tɔngɔlɔ bodieli bomina abobombadea naikina. Na mongandi momina akɛɛdea atɛkɛ leka losusu lodaaka na nde bɛngi asombe gbie emina.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />«Bokumu bo busa bokuani na ikina na moto o mombongu okahombe mayaka ma motswiya mapele. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Ta ehole etanei iyo iyaka di motswiya monɛnɛ, akɛdea atɛkɛ leka lo nde losusu bɛngi adisombe.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e modjanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />«Bokumu bo busa bokuani naikina na modjanga modumbi ibo ta ibeke ko motaedji swi mindumba misusu. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Ta ehole elumi mo na swi, bamotubadea ta bokula, iboa badadea bɛngi bahɔe swi bapele baise ta egbogolo ko badumbadea ibia ba pɛpɛ sɔngi. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Edaabi oko mondumba momina momɔti ta suka e ngondo: babwɛndi baduabi abɔtodja bato babe na bodju <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />bɛngi babadumbe ta ibonge di mosa mopipo; iho edakabi oto biyo ko na bokpɛkɛnɛ miino.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodieli boyou ko na boyeene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu abawadja bo: «Osipoini midjɔ imimi misusu?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Okoboa.» <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Abala na bu bo: «Ta tina emina, molehi o mobeko mosusu oikoakadea Bokumu bo busa akuani na moswa ndako iyona oiwakadea ta bodieli bo nde bo motswiya bobolama bo tɛtɔ leka loyeene ko na loyou.»<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bato ba Nadjalɛtɛ baloni bodhima Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Ta ehole esidja Yesu bobala bikuanedji djimina, aso adonga iyana <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />ko akɛɛ ta ngando e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngando enɛnɛ: edii wɛtoko Nadjalɛtɛ. Boindja 2, 23 ko na Luk 4, 16.</char></note>. Abanga boleha ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ dji bobo ko bato basusu bakamoa ko basawadjanaka bo: «Abolodji iyo konga ko na bopilo bo bokɔɔ midjɔ mi bokamoa ibo djɔ? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Iyo te mwana o mosapate? Nango te Malia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Yoa 6, 42.</char></note>? Ko baana ba nango te Djake, Yosepu, Simona ko Yudhe? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Ko ngɛnɛ dji nde badiiti basusu iyaya ta tei e su? Abolodji iyo midjɔ imimi misusu djɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Iboa edaaka ta tina e bobo ibaku ta edhimeli ebobo. Iboa Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Motɛli te akume ta ngando isa ta ibota di nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 57 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Luk 4, 24; Yoa 4, 44.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Iboa Yesu aikɔɔ midjɔ mi bokamoa minɛnɛ iho ta tina taka e bobo e edhimeli.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yogo e Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mal 6, 14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9, 7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Ta ehole iyena, Elode odaledjaka Galileya, aoka gala e Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Abala na basali ba nde bo: «Edii Yoane Mobatisi: asisoi ta tei e bato bago! Ta tina emina adii na ngulu e bokɔɔ midjɔ mi bokamoa.» <verse eid="MAT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Modjɔ mo, Elode apea Yoane, amonanga mbɔti ko amoisa ta bɔlɔkɔ ta tina etingi na Elodiade, mwali o mwana o nango Pilipo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 6, 17 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Modjɔ mo Yoane abalaka na Elode bo: «Baopiti ndjea e bomotomba ondingo mwali o wɛ!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 18, 16; 20, 21.</char></note>» <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Elode ahombaka amoowodje, endelo abangaka emumu e bato, ta tina e bo batombaka Yoane ondingo motɛli. <verse eid="MAT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Enakoboa, ta tɛkɛ e bobotama bo Elode, mwana mwali o Elodiade, adaaka abua ta boso bo bato bakabeebo ta tɛkɛ. Iboa asepedja Elode bobuke mɛnɛ <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />aso akata seleka bo apadea mokandoli mwali eka esusu ewadjadea iyo. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Na mondumba momolindedja nango, abala bo: «Pani iyaa ta saani molo mo Yoane Mobatisi!» <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Aoka ndjokwa; endelo ta tina e seleka ko tina e bato babea iyo ta tɛkɛ, mokondji apa mitindo bamopɛ molo momina. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Ko aloma moto omɔti akɛe alena molo mo Yoane ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Batomba molo mo nde ta saani ko bapa na mokandoli mwali, atomba ko apa na nango. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Iboa batingami ba Yoane badoa atomba ebembe e nde ko baesambea ta ikila; ko ngɔngɔ baso bakɛɛ atɔndea Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayedji baami koto itano</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mal 6, 30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoa 6, 1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Ehole eoka Yesu mwako imua, atomba bwato bɛngi asatswɛ moo bohali na bato ta etengelenge. Endelo bimumu baoka baimana ta ngando djinɛnɛnɛnɛ ko bamokimana na mako. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ta ehole eduboa Yesu ta bwato, aɛnɛ emumu e bato banɛnɛ, ko abaokea pɛhɛ ko abangaka bobaheledja na bego dji bobo. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Ama imea busa mɔkɔmɔkɔ, batingami bakɛɛ abala na nde bo: «Esika iyeye edii etengelenge. Ko ehole esi bonɔɔ sɔmbedja bimumu ibibi bi bato bɛngi bakɛe asomba leka loboyaka ta ngando.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Endelo Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Ediiti na tina ebo bakɛe iho; bapani ino bɛnɛ leka lo boyaka!» <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Endelo bamosɔmbedja bo: «Lodii iyaa oto na miɛmbɛ mitano ko na swi babae.» <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Ko Yesu abala na bu bo: «Doani na lu ta dii mbi». <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Apa mitindo ta dii bimumu badae na bondo ta ndjani; atomba miɛmbɛ mitano na swi ba bae, aangɔdjɔ miso ta busa ko aso apa midjongoa adii Ndjakomba. Ngɔngɔ djimina abuka ipa ko apa ta dii batingami, ko batingami bakabana na bimumu bi bato. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Moto na moto ayaka ko agola. Ko batingami baandoana bikenge balumedja mitinga doomi na mibae midikaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 2Ba 4, 42-44.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Bato baami bayaka badaaka mbuti na koto itano pɛpɛ bolanga bali na bɛngɛ.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adali ta diko di ibeke</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mal 6, 45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoa 6, 15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Nambala emɔti, Yesu aloma batingami ba nde batitee ta bwato ko basue boso bo nde ta dɔɔngɔ dikina di mokula mo ibeke, ta ehole eyanedjaka yo bimumu bi bato. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Ngɔngɔ dji boyanedja bimumu bi bato, aiweya ta ngomba ta tina e boangɔnɔ asabudjea mweka. Ta ehole eimea mɔkɔmɔkɔ adaaka iho, oko iyo mɛnɛ; <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />enakoboa oko ta ehole emina bwato boimeaka bohali na mokula, bodaaka bokumanake na mbonge, ta tina ebo mopɛpɛ mosɔmbedjaka bwato ngɔngɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Ta bihindihindi, Yesu aduaka dɔɔngɔ didaaka ibo akɛkɛ adale ta diko di madiba. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Ta ehole eɛnɛ batingami akɛkɛ adale ta diko di madiba baluma na bɔɔ ko babala bo: «Edii edjo!» Bagamaka na bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Endelo Yesu abala na bu mbala emɔti bo: «Sapingedjani, edii mbi, pɛpɛ bobangani!» <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Petelo amosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, ekadaa wɛ pani mitindo nadoe ta di wɛ adale ta diko di madiba.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Dua!» Petelo aimana ta bwato abanga bodala ta diko di madiba ko akimana Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Endelo ama iyo eɛnɛ bo mopɛpɛ modaaka mopipo, aimeaka na bɔɔ. Abangaka bodinda ko agama: «Kumu, heledjani!» <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Na mbala emɔti, Yesu aninodja ebɔ, amopea ko abala bo: «Moto o edhimeli bokɛkɛ, tina ebomakadea na wɛ kitɛ nda?» <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Batitea ibo basusu ta bwato ko mopɛpɛ motita. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Iboa, bato badaaka ta tei e bwato bakwa magbunda ta boso bo Yesu ko babala na nde bo: «Odii sooti Mwana o Ndjakomba!»<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato ba bego ta Genedjalɛtɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mal 6, 53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Basidja bokatisa ibeke ko baso baimea ta ibongu di Genedjalɛtɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 6, 53 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Bato ba esika iyena badjeba Yesu ko bananganedja gala e nde mɔɔngɔ masusu ko bamolwɛkɛ bato basusu ba bego. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Bamoangɔnɔkɔ bamobɛndjɛe nongo ta sɔngɔ e esendja e nde; ko bato basusu bamobɛndjɛkɛ bahelaka.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Bileho bipama na bakɔkɔ bayou</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mal 7, 1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Iboa Bapalisai na balehi ba mobeko badoa ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta dii Yesu ko bamowadja bo: <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />«Tina ndani batingami ba wɛ te basume mibeko mi bakɔkɔ ba biso bayou? Modjɔ mo te basose mabɔ boso bo boyaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Luk 11, 38.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Ko tina ndani ino te osumakeni mobeko mo Ndjakomba bɛngi osumakeni mobeko mo bokɔkɔ bo bino? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Ta tina e bo Ndjakomba abala bo: “Suma sangwao na ngwao”, ko pongono “Moto obwani bolakedja sango isa nango abwani na etumbu e bogwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Isa 20, 12 ko Dit 5, 16; Boi 21, 17 ko Lew 20, 9.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Endelo ino, okabaleni bo moto akabala na sango isa na nango bo: “Ekamoli etungi mbi naokɔmedje na yu edii ibondja isɛnɔke”, <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />moto iyona adiiti na tina e bosuma sango. Oko mondumba momina momɔti otasumakadeani Mobalo mo Ndjakomba ta tina e mobeko mo bokɔkɔ bo bino! <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Bato ba ndango e mongi! Isaya atɛlɛkɛ ta tina e bino bo ta ehole ebalaka iyo bo:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />“Bato ba ekomi iyeye bakakumedjeni oto na poso dji minɔkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:8">endelo milema mi bobo midii bohali na mbi.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Bokumedja bokakumedjeni ibo bodiiti na tɛtɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">modjɔ mo bileho bilehakadea ibo bidii oko mibeko mi bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 29, 13.</char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Leka lokaimedje moto na pita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yesu abea emumu e bato ko abala na bu bo: «Hokamedjani ko sipoani: <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Ediiti eka ekakwee ta monɔkɔ ekaimedje moto na pita. Endelo eka ekimane ta monɔkɔ mo nde, edii eka ekimedje moto na pita.» <verse eid="MAT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Iboa batingami ba nde basatea mbuti na nde ko babala na nde bo: «Odjebakadea bo midjɔ mi sabala wɛ mipi Bapalisai ibaku?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Asɔmbedja bo: «Kona esusu edaa pɛpɛ boanama na Sesa odii ta busa ebikoamabi. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Bakinani: edii bato ba miso mago badaledjakadea bato ba miso mago! Enakaboa moto o miso mago akadaledja moto o miso mago, bakwadea ibo basusu babae ta mombɔndɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petelo atomba kɔpi ko aso abala na nde bo: «Lotingodja ekuanedji iyena.» <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu abawadja bo: «Ino pongono odiitini na bowɛi? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Otasipoakadeani bo eka esusu ekakwee ta monɔkɔ eka kɛe ta sɔpɔ boso bɛngi enɛɛme ta ndima? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Endelo iyeye ekaimane ta monɔkɔ ekadonge ta molema, edii wɛtoko iyeye ekaimedje moto na pita. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Modjɔ mo malɛno mabe makadonge ta molema; makalome moto ta midjɔ imimi: boowa, bɔɔli, ndukeli, iba, tati dji bokuta ko masinga. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Iyena edii midjɔ imia mikaimedje moto na pita! Endelo boyaka pɛpɛ bososa mɔmɔ teboimedje moto na pita.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwali mokɛndɛli adhimei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mal 7, 24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Ngɔngɔ djimina Yesu amayo kina esika iyena akɛɛ ta mokpɔtɔ mo Tile ko na Sidona. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Mwali omɔti o Kanana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mobeya mo mwali o Kanana moinedjakadea mwali iyona ondingo adii moswa ngando o ekenge e mokili iyena e Penesi. Nongo amiti daa Moyudha, etamosiaka booka bobala ta tina e Yesu.</char></note> o dikamaka ta ekenge e mokili mo mina adoa ta dii iyo ko aso agama bo: «Kumu, Mwana o Dhapiti, okeani pɛhɛ! Mwana o mbi o mwali ayekeamakadea bobuke mɛnɛ na mwembo mobe!» <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Endelo Yesu aisɔmbedja nongo kɔpi emɔti. Batingami ba nde basabatea mbuti na nde bamowadja bo: «Moyanedja, modjɔ mo alokimanakadea na migamo.» <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Nalomama oto ta dii bhata babunga ndjea ta bana ba Isalɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 10, 5-6.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Endelo mwali o mina akɛɛ akwa magbunda ta boso bo nde ko abala bo: «Kumu, kɔmedjeni!» <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Ediiti bopele botomba mwɛmbɛ mo baana omopɛ na mbwa.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Mwali amosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, edii sooti, ekahia baana ba mbwa bakayake oko baikengakenga ba mia ibia bakakwɛe ta mesa dji baswa bu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Iboa Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Mwali, edhimeli e wɛ edii enɛnɛ! Yɛɛ bo ekɔɔme na wɛ oko mondumba mopalakadea wɛ.» Oko ta ehole emina iyena mwana o nde o mwali aso ahela.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato ba bego banɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu akina iyana ko akɛɛ ta mokula mo ibeke di Galileya. Aiwea ta diko di ngomba ko aso adaa na mobondo. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Iboa bimumu bi bato banɛnɛ bakɛɛ ta dii iyo, na bato ba bitumbɛ, bato ba miso mago, bato ba biɛmɛ, bimimi, ko na bato banɛnɛ ba bego bikina. Ba basambea ta mako ma nde ko abaheledja. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Ko bimumu bi bato bikamoaka boɛnɛ bimimi babalaka, bato ba yɛɛmɛ bahelaka, ko na bato ba bitumbɛ badalaka, bato ba miso mago baɛnɛkɛ. Bimumu bokumea Ndjakomba o Isalɛlɛ.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayedji baami koto inɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mal 8, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yesu abea batingami ba nde ko abala bo: «Naokeakadea emumu iyeye e bato pɛhɛ, modjɔ mo ekɔi edɛdi masu masato badii oko mbuti na mbi ko badiiti na eka e boyaka. Natapalakadea bobayanedja sɔpɔ bwase; basaka ɛmbɛɛ na ndjea.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Batingami bawadja bo: «Abolodjadea iso leka iyaya ta etengelenge bɛngi loyedje ko logoledje emumu e bato mondumba imumu djɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Odiini na miɛmbɛ meka?» Basɔmbedja bo: «Sambo, ko na ndambo e baaswii.» <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Iboa apa mitindo ta dii bimumu badae na mbondo ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Ngɔngɔ djimina atomba miɛmbɛ sambo ko na swi, asakoa Ndjakomba, amibukakaka ko apa batingami ko batingami bakabana na bato basusu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Bato basusu bayaka ko bagola. Ko baandoana bikenge bi miɛmbɛ midikaka balumedja mitinga sambo. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Bato bayaka badaaka koto inɛi bailanga bali na baana. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Ngɔngɔ djimina ayanedja emumu e bato ko Yesu atitea ta bwato ko akɛɛ ta ekenge e mokili mo Magada<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Magada: esika iyena eidjebama bopele. Endelo, ta makomi makina edii Magadala.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Bapalisai ko na Basadukai bawadji embete e bokamodja</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mal 8, 11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12, 54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Bapalisai ko na Basadukai badoa ta dii Yesu bɛngi bamopikee elambo. Ko baso bamowadja bɛngi abainedje embete emɔti bodonga ta busa. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Ta ehole e mɔkɔmɔkɔ, okabaleni bo: “Edii ehole epele, ta tina e bo diko dikpeti.” <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Ko ehuma, okabaleni bo: “Mbua akwadea busa ibubu, ta tina e bo mbua adoi ko diko dihindi.” Odjebakadeani botingodja bimbete bi diko, endelo otadjebakadeani botingodja bimbete bi ehole iyeye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makomi manɛnɛ mayou madiiti na mibalo mi Yesu ta milɔngɔ mi 2 ko 3.</char></note>! <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Bato ba mbota ebe ko ba pɛpɛ botingama na Ndjakomba, bahombakadea embete, endelo batabainedjadea embete ekina oko e Yona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 12, 39-40.</char></note>.» Ngɔngɔ djimina abakina ko akɛɛ.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Levile e Bapalisai ko Basadukai</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mal 8, 14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Ta ndelo ekatisa batingami ta ngunda ekina e ibeke, babosana botomba mapa. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu abala na bu bo: «Tomadingani! Kebani na levile e Bapalisai ko na e Basadukai.» <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Batingami balɛdjɛkɛ ko basabaleana bo: «Abalakadea iboa tina e bo lotombiti mapa.» <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu asipoa modjɔ momina mobalaka ibo ko abawadja bo: «Tina ndani osabaleanakadeani bo oditini na mapa? Edhimeli e bino edii ekɛkɛ! <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Opakitasipoani oko? Lɛdjɛkɛdeani bopele: oandoani mitinga meka ta ehole ekabana ino mapa matano ta dii bato koto itano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 15, 32-38.</char></note>? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Ko otalɛdjɛkɛdeani mapa sambo makabana ino ta dii bato koto inɛi ko motswiya mo mitinga miandoana ino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 15, 32-38.</char></note>? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Tina edakadea na nu pɛpɛ bosipoa bo naibalaka na nu ta tina e mapa, ehole abalaka mbi na nu bo: Okebeni na levile e Bapalisai ko na e Basadukai?»<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Iboa batingami basipoa bo aibalaka na bu ta tina e bokeba na levile endelo bakebe na bileho bi Bapalisai ko na Basadukai.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo abali tati bo Yesu adii Masiya</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mal 8, 27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9, 18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu aimea ta ekenge mokili mo Sedjale e Pilipo awadja batingami ba nde bo: «Ekabale bato nde ta tina e Mwana o moto?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Basɔmbedja bo: «Bato bakina bakabale bo odii Yoane Mobatisi, bakina odii Eliya, bakina ko odii Yilimia kaoko omɔti o batɛli.» <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu abawadja bo: «Ko ino, okabaleni mbi na dii nda?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simona Petelo atomba kɔpi ko asɔmbedja bo: «Odii Kilito, Mwana o Ndjakomba odii na bomɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Simona, mwana moomi o Yona, odii moto o mongandi, modjɔ mo editi mini na makiya misaotɔndea modjɔ momina, endelo Sesa odii ta busa. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Ko mbi naotɔndeakadea bo, odii Ibanga ko diko di ibanga imina napikadea Ekelesa e mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ep 2, 20.</char></note>. Ko bikuke bi ngando e bato bago etaelongabi. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Naopadea pongola dji Bokumu bo busa: eka etingeabi wɛ iyaya ta kpɔtɔ etingeamabi ta busa; eka edipoabi wɛ iyaya ta kpɔtɔ edipoamabi ta busa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 18, 18; Yoa 20, 23.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Iboa Yesu atuba batingami matoi badae pɛpɛ botɔndea moto bo iyo adii Kilito.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndei ta tina e yogo ko na bosisoa bo nde ta bogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mal 8, 31-9, 1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9, 22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Banga ehole iyena, Yesu abanga boinedja batingami ba nde bo: «Etungi na nde bokɛɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ anɔngɔmɔ ta mabɔ ma basuku, banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ, ko na balehi ba mobeko. Bamowoe ko asisoe ta yogo ta disu di basato.» <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Iboa Petelo amotuba ngungusa ko abanga bomodosa bo: «Kumu, Ndjakomba aobanee! Midjɔ imia midae pɛpɛ bootanea!» <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Endelo Yesu aso ahombana ko asɔmbedja Petelo bo: «Kɛɛ bohali na mbi, Satana! Wɛ odii ibaku ta tina e mbi, ta tina e bo malɛi ma wɛ madiiti ondingo ma Ndjakomba endelo madii ma bomoto.»<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Iboa Yesu abala na batingami ba nde bo: «Moto akapala bokimanani, asalone iyo mɛnɛ, atombe ekulusu e nde ko akimaneni. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Modjɔ mo moto opaladea boheledja bomɔ bo nde abotakadea; endelo moto otakadea bomɔ bo nde ta tina e mbi abobolodjadea. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Tɛtɔ ndani ebwani moto bodia bɛngi abolodje ngondo esusu, endelo abedje bomɔ bo nde? Ebwani bopa moto nde bɛngi asikoe bomɔ bo nde? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Naboa Mwana o moto adoadea na ekumu e Sango engbanga na babwɛndi ba nde, ko iboa aputadea engi moto bobwana na mikɔ mi nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndj 62, 13; Lom 2, 6.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: bato bakina ta tei e bato ibibi batagwabi boso bo Mwana o moto adoe ondingo mokondji.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ bo mokuku mo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mal 9, 2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9, 28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu masamano, Yesu atomba Petelo, Djake, ko na Yoane mwanango, ko akɛɛ asabudjea na bu ta ngomba emɔti e diko. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Aso asɔmbɔtɔnɔ ta boso bo bobo; mbanda e nde engɛsɛkɛ ondingo modakabusa ko bisendja bi nde bimea bipu ipɛɛ ondingo bohu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 2Pi 1, 16-18.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Nambala emɔti Mose na Eliya babaimanea, ko basolanaka na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Iboa Petelo abala na Yesu bo: «Kumu, edii bopele lodikame iyaya. Okapala, napike bikpangba bisato, emɔti tina e wɛ, ekina tina Mose, ko ekina tina e Eliya.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Oko ta ehole edaaka iyo abala itute dimɔti di bohu di bakunda, ko ta itute dimina moholi momɔti mobalaka bo: «Iyoyo adii Mwana o mbi o epaeli nakasepe na nde bobuke mɛnɛ. Mookeani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 3, 17 ko na nase. </char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Amabo oka moholi momina, batingami bakwa na maso ta kpɔtɔ baso baluma na bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Endelo Yesu asalinda mbuti na bu ababɛndjɛ na ebɔ ko abala na bu bo: «Angɔni pɛpɛ bobangani.» <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Bangɔdjɔ miso ko baiɛnɛ moto okina oto Yesu iyo mɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Naboa adaaka bo bakɛkɛ atite ta ngomba, Yesu abapa mitindo imimi bo: «Pɛpɛ botɔndeani moto omɔti ta tina e ndjɛnɛ iyeye mbunoko Mwana o moto akasisoa ta bogwa.»<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Iboa batingami bawadja Yesu bo: «Tina ndani balehi ba mobeko bakabale bo etungi boso mɛnɛ Eliya adoe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mal 3, 23.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Edii oko boa etungi Eliya adoe bɛngi aise midjɔ misusu ta mwɛngi. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Endelo naotɔndeakadeani bo: Eliya asia bodoa ehele, baimodjeba ko bakɔɔ na nde eka epalaka ibo. Oko mondumba momina momɔti monɔngedjadea ibo Mwana o moto.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Iboa batingami basipoa bo ababaleaka ta tina e Yoane Mobatisi.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji mwana o yogo e isiesie</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mal 9, 14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37">Luk 9, 37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Ta ndelo eimea ibo mbuti na emumu, moto omɔti akɛɛ akwa magbunda ta boso bo Yesu <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />ko abala bo: «Kumu, okea mwana o mbi o moomi ndjokwa. Adii na yogo e kpukpukpu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kpukpukpu: epeko iyeye bakaebee pongono isiesie (Boindja 42, 4 ko na nase).</char></note> ko apekakadea bobuke, akakwɛe engi mbala ta mosa ko engi mbala ta madiba. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Namolwɛkɛ batingami ba wɛ endelo baihɔnɔ bomoheledja.» <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu atomba kɔpi ko abala bo: «Mbota ebe ko etaka edhimeli! Nadikamadea na nu mbunoko ndelo nda? Naoikeabini molema mbunoko ndelo nda? Molwɛnini iyaya.» <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu agamea mwembo mobe; ko moimana ta dii mwana moomi omina ko ahela oko ta ehole emina iyena. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Iboa batingami bakɛɛ awadja Yesu na mbombi bo: «Tina ndani iso lobwaniti bobengana mwembo momina iso bɛɛnɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Tina e bo odiini na edhimeli ekɛkɛ. Modjɔ mo, naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: okadani na edhimeli enɛnɛ ondingo mombuma mo mutalade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bonɛnɛ ondingo mbuma e mutalade: mbuma e mutalade edaaka eatombama ondingo mbuma enɔi na bokɛkɛ. Boindja 13, 32. </char></note>, obwanini bobala na ngomba iyeye: “Donga iyaya kɛɛ ibobo”, ko ebwani bodonga. Pɛpɛ nongo eka emɔti ebwani boleloa na nu. [ <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Endelo mondumba mo membo mibe imimi mikaimane oko na yuunga ko na mongilo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ imumu modiiti ta makomi manɛnɛ mayou.</char></note>.]»<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndi naikina bogwa ko na bosisoa bo nde ta yogo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mal 9, 30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk 9, 43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Ta Galileya busa bomɔti baputoanaka iboa, Yesu abala na bu bo: «Mwana o moto akabamadea ta mabɔ ma bato, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />bamowadea; endelo ta disu di basato asisoadea ta bogwa.» Iboa batingami baoka ndjokwa enɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Petelo baputi puti e tepelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Ta ndelo eimea Yesu na batingami ba nde ta Kapalanaume bato ibia batombaka pata dji palanga dji puti e tepelo basalinda mbuti Petelo ko bamowadja bo: «Molehi o bino tapute puti dji tepelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 30, 11-16.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Petelo asɔmbedja bo: «Oko iboa, akapute.» Ta ndelo ekwea Petelo ta ndako, Yesu atomba kɔpi boso bo nde ko awadja bo: «Simona, elɛdjɛkɛdea wɛ nde? Bato batungi boputa puti ko kitasi ta dii bakondji ba ngondo ba nda? Bato ba ekomi e bobo kaoko bakɛndɛli?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petelo asɔmbedja bo: «Bakɛndɛli.» Naboa, Yesu abala na nde bo: «Ekada iboa, bato ba ekomi babwaniti boputa. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Endelo lomiti pala boisa mongangale ta malɛi ma bobo. Kɛɛ ta ibeke maa ilɔpi otubadea moswi o boso ko dipoa monɔkɔ mo nde: otaneadea pata dji palanga dji puti e tepelo otei ebwani na boputa puti e mbi ko na e wɛ; etomba ko puta puti dji biso.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Moto onɔi bonɛnɛ ta Bokumu bo busa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mal 9, 33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9, 46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Oko ta ehole emina, batingami babatama mbuti na Yesu bamowadja bo: «Omina onɔi bonɛnɛ ta Bokumu bo busa nda?» <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Abeya yɛngɛ ko amoisa ta ndanda e bobo <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />ko abala bo: « Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: omiti saimedjani ondingo bɛngɛ, otakweakabini ta Bokumu bo busa. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Naboa, moto mosusu osamedjadea ondingo yɛngɛ iyoyo adaadea moto monɛnɛ ta Bokumu bo busa. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Ko moto mosusu oasɔdea yɛngɛ mokɛkɛ ondingo iyoyo ta kombe e mbi asɔi mbi mɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɛpɛ bodumba omɔti o bɛngɛ ta pekato</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mal 9, 42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />«Endelo moto omɔti akadumba ta pekato omɔti o baana bakɛkɛkɛkɛ ibia bakadhimeeni, enɔi bopele ta tina e nde bamotingee ibanga dinɛnɛ dikasiane na bu leka ta dɔli ko bamodumbe ta ibeke. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Ndjokwa e ngondo ta tina e bo midjɔ misusu mikadumbedje bato pekato midii minɛnɛ! Sooti, midjɔ mimina mibwani oko mikɔɔme, endelo ndjokwa e moto okagbule midjɔ mimina! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Ekadaa ebɔ e wɛ kaoko eko e wɛ eolomakadea ta pekato, elena ko edumba bohali na wɛ; edii bopele ta tina e wɛ okwee ta mohelo mopele ebɔ emɔti isa eko emɔti ka te bo baodumbe na mabɔ mabae isa na mako mabae ta mosa mo kɔbili. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Ko ekadaa diiso di wɛ dikaoloma ta pekato, didongedja ko didumba bohali na wɛ; enɔi na bopele okwee diiso dimɔti ta mohelo mopele ka te bo odikame na miso mabae ko odumbame na mu ta mosa mo ipelu.»<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e bhata obunga ko abolodjami</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15, 3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />«To madingani: pɛpɛ botsiolani yɛngɛ omɔti ta tei e bɛngɛ ibibi; modjɔ mo nabalakadea na nu bo, ta busa babwɛndi ba bobo bakaɛnɛ bihole bisusu mbanda e Sesa iyona odii ta busa. [ <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Modjɔ mo Mwana o moto adoa aheledja iyona obungea ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ imumu modiiti ta makomi manɛnɛ mayou. Boindja Luk 19, 10.</char></note>.]<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />«Elɛdjɛkɛdea ino nde? Moto akadaa na bhata mokama ko omɔti ta tei e bobo akabunga, abwaniti bokina bhata ba nde tuku ibua na ibua ta ngomba ta tina bohomba iyona obungi? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Ko naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: akamobolodja, asepadea na bhata iyona, bonɔɔ bhata tuku ibua na ibua ibia badaaki pɛpɛ bobunga. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Ndenge emɔti, Sangwanu iyona odii ta busa tapale nongo omɔti ta tei e baana ibibi abunge.»<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mondumba ndani mobwani na wɛ boyɛɛ mwangwao ta pekato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />«Mwangwao akaokɔmea bobe, kɛɛ amoinedje bobe bo nde ino babae pɛ. Akaokea omosɔmbedji ta ndjea e bodju. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Endelo amiti okea, bea moto omɔti isa babae, ta tina e bo modjɔ mosusu mokabɔngedjame oko na mibalo mi batemo babae isa basato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dit 19, 15.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Akalona bo baokea, bala modjɔ momina ta Ekelesa; ko akalona bookea Ekelesa, motombani ondingo moto okadae pɛpɛ bodjeba Ndjakomba isa moputedji o puti.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />«Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: eka esusu etingeakabi ino iyaya ta kpɔtɔ etingeamabi pongono ta busa; ko eka esusu etingoakabi ino iyaya ta kpɔtɔ etingoamabi pongono ta busa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 16, 19; Yoa 20, 23.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />«Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ naikina bo bato ba babae bakadhimeana iyaya ta kpɔtɔ bɛngi bawadje modjɔ momɔti, Sesa odii ta busa abapadea. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Modjɔ mo esika eputoani bato babae isa basato ta tina e kombe e mbi, nadii ta ndanda e bobo.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e mosali iyona olona bokutubanedja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Iboa Petelo abatama mbuti na Yesu ko amowadja bo: «Kumu, natungi bokutubanedja mwange o mbi iyona okɔini bobe mbala djeka? Mbunoko mbala sambo?» <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Nabaliti na wɛ mbunoko mbala sambo, endelo mbunoko mbala tuku sambo na sambo. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Ta tina emina, Bokumu bo busa bobwani na mokondji omɔti opalaka bobɔngedja midjɔ mi nde mi palanga engbanga na basali ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ta ehole e banga iyo bokɔ, bamolwɛɛ mosali omɔti odaaka na nyongo e nde taleta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Taleta edii embete e palanga djinɛnɛ.</char></note> koto doomi. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Abo aipeaka nongo eka emɔti e boputa na nyongo; moswa nde apa mitindo bamotɛkise na mwali o nde, baana ba nde, ko eka esusu edaaka na nde bɛngi apute nyongo e nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Iboa mosali akwa na magbunda boso bo moswa nde, angulama, ko abalaka bo: “Tukeani bosinɛɛ ko naputadea nyongo e wɛ esusu!” <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Moswa mosali amookea ndjokwa, ko akutubanedja nyongo e mosali o nde ko amokina akɛe. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Iyana aimana mosali omina, asongana na mina o nde o mosala obekaka mokama mo nde mo palanga. Amobuta ta ekolo ko abala na nde bo: “Puta nyongo e mbi!” <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Mina o nde o mosala akwa na magbunda ko asatitedjaka: “Tukeani bosinɛɛ ko naputadea nyongo e wɛ esusu!” <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Endelo mina o nde alona; naboa akɛɛ amoisa ta bɔlɔkɔ mbunoko amoputee nyongo e nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Ehole eɛnɛ bina nde ba mosala mondumba monɔɔmɔ midjɔ, baoka ndjokwa enɛnɛ ko bakɛɛ atɔndea moswa bu mondumba monɔɔmɔ midjɔ misusu. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Iboa moswa bu amobea ko abala na nde bo: “Mosali mobe, mbi nakutubanedja nyongo e wɛ esusu tina e bo osatitedja na mbi. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Wɛ pongono obwanaki bookea minɔ pɛhɛ mondumba momɔti mookei mbi wɛ pɛhɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Naboa moswa nde aso aoka kɛlɛ ko amoloma ta misala mipipo mbunoko amoputee nyongo e nde esusu.»<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />«Oko mondumba momina momɔti Sesa odii ta busa aokɔbibini omɔti ta tei e bino, amiti yɛɛ mwanango na molema mo nde itombo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 6, 15. </char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Bileho bi Yesu ta tina e bogwa bo moki</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mal 10, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Ehole esidja Yesu bopa mitindo, akina Galileya bɛngi akɛe ta ekenge e mokili mo Yudhea ta dɔɔngɔ dikina di Yɔlɔdane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dɔɔngɔ dikina di Yɔlɔdane: etingodjakadea ta dɔɔngɔ dikadonge modakabusa ta pamba e Yɔlɔdane.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Bimumu bi bato banɛnɛ bamokimana iho aso abaheledja na bego dji bobo. <verse eid="MAT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Bapalisai basalinda mbuti na nde bɛngi bamopikee elambo ko bamowadja bo: «Elomama na moomi bodongedja mwali o nde ta moki na bobe bo midjɔ misusu?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Oilangani eka ebala Makomi? “Ta mbangi Moyoli ayoa moomi ko na mwali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mba 1, 27;5, 2.</char></note>”, <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />ko abala bo: ta tina emina moomi akinadea sango ko na nango ko aputoanadea na mwali o nde, ko ibo babae baimeadea moto omɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mba 2, 24.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Naboa, batadadea bato babae endelo moto omɔti. Yɛɛ bo moto adae pɛpɛ bobɔtodja eka eputoanedji Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Bapalisai bamowadja bo: «Iboa, tina ndani Mose apa mitindo na moomi o moki bopa mokanda abodongedja mwali ta moki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Det 24, 1; Mat 5, 31.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Ta tina e milema mi bino mipipo, Mose aopani ndjea odongedjeni bali ba meki. Endelo ta mbangi eidaka iboa. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Endelo mbi naotɔndeakadeani bo: moto odongedji mwali o nde, dongedja oko ta tina e bɔɔli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 5, 32 ko na nase.</char></note>, ko akasɔ mwali okina akɔi pongono bɔɔli.» <verse eid="MAT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Batingami babala na nde bo: «Moomi o moki akabwana bodaa iboa boso bo mwali o nde, edii bopele adae pɛpɛ boasɔɔ mwali.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Baami basusu batasipoakadea eleho iyeye, endelo oko ta dii ibia bapa Ndjakomba enɔi ta tina emu. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Modjɔ mo edii bakina baami batasɔ bali banga ta sɔpɔ dji ba ngwabu; bakina ba baowa bisendja na ndjea e bato; ko bakina basepa bodikama bandengi ta tina e Bokumu bo busa. Yɛɛ bo iyona opalakadea bosipoa, asipoe!»<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjongoi bɛngɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mal 10, 13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18, 15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Iboa bato bamolwɛɛ bɛngɛ bɛngi ababakee mabɔ ko aɔngɔne ta tina e bobo. Endelo batingami babadosa. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Iboa Yesu abala bo: «Kinani bɛngɛ badoe ta dii mbi ko pɛpɛ bobasiani oko, modjɔ mo Bokumu bo busa bodii ta tina e bato ibia badii ondingo ibo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 18, 3-5.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ababakea mabɔ ko adonga iyana.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mokandoli omɔti o modieli</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mal 10, 17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18, 18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Iboa moto omɔti abatama mbuti na Yesu ko amowadja bo: «Molehi, modjɔ mopele motungi na mbi bokɔ nda bɛngi nadie bomɔ bo kɔbili?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Tina ndani owadjakadeani ta tina e modjɔ moindji bopele? Moto mopele adii oto omɔti pɛ. Okapala bokwea ta bomɔ, suma mibeko.» <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Amowadja bo: «Mibeko mimina nda?» Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Otaowakabi; otakɔɔkɔbi bɔɔli; otaibakabi; otapakabi tati e bokuta; <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />osumakabi sangwao ko na ngwao; opalakabi minɔ ondingo akasapale wɛ mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 20, 12-16: Dit 5, 16-20; Lew 19, 18.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Mokandoli moomi abala na nde bo: «Nakasume mibeko imia misusu. Etungi na mbi bokɔɔ naikina nde?» <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Okapala bodaa moto mobwanake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 5, 48. </char></note>, kɛɛ atɛkise leka lodii na wɛ, ko pa palanga dji bolodjadea wɛ ta dii bakwali; iboa obolodjadea bodieli ta busa; ngɔngɔ djimina doa ko kimanani.» <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Asama iyo oka kɔpi iyena, mokandoli moomi akɛɛ na ndjokwa, modjɔ mo adaaka na leka lonɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Yesu abala na batingami ba nde bo: «Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: edii bopipo na modieli bokwea ta Bokumu bo busa. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Ko naotɔndeakadeani naikina bo: edii na bopipo tito okabee ibo kamela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kamela: adii tito okatombe bidhugulu.</char></note> bokwea ta ipese di tonga, endelo edii bopipo mɛnɛ bɛngi modieli akwee ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Ehole eoka batingami mɛko mimina, bakamwa bobuke mɛnɛ ko basawadjanaka bo: «Omina ohelabi nda?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu abatingea miso ko abala na bu bo: «Ta tina e bato edii bopipo, endelo ta tina e Ndjakomba misusu midiiti na bopipo.» <verse eid="MAT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Iboa Petelo atomba kɔpi ko aso abala na nde bo: «Ah! Iso, lokina losusu ta tina e bookimana. Iboa, enɔmɔdea ta tina e biso nde?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: ehole edaabi Mwana o moto ta kiti e nde e bokumu ta ekumu ta ngondo eyeene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dan 7, 14.</char></note>, ino ibia bakimanani odaabini pongono ta kiti dji bokumu tina e bodaledja mabota doomi na mabae ma Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Ko moto okinabi ndako dji nde, mwanango, ngɛnɛ o nde, sango, nango, baana ba nde isa gbie dji nde ta tina e kombe e mbi, adiabi bonɔ mbala mokama ko asangoabi bomɔ bo kɔbili. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Bato banɛnɛ ba boso basɔmbɔbi bato bangɔngɔ ko bato banɛnɛ bangɔngɔ baimeabi bato ba boso.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Basali ta gbie e mele mi vino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />«Ta tina emina, Bokumu bo busa bobwani na moswa gbie oimana ehuma ebhu bɛngi aise basali babwani bosala ta gbie e nde e mele mi vino. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Aokani na basali bɛngi abapute pata emɔti e palanga engi busa ko abaloma basale ta gbie e nde e mele mi vino. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Aimana ta ngonga e ibua e ehuma, aɛni bakina badaaka ta esika masaka pɛpɛ mosala. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Ko abala na bu bo: “Ino pongono, kɛɛni ta gbie e mbi e mele mi vino, ko naoputadeani iputi ibwanake.” <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Ko baso bakɛɛ ta gbie. Moswa gbie aimana naikina ta midi na ta ngonga e basato e ngɔngɔ dji midi ko akɔɔkɔ oko mondumba momina momɔti. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Ta suka, aimana naikina mbuti na ngonga e batano ngɔngɔ dji midi, atanea bakina badaaka ena ko abawadja bo: “Tina enɔdji na nu busa itombo iyaya pɛpɛ bokɔɔ nongo eka emɔti nda?” <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: “Ta tina e bo moto omɔti aloisiti ta mosala”. Iboa, abala na bu bo: “Ino pongono kɛɛni ta gbie e mbi e mele mi vino.”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />«Aimea busa mɔkɔmɔkɔ, moswa gbie e mele mi vino abala na kapita o mosala mo gbie bo: “Beya basali ko baputa moto na moto iputi di nde. Bobanga na bato bakwei ngɔngɔ mbunoko bato bakwea boso.” <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Iboa, ibia bakwea ta mosala ta ngonga e batano ngɔngɔ dji midi bakɛɛ ko badia moto na moto pata e palanga emɔti. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Asaimea ngonga e bato bakwea ta mosala boso, balɛnɛkɛ bo babwanaka bodia bonɔ; endelo bapa moto na moto oko pata e palanga emɔti. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Ta ehole etomba bo palanga banungunaka na moswa gbie <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />ko babalaka bo: “Bato basakwea ngɔngɔ bakɔi oto ngonga emɔti, ko obaputi mondumba momɔti nasu, iso bato bakɔi busa itombo loakakana na moi mopipo!” <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Endelo moswa gbie asɔmbedja adii omɔti o bobo bo: “Mina o mbi, naokɔiti bobe. Lookaniti na wɛ bo naopute pata e palanga emɔti engi busa? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Tomba iputi di wɛ ko kɛɛ. Napali bopa ibia basa kwea ngɔngɔ mondumba momɔti na wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Nadiiti na bokondji bo bokɔɔ na palanga dji mbi eka esusu epalakadea mbi? Obɛɛkɛni ta tina e bo nadii moto mopele?” <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Naboa, bato banɛnɛ ba dii busɛbu ngɔngɔ baimeabi bato ba boso ko bato banɛnɛ ba dii boso basɔmbɔbi bato ba ngɔngɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndei naikina bogwa ko na bosisoa bo nde ta yogo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mal 10, 32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18, 31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Iyana adaaka iyo akɛkɛ aiwee ta Yelusalɛmɛ, Yesu atuba batingami ba nde doomi na babae ngungusa ko abala na bu ta ehole edaaka ibo bakɛkɛ adale bo: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />«Hokamedjani, loiweakadea ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ko Mwana o moto akabamadea ta mɔmɔ ba banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na balehi ba mobeko. Bamotitedjadea ta bogwa <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />ko bamokabadea ta dii bato ba bikomi bi bakɛndɛli, bɛngi bamotadea, bamobome mbalake ko bamobake ta ekulusu. Ko ta busa bo basato asisoadea ta bogwa.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɛngi e nange o Djake na Yoane</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mal 10, 35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Iboa nange o baana ba baami ba Djebede abatama mbuti na Yesu ko akwa magbunda bɛngi amosɛngɛe. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu amowadja bo: «Epalakadea wɛ nde?» Amosɔmbedja bo: «Pa mitindo bo ta Bokumu bo wɛ baana baami ba mbi ibibi babae badadae omɔti ta ebɔ e wɛ e baami okina ta ebɔ e wɛ e bali.» <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Otapoakadea eka ewadjakadea wɛ. Obwanini bomwaka kɔbɔ iyeye emwakadea mbi?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Lobwani bomwaka». <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu abala na bu bo: «Oko iboa, omwakadeani kɔbɔ iyeye e mwakadea mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Bik 12, 2.</char></note>. Endelo ta tina bodaa ta ebɔ e mbi e baami isa ta ebɔ e bali; ediiti mbi moto obwani bopa ndjea; polo idjia djidii dji bato ibia bahɔɔmɔ na Sesa.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Ehole eoka batingami ibia doomi modjɔ momina, balemoa na menga ibia babae. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Endelo Yesu ababea ko abala bo: «Odjebakadeani bo bakondji ba bikomi bakakondje bato ba bikomi idjii djidii nase dji bokondji bo bobo; bato bapipo bakabainedje diko dji bikomi idjia bokondji bo bobo. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Naboa, etakɔɔmɔbi na nu mondumba imua ta tei e bino. Enakoboa, ekadaa omɔti ta tei e bino akapala aimee moto monɛnɛ, atungi boimea mosali o bino, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />ko iyona opalakadea aimee moto o boso ta tei e bino aimee mosali o bino. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Ta tina emina Mwana o moto aidoa bamosalee, endelo asalea bato ko apɛ bomɔ bo nde ondingo motswiya mo boputa bɛngi asikoe bato banɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 26, 28; 1Ti 2, 6.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato ba miso mago babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mal 10, 46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18, 35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Ta ehole eimanaka Yesu na batingami ba nde ta Yeliko, emumu e bato banɛnɛ bakimana. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Bato bagwa miso babae badaaka badii ta mokpɛngɔ mo ndjea, aoka ibo Yesu akɛkɛ anɔe; ko bagama: «Kumu, Mwana o Dhapiti, lokea ndjokwa!» <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Emumu e bato ba bapɔpɔnedjaka bɛngi bakine bobala, endelo ibo bagama naikina na ngulu bo: «Kumu, Mwana o Dhapiti, lokea ndjokwa!» <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu aema, ababea ko abawadja bo: «Epalakadea ino naokɔeni nde?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, yɛɛ bo miso ma biso madipoame.» <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu abaokea ndjokwa ko apea miso mabobo; ko na mbala emɔti basɔmbɔ boɛnɛ ko bamokimana.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu akwei ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mal 11, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19, 28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12, 12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Ta ehole e batama bo na Yelusalɛmɛ ko baimea ta Betepadje, ta ngomba e mele mi Olive<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 11, 1 ko na nase.</char></note>, Yesu aloma batingami babae, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />ko abala na bu bo: «Kɛɛni ta ngando edii boso bo bino, na mbala emɔti otaneadeani tito omɔti o mwali okabee bo ane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ane: adii tito okatombe mina ko na bato ondingo punda.</char></note> otingi ko mwana o nde moomi mbuti na nde. Motingoani ko balwɛnini basusu babae. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Moto omɔti akaowadjani mosɔmbedjani bo: “Kumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kumu: ta mobala mokina Molehi isa moswa.</char></note> akambakadea na bu.” Ko na mbala emɔti abakinadea bakɛe.»<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Midjɔ imia mikɔɔmɔ bɛngi mibalo mi motɛli mikokedjame:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />«Bala na moseka o Siona bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Indja, mokondji o wɛ adoi adii wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">aluma na bwɛli, akondi ta diko di tito omɔti o mwali okabee bo ane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Djk 9, 9.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">ta diko di mwana o ane o moomi, ta dii mwana o ane o mokɛkɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Batingami bakɛɛ akɔɔ oko mondumba mobaloma Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Bamolwɛɛ tito o mwali okabeebo ane ko na mwana o nde moomi; ibia bakunda bo bisendja bi bobo ko Yesu akonda ta diko di bu. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Bato banɛnɛ ba emumu baanda bisendja bi bobo na ndjea; bakina balenaka tape dji mele ko badjiandaka na ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 2Ba 9, 13.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Bimumu bi bato badalaka boso bo nde ko bakina bamokimanaka ko bagamaka bo: «Odjana adii Mwana o Dhapiti! Yɛɛ bo adjongoame Iyona okɛkɛ adoe na kombe e Kumu! Odjana ta bisika binɔi o diko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndj 118, 25-26.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Ta ehole ekwea yo ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ngando enɛnɛ esusu ekumana. Bawadjaka bo: «Iyoo oko omina nda?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Bimumu basɔmbedjaka bo: «Edii Yesu, motɛli o Nadjalɛtɛ e Galileya.»<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mal 11, 15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19, 45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2, 13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu akwea ta tepelo ko abengana bato basusu batɛkɛkɛ ko basombaka ta tepelo; akukea mesa dji bato basɔmbɔtɔnɔkɔ palanga ko na bidie dji bato batɛkɛkɛ bimbenga. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Ko abala na bu bo: «Ekomama bo “Ndako e mbi ebeamabi ndako e miɔngɔnɔ.” Endelo ino oeimedjini esabalaka e bapundji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 56, 7; Yil 7, 11.</char></note>!»<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Bato ba miso mago ko na bitumbɛ babatama mbuti na Yesu ta tepelo ko abaheledja. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Endelo banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na balehi ba mobeko balemoa amabo ɛnɛ midjɔ mibokamwa mikɔɔ iyo ko na bɛngɛ ibia bagamaka ta tepelo bo: «Odjana ta dii Mwana o Dhapiti!» <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Iboa bamowadja bo: «Okakadea eka ebalakadea bo?» Endelo Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Okoboa. Oilangani nongo mobalo imumu mo Makomi: “Odiakadea ekumu e wɛ ta minɔkɔ mi bɛngɛ bakɛkɛkɛkɛ ko na ibia banungakadea mabɛi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 8, 3.</char></note>”?» <verse eid="MAT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Ngɔngɔ djimina abakina ko aimana ta ngando enɛnɛ bɛngi akɛe ta Betania ta esika e wɛɛ iyo.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alakedji mole mo pigi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mal 11, 12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Amaya busa, ta ihule di nde ta ngando enɛnɛ, Yesu aso aoka ndja. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Aɛnɛ mole mopigi na ndjea ko abatama mbuti na mu, endelo atanea oto kasa. Ko abala na mu bo: «Otabotabi mbuma naikina!» Na mbala emɔti mole mo pigi mokakana. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Ama ɛnɛ batingami iboa, bakamoa. Bawadja adii Yesu bo: «Ndenge ndani mole imumu mo pigi mobwani bokakana na mbala emɔti?» <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: okadaani na bodhima ko na pɛpɛ boisa kitɛ, obwanitini oto bokɔɔ midjɔ imimi misakɔɔ mbi ta mole imumu mo pigi, endelo ehole ebaladeano na ngomba iyeye bo: “Donga iyaya ko sadumba ta dua enɛnɛ”, ebwani bokɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Eka esusu ewadjabi ino na bodhima ta yuunga, oebolodjabini.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bokondji bo Yesu bodongakadea djɔ?</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mal 11, 27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Akwea Yesu ta tepelo ko ta ehole edaaka iyo aleha, banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko basuku ba Bayudha babatama mbuti na nde ko bamowadja bo: «Bokondji ndani bokɔkɔdea na wɛ midjɔ imimi? Oopa bokondji bomina nda?» <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Mbi pongono naowadjakadeani iwadja dimɔti, dimɔti pɛ; okasɔmbedjadeanini, iboa, naotɔndeadeani bokondji ndani bokɔkɔdea na mbi midjɔ imimi. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Batisimo ba Yoane adonga bo djɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 3, 6.</char></note>? Ta busa isa adii bato?» Ibo balɛdjɛ ko, basaleana bo: «Lokasɔmbedja bo: “Ta busa”, alowadjadea bo: “Iboa oimodhimeani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bodhimea Yoane: edii bodhimea bileho binde biindji batisimo.</char></note> tina ndani?” <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Endelo, lokasɔmbedja bo: “Badonga ta dii bato”, lodii na bɔɔ na emumu e bato, modjɔ mo bato basusu bakatombe Yoane ondingo motɛli.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Iboa, basɔmbedja ta dii Yesu bo: «Lotadjebakadea.» Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Ta dii mbiko ngasa, nataotɔndeakadeani bokondji ndani bokɔkɔdea na mbi midjɔ imimi.»<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e baana baami babae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />«Olɛdjɛkɛdeani bo? Moomi omɔti adaaka na baana ba nde baami babae. Abala na mwana o boso bo: “Mwana o mba, busa ibubu kɛɛ asale ta gbie e mele mi vino.” <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Mwana omina amosɔmbedja bo: “Naloni”; endelo ngɔngɔ dji moo ehole, asɔmbɔtɔnɔ malɛi ko aso akɛɛ ta gbie. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Moomi o mina abala adii mwana o babae oko mondumba momina momɔti. Iyoyo obabae asɔmbedja bo: “Okoboa moswa mba nakɛkɛdea akɛe”, endelo aikɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Okɔɔ bopala bo sangwabu ta tei e bobo babae nda?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Mwana o boso». Iboa, Yesu abala na bu bo: «Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: baputedji ba puti na bali ba ndukeli bakweabi boso bo bino ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Modjɔ mo Yoane adua adii ino na ndjea e bodju, ko ino oimodhimeani; endelo baputedji ba puti na bali ba ndukeli bato bamodhimea. Nongo aɛnɛ ino midjɔ mimina, oisɔmbɔtɔnɔni milema ta tei e bino bɛngi omodhimeeni.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e baaneli ba gbie e mele mi vino babe</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mal 12, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20, 9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />«Hokamedjani ekuanedji ekina: Edaaka na moswa ndako omɔti oana gbie e nde e mele mi vino; aehikaka ikutu, alongea mombɔndɔ mo songa e boama mbuma dji vino, apika diako di ekpalaka eyai tina e bosɛndjɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 5, 1-2.</char></note>. Ngɔngɔ djimina, aisa baaneli ba gbie e mele mi vino baputele ena ko aso akɛɛ mɔɔngɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Iyana aimea mbuti na ehole e bobuka mbuma, aloma basali ba nde ta dii baaneli ba gbie e mele mi vino bɛngi bakɛe amotombea mbuma dji nde. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Endelo baaneli ba gbie e mele mi vino bapea basali ba mina, boso baboma o babae bamoowa, ko o basato bamoowa na mabɔkɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Iboa, aloma pongono basali bakina banɛnɛ, bonɔ ibia bakɛkɛ boso; endelo baaneli ba gbie e vino babakɔɔ oko mondumba momina momɔti. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Ta suka, abalomea mwana o nde iyo mɛnɛ o moomi ko abalaka bo: “Basumadea mwana o mbi.” <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Endelo ehole aɛnɛ baaneli ba gbie e vino Mwana baso basabaleana bo: “Indjani mosangoi! Doani lomowoe ko losangoadea bodieli bo nde!” <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Iboa, bamopea, bamodumba sokolu e gbie e mele mi vino ko bamoowa.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />«Ta ehole edoabi moswa gbie e mele mi vino akɔɔbi iyo baaneli ba gbie e mele mi vino nde?» <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Abaowedjabi yogo emɔti ebe mɛnɛ ko aisabi baputeli bakina baaneli ta gbie e mele mi vino, ibia babwani bomopa mbuma ta ehole ekoki.» <verse eid="MAT 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yesu abala na bu bo: «Oilangani ta makomi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“Ibanga idia didumba batongeli ba ndako</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">diimea ikwee indonga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Ido diidonga ta dii Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">edii modjɔ mobokamwa ta miso ma biso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 118, 22-23.</char></note>!”<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />«Ta tina emina, naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: Bokondji bo Ndjakomba bodongedjamabi ta tei e bino ko bopamabi ta ekomi ekina emɔti ebotabi mbuma. [ <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Moto mosusu okwabi ta diko di ibanga imina abukeanabi bikenge bikenge ko moto iyona oo gbatimedjabi ibanga dimina, aminianabi bipɛndjɛ bipɛndjɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ imumu modiiti ta makomi manɛnɛ mayou. Boindja Luk 20, 18.</char></note>.]»<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Ngɔngɔ dji booka bikuanedji bimina ibia bi nde, banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko Bapalisai basipoa bo Yesu abalaka na bu. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Bahomba mondumba mo bopea, endelo babangaka bimumu bi bato ta tina e bo bimumu bitombaka Yesu olongo motɛli.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e mia manɛnɛ ma tɛkɛ e moki</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14, 15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu abatubanea naikina na ekuanedji bo: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />«Bokumu bo busa bobwani na mokondji omɔti iyoyo okɔɔkɔ tɛkɛ e moki e mwana o nde o moomi. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Aloma basali ba nde bakɛe abea bato ibia babeamaka ta tɛkɛ, endelo bato baipala bodoa. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Aloma naikina basali bakina abala na bu bo: “Kɛɛni atɔndeeni bato ibia babeamaki bo: edɛyeye nasidji bobɔngedja mia, naowodji ngɔmbɔ ba mbi ba baami ko na tito ba mbi ba miita, midjɔ misusu misi. Pɛpɛ bodimboani oko ta tɛkɛ e moki!” <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Endelo bato babeamaka ta tɛkɛ pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti obɛɛ moposo: bakina bakɛkɛ ta gbie dji bobo, ko bakina bakɛkɛ aɛngɛdje leka lo bobo; <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Iboa bakina bapea basali, babanɔngedja ko babaowa. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Iboa mokondji aoka kɛlɛ: aloma bosodha ba nde bɛngi baowoe baoweli ba bato bamina ko batumbe ngando enɛnɛ e bobo. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, abala na basali ba nde bo: “Mia ma tɛkɛ e moki mabakami ta mesa, endelo bato ibia babeamaki ta tɛkɛ emina babwanakiti na mu. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Natina emina kɛɛni ta matano, ko beani bato basusu otaneadea ino ta tɛkɛ e moki.” <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Basali ba nde bakɛɛ ta ndjea baputoanedja bato basusu batanea bo, babe na bapele; ko ndako e tɛkɛ e moki eso eluma na bato. <verse eid="MAT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Mokondji akwea bɛngi aindje bato ibia babeamaka ko aso aɛnɛ moomi omɔti ailwaka esendja e tɛkɛ e moki. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Amowadja bo: “Mina mba, okwei iyaya pɛpɛ bolwa esendja e tɛkɛ na mondumba nda?” Moomi omina aimosɔmbedja nongo eka emɔti. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Iboa mokondji abala na basali bo: “Monangani mako na mɔmɔ ko modumbani sokolu ta modidi. Iho ayeabi ko akpɛkɛnɛbi miino.” <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Modjɔ mo banɛnɛ babeama endelo bakɛkɛ bahɔɔmɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Puti e Kaisala</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mal 12, 13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20, 20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Iboa Bapalisai bakɛɛ akɔɔ inginda di bohomba mondumba ndani mo bopikea Yesu elambo na ndjea e mibalo mi nde. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Bamolomea batingami ba bobo na bato ba iputo di Elode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bato ba iputo di Elode: Boindja Mal 3, 6 ko na nase.</char></note> bɛngi babale na nde bo: «Molehi, lodjebaka bo okabale bosooti: ko okalehe ndjea e Ndjakomba na bosooti bosusu; tokakoanake malɛi ma bato; modjɔ mo toindjake mbanda dji bato. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Lotɔndea eka ndani elɛnɛkɛdea wɛ ta modjɔ imumu: etungi na su lopute puti e Kaisala kaoko ngasa?» <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Endelo Yesu odjebaka malɛno ma bobo mabe; abasɔmbedja bo: «Bato ba ndango e mongi, tina epikeakadeanini na nu elambo nda? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Inedjanini pata e palanga ekapute na bu puti.» Bamoinedja pata e palanga emɔti, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Ko abawadja bo: «Epweya iyeye ko makomi imimi ma nda?» <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Ma Kaisala». Iboa Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Pani na Kaisala midjɔ mi Kaisala, ko pani na Ndjakomba midjɔ mi Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Baso bakamwa na misɔmbedja miokabo. Bamokina ko bakɛɛ.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwadja ta tina e bosisoa ta bogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mal 12, 18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20, 27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Oko busa bomina, Basadukai ibibi bakabale bo bosisoa ta bogwa boditi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Bik 23, 8.</char></note> bakɛɛ awadja Yesu bo: <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />«Molehi, Mose abala bo: “Moto akagwa pɛpɛ bobota baana, mwanango atungi boasɔ mwali ogwedji moomi bɛngi amobotedje baana babwani bodaa batitani ba mowei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Dit 25, 5-6.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Enakoboa, ta tei e biso edaaka na baana baami sambo. Mwana o boso asɔkɔ mwali ko agwa, abonie aibota, akina mwali o nde na mwana o nango. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Ekɔɔmɔ mondumba momɔti na mwana o babae ko na o basato tii mbunoko mwana o sambo. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobo ibo basusu mwali aso agwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Ta busa bo bosisoa ta bogwa, mwali omina adaabi o nda ta tei e baami sambo? Modjɔ mo ibo basusu bamoasɔkɔ!» <verse eid="MAT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Odiini ta tei e ibunga ta tina e bo otasipoakani edae Makomi, edae ngulu e Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Modjɔ mo ta ehole e bosisoa ta bogwa, bali na baami batasɔnɔbi, endelo badaabi ondingo babwɛndi ta busa. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ta modjɔ moindji bosisoa ta bogwa, oilangani eka ebala Ndjakomba na nu? Abala bo: <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />“Edii mbi odii Ndjakomba o Abalayama, Ndjakomba O Isaka ko Ndjakomba o Yakobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boi 3, 6.</char></note>.” Ndjakomba adiiti o bato bago, endelo o bato badii na bomɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Bimumu bi bato bamookaka bakamoa bobuke mɛnɛ na eleho e nde.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mobeko monɔi na bonɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mal 12, 28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Ehole eoka Bapalisai bo Yesu asidji Basadukai esɔndjɔ, ibo pongono baputoana. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Ko molehi o mobeko omɔti ta tei e bobo , amopikea elambo ko amowadja bo: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />«Molehi, mobeko monɔi na bonɛnɛ nda?»<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Amosɔmbedja bo: «“Pala Kumu Ndjakomba o wɛ na molema mo wɛ itombo, na dongi di wɛ itombo ko na bowɛi bo wɛ bosusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dit 6, 5.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Iyena edii mobeko monɔi na bonɛnɛ ko mo boso. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Mobeko mo babae mokuani na imumu: “Pala minɔ ondingo wɛ mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lew 19, 18.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Mobeko mosusu na bileho bi batɛli bidii ta tei e mibeko imia mibae.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 7, 12.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masiya ko na Dhapiti</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mal 12, 35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Iyana aputoanaka Bapalisai, Yesu abawadja bo: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />«Ekalɛne ino nde ta tina Kilito? Adii motitani o nda?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Adii motitani o Dhapiti». <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Abawadja naikina bo: «Ndenge ndani Dhapiti na ndjea e Mwembo abwani bomobea “Kumu”? Modjɔ mo Dhapiti abala bo:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“Kumu abala adii Kumu o mbi bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Daa ta ebɔ e mbi e baami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">mbunoko naise baloni ba wɛ ta nase dji bigbota bi wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 110, 1.</char></note>.”<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />«Iboa, Dhapiti akamobea “Kumu”, mondumba ndani mobwani na Kilito bodaa motitani o Dhapiti?» <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti omosɔmbedja kɔpi emɔti ko, donga busa ibua pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti omeka bomowadja naikina.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu akebedji bato ta tina e balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalisai</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mal 12, 38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk 11, 43</ref>.<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20, 45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Iboa Yesu abala na bimumu bi bato ko na batingami ba nde bo: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />«Balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalisai badii ta mesa e eleho ta elomu e botingodja bato mobeko mo Mose. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Kokoledjani ko kɔɔni eka esusu ebalakadea bo na nu; endelo pɛpɛ bokwanani oko midjɔ mi bobo, modjɔ mo tebakɔe imia mikabale ibo. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Bakanange mina mi mandi ko na bopipo ta bolwa bɛngi ba mibakeake ta malokuloku ma bato; endelo ibo bɛnɛ te bapale nongo bobɛndjɛ na mosapi <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Mikɔ mi bobo misusu, bakamikɔe oto bɛngi bato ba baɛnɛ. Iboa ta mbanda ko ta mabɔ ma bobo bakalwae biale bi bisendja bidii na Makomi ko bakakadje sɔngɔ dji bisendja djikadae na Makomi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biale bi bisendja: Bisendja bikadae na Makomi: Bayudha basapaka na Ndjakomba balwaka biale bi bisendja bidaaka na Makomi ma mibeko mi Ndjakomba (Boindja Mit 15, 38-41; Boi 13, 1-16; Dit 6, 4-9; 11, 13-21).</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Bakapale bodaa ta bisika bi ekumu ta tɛkɛ ko ta bisika bi boso ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha; <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />bakapale babaiseake ndese ta bisika bi maputo ma bato ko na bobabeaka “Molehi” na bato. <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Endelo ino, pɛpɛ bopalani oko baobeakeni “Molehi”, modjɔ mo ino denga odiini oko na Molehi omɔti. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Ko iyaya ta kpɔtɔ pɛpɛ bobeani moto omɔti “Sangwanu”, modjɔ mo Sesa adii oko omɔti, Iyona odii ta busa. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Pɛpɛ bosabeani “Modaledji”, modjɔ mo odiini na Modaledji omɔti oko Kilito. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Moto odii monɛnɛ ta tei e bino adae mosali o bino. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Iyona osangɔdjɔdea bamotitedjadea, ko iyona osatitedjadea bamongɔdjɔdea.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu agamei balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalisai</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mal 12, 40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-52">Luk 11, 39-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20, 45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />«Ndjokwa e bino balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalisai, bato ba ndango e mongi! Odipeakadeani bato ndjea bɛngi badae pɛpɛ bokwea ta Bokumu bo busa; modjɔ mo, ino bɛɛnɛ otakweadeani, ko osiakadeani bato ibia bapalakadea bokwea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 23:13">[<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />«Ndjokwa e bino balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalisai, bato ba ndango e mongi! Okakatoeni leka lo bali bagwedja baami ko, okakɔɔeni yuunga dji yai dji yai bɛngi okoseakeni bato. Ta tina emina obolodjadeani etumbu enɔɔke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ imumu modiiti ta makomi manɛnɛ mayou. Boindja a Mal 12, 40.</char></note>.]<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />«Ndjokwa e bino balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalisai, bato ba ndango e mongi! Okakɛɛni mɛɛngɔ ta dua djinɛnɛ ko na o ngondo bɛngi baemedje nongo moto omɔti modhimi o Ndjakomba o Bayudha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">modhimi o Ndjakomba o Bayudha: Edii moto odii pɛpɛ bodaa Moyudha endelo adhimei mibeko ko na Ndjakomba o Bayudha (Boindja Bik 2, 11; 6, 5; 13, 43). Boɛngɛ Bik 10, 2.</char></note>, ta ndelo e mobolodji ino okamoimedjeni moto o ipelu mbala ibae bonɔ ino.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />«Ndjokwa e bino, badaledji bagwa miso! Ino okabaleni bo: “Moto akakata seleka na kombe e tepelo, iyena idiiti na modjɔ; endelo moto akakata seleka na kombe e wolo e tepelo etungi na nde bokokedja seleka e nde.” <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Bindanga! Bato bagwa miso! Eka enɔi tɛtɔ nda: wolo isa tepelo iyeye ikaimedje wolo esɛnɔke? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Okabale naikina bo: “Moto akakata seleka na kombe e etumbelo, ediiti na modjɔ; endelo moto akakata seleka na kombe e ibondja dji dii ta diko di etumbelo, etungi na nde bokokedja seleka e nde.” <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Bato ba miso mago! Eka enɔi tɛtɔ nda: ibondja isa etumbelo ekaimedje ibondja disɛnɔke? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Iyoyo okakate seleka na kombe e etumbelo akati na kombe e etumbelo ko na leka losusu lodii o diko di etumbelo; <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />iyona o kati seleka na kombe e tepelo akati na kombe e tepelo ko na kombe e Iyona okadikame ena; <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Ko iyona okakate seleka a kombe e busa akakate seleka a kombe e kiti e bokumu bo Ndjakomba ko na kombe e Iyona okadae ta diko di kiti emina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 66, 1; Mat 5, 34.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />«Ndjokwa e bino, Balehi ba mobeko ko Bapalisai, bato ba ndango e mongi! Okaputeni ekenge emɔti e doomi e matungulu, edjembe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 27, 30; Dit 14, 22.</char></note> ko na mondundumba, endelo obudjeeni bileho binɔi na tɛtɔ ta mobeko: bodju, pɛhɛ ko na edhimeli; iyena edii eka etungi e kɔɔme na pɛpɛ bobosana boputa ekenge e doomi. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Badaledji ba miso mago! Okakɔngɔleni dhumbɛmbɛ endelo omeakeni kamela mosusu!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />«Ndjokwa e bino, balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalisai, bato ba ndango e mongi! Okasɛnodjeni sokolu e kɔbɔ ko e saani, enakoboa ta o tei djiluma na leka loiba ko na leka lo bokoso. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Mopalisai o miso mago! Sɛnodja boso o tei e kɔbɔ bɛngi sokolu pongono eimee esɛnoke.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />«Ndjokwa e bino, balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalisai, bato ba ndango e mongi! Okuanakani na makila imia masuowa bo mokobo mopu, makangɛse sokolu, endelo ta tei emu maluma na mikua mi bato bago ko na djɛti dji mondumba mosusu. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Mondumba momɔti pongono na nu, ta boso bo bato oanɛmɛkɛdeani bato ba bodju sokolu, endelo olumani na ndango e mongi ko na bobe.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />«Ndjokwa e bino, balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalisai, bato ba ndango e mongi! Okatongeni makila ma batɛli ko okayɔeni makila ma bato ba bodju, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />ko okabaleni bo: “Loso lohelama ta ehole e bakɔkɔ bayou ba biso, ka loikweaka ta inginda di botangedja makiya ma batɛli.” <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ino bɛɛnɛ okabaleni tati e bosapunda bo odiini batitani ba bato ibia baowa batɛli. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Bopele! Kpokpomani mbunoko osidjeni bokɔɔ mosala mobanga na bakɔkɔ ba bino bayou! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Ndjɔ! Ibota di mimbitɔ! Modumba ndani mobwani na nu botia etumbu e ipelu? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Na tina emina mbi naolomeabini batɛli, bato ba konga ko na balehi ba mobeko. Owabini bakina, obakabini bakina ta ekulusu, ko bakina obomabini mbalake ta ndako dji bino dji miɔngɔnɔ ko obatuteabini engi ngando enɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Ta tina emina, makiya ma bato ba bodju imia masopea ta kpɔtɔ bobanga na makiya ma Abɛlɛ, moto o bodju mbunoko ta makiya ma Djakalia, mwana moomi o Balakia, iyona oowano ta pakasa e Esika Esɛnɔke na etumbelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mba 4, 8; 2Kl 24, 20-22.</char></note>, mabakamabi ta diko di melo mi bino. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: etumbu iyena esusu ekwabi ta dii bato ba mbota iyeye!»<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko na Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13, 34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />«Yelusalɛmɛ, Yelusalɛmɛ, wɛ okaoowoe batɛli ko bato ibia bakaolomee ibo okabaowoe na mabɔkɔ! Mbala djeka dji pala mbi naputoanedje baana ba wɛ, ondingo kɔkɔ o mwali akaputoanedja baana ba nde ta nase dji mapapu ma nde, endelo ino oipalani modjɔ momina. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Ko ta tina emina, ndako e bino eodikei etengelenge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Yil 22, 5.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Modjɔ mo, naotɔndeakadeani bo: banga edɛdiyeye otanɛbinini naikina, mbunoko obalebini bo: “Yɛɛ bo adjongoame Iyona okɛkɛdea adoe na kombe e Kumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 118, 26.</char></note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndei bobedjama bo tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mal 13, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21, 5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Iyana aimanaka Yesu ta tepelo, batingami ba nde basalinda mbuti na nde bɛngi bamoinedje mondumba motonga bo tepelo. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Iboa, Yesu atomba kɔpi ko abasɔmbedja bo: «Oɛnɛkɛdeani midjɔ imimi misusu? Naotɔndɔkɔdeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: pɛpɛ nongo ibanga imɔti didikabi diko di mina du; masusu mabukeanadea.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndjokwa ko na minɔngɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mal 13, 3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21, 7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Iyana adaaka Yesu na mobondo ta ngomba e mele mi Olive, batingami babatama mbuti na nde ko bamowadja na mbombi bo: «Lotɔndea ehole ndani eimeabi midjɔ mimina? Ko embete ndani einedjamabi ta bodoa bo wɛ ko ta suka e ngondo?» <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Tomadingani moto omɔti adae pɛpɛ boopengodjani. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Modjɔ mo bato banɛnɛ badoabi na kombe e mbi ko babalabi bo: “Edii mbi Kilito!” Ko bapengodjabi bato banɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Ookabini gala e bitumba ko na nungunungu e bitumba; pɛpɛ bobangani: modjɔ mo midjɔ imia misusu mitungi mikɔɔme, endelo iyena etadaadea pongono suka e ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Modjɔ mo ekomi emɔti eanedjabi ekomi ekina, ko bokumu bomɔti boanedjabi bokumu bokina; ndja djikwabi dɔɔngɔ na dɔɔngɔ ko mikumano mi ngondo midaabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Endelo imia misusu edii oko mbangi e epeko e bobotama bo mwana. <verse eid="MAT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Iboa bato baopundabini bɛngi baonɛdjeni saya ko baoowabini. Olonamabini na bikomi bisusu ta tina e kombe e mbi. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Ta ehole emina, bato banɛnɛ basundolabi edhimeli e bobo; batɛkɛnɛbi ko basaokeanabi swɛ ibo na ibo. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Batɛli banɛnɛ ba bokuta baimanabi ko bapengodjabi bato banɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Ta mondumba mo bo bobe bonanganabi bobuke mɛnɛ, iboa epaeli e bato banɛnɛ egɔlɔbi. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Endelo moto oikabi molema tiii mbunoko suka ahelabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Bwɛndi ibubu Bopele bo Bokumu botɔndeamabi ngondo esusu bɛngi edae tati ta tina e bikomi bisusu. Iboa suka eso eimeebi.»<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mobedji onɔi na djɛti</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mal 13, 14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21, 20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />«Ta tina emina ehole eɛnɛbino iyoyo okabeebo “Mobedji onɔi na djɛti” adikami ta Esika Esɛnɔke, mondumba motɔndɔkɔ motɛli Danyɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dan 9, 27; 11, 31; 12, 11.</char></note>, yɛɛ bo molangeli asipoe. <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Iboa, ibia badaabi ta Yudhea batungi batie ta ngomba; <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />yɛɛ bo iyona odaabi ta mbalasani etonga bo diko di ndako adae pɛpɛ botita bɛngi atombe eka edii ta ndako e nde, <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />ko iyona odaabi ta gbie adae pɛpɛ bosɔmbɔ ta dii iyo bɛngi atombe esendja e nde. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Ta masu imia, ndjokwa edaabi na bali ibia badaabi na meemi ko na ibia banungeabi baana! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Angɔnɔni bɛngi odaeni pɛpɛ botia ta ehole e piɔ epipo kaoko ta busa bo sabata! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Modjɔ mo edaabi saya enɔɔke edaa pɛpɛ boɛnɛmɛ donga ta mbangi e ngondo mbunoko busa ibubu, ko etaenɛmɛbi naikina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dan 12, 1.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Ko Ndjakomba aso adaa pɛpɛ bokputodja masu mamina, pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti obwani bohela; endelo ta tina e bato ba nde bahɔɔ iyo masu mamina makputodjamabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Moto omɔti akabala na nu bo: “Kilito adii iyaya!” Kaoko: “Adii ibobo!” Pɛpɛ bodhimani. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Modjɔ mo ba masiya ba bokuta ko na batɛli ba bokuta badoabi, bainedjabi bimbete binɛnɛ ko na bingengo bɛngi bapengodje bato, edae pongono ibia bahɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Hokamedjani! Nasi bookebedjani.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />«Moto akabala na nu bo: “Adii ta etengelenge!”, Pɛpɛ bokɛɛni. Kaoko: “Adii ta esika e mbombi”, pɛpɛ bodhimani. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Naboa oko mondumba mokakɔe mokalikali o diko ta dɔɔngɔ dikaimane modaakabusa mokaenɛme mbunoko ta pamba ekasame mo, bodoa bo Mwana o Moto adaabi mo oko iboa. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Esika esusu esambi ebembe, bingbondo bakaputoane ena.»<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodoa bo Mwana o moto</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mal 13, 24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />«Ta ngɔngɔ dji masu mamina ma saya, na mbala emɔti modaakabusa moimeabi modidi, songe atangɛsɛbi naikina, ndjɔtɔ bakwabi bodonga o diko ko ngulu dji diko djikumanabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 13, 10; 34, 4; Edk 32, 7; Yol 2, 10; 3, 4.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Iboa embete e Mwana o moto eimanabi o diko, bikomi bisusu bi ngondo bibakeabi mɔmɔ ta molo, ko baɛnɛbi Mwana o moto bodonga ta matute ma diko na ngulu enɛnɛ ko na ekumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dan 7, 13.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Mondulɛ monɛnɛ mobomabi, ko alomabi babwɛndi ba nde bengi baputoanedje bato bahɔɔ iyo ta makono ma ngondo manɛi ko ta suka e diko ekina mbunoko ta suka e diko ekina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dit 30, 4; Djk 2, 10; Nem 1, 9.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eleho e mole mo pigi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mal 13, 28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21, 29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />«Yɛɛ bo ekuanedji e mole mi pigi eoleheni: ehole eɛmbɛi tape ko kasa djibangi bobota, okadjebeni bo pela eimei mbuti. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Na ino pongono, ehole eɛnɛdea ino midjɔ imia misusu, djebani bo Mwana o moto adii mbuti na midipe. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Oko iboa naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: mbota iyeye etanɔɔdea pɛpɛ mɛko imia misusu mikɔɔme. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Diko na kpɔtɔ djinɔɔbi, endelo mibalo mi mbi mitanɔkɔbi.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oko Ndjakomba iyo mɛnɛ okadjebe ehole e suka</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mal 13, 32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17, 26-30</ref>.<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />«Ta modjɔ moindji isu kaoko ehole, pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti okadjebe, edae babwɛndi ba busa, edae Mwana; oko Sesa iyo mɛnɛ moto okadjebe. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Naboa, oko mondumba mokɔɔmɔ ta masu ma Noa, oko mondumba momina mokɔɔmɔbi pongono iboa ta bodoa bo Mwana o moto. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Ekahia ta masu ma boso bo pela enɛnɛ, bato bayakaka ko bamwakaka, baasɔnɔkɔ ko baasɔdjɔkɔ baana ba bobo mbunoko ta busa bokwea na Noa ta masuwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Mba 6, 9-7, 6.</char></note>; <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />ko baidjebaka nongo eka emɔti ta modjɔ mopalaka bokɔɔmɔ mbunoko pela enɛnɛ edoa abadindedja ibo basusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mba 7, 7-24.</char></note>; edaabi oko mondumba momina momɔti ta bodoa bo Mwana o moto. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Iboa bato babae bakadaabi ta gbie, omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />bali babae bakadaabi bainda mbuma ta eboka, omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Ta tina emina sɛndjɛlɛni, modjɔ mo otadjebakadeani busa ndani bodoadea na Kumu o bino. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Sipoani bopele bo: moswa ndako asoadjeba ngonga ebwani moibi bodoa na bulu, asɛndjɛlɛdea ko atadhimadea moibi abuke ndako e nde. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Ta tina emina ino pongono daani mbuti, modjɔ mo Mwana o moto atadoadea ta ngonga elɛdjɛkɛdea ino.»<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mosali o iyɔngi ko na mosali o pɛpɛ iyɔngi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />«Omina odii mosali o iyɔngi ko o bowɛi nda? Iyona opa moswa nde kapita obodaledja basali ba nde bɛngi abapake leka loboyaka ta ehole ebwani. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Mongandi ta dii mosali iyoyo otaneadea moswa nde, akɔɔ iboa. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Naotɔndɔkɔdeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: moswa nde amoisadea kapita o leka lo nde losusu. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Endelo ekadaa mosali mobe akasabalea ta molema bo: “Moswa mbi akɔkɔdea ekoka pɛpɛ bohula”, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />iboa aimeadea boboma bina nde ba mosala, ayakadea ko na amwakadea na bato bamilangoa. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Moswa mosali omina ahuladea isu didaki iyo pɛpɛ bolɛndɛ ko ta ngonga edaki iyo pɛpɛ bodjeba; <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />amobenganadea ko amoisadea esika emɔti na bato ba ndango e mongi; iho ayeadea bio ko akpɛkɛnɛdea miino.»<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e baseka doomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />«Iboa Bokumu bo busa bodaabi ondingo baseka doomi ibia batomba milinda mi bobo bɛngi bakɛe asongana na moomi o moki. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Batano ta tei e baseka ibia badaaka na milabolabo, ko batano bakina badaaka na konga. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Baseka ba milabolabo batomba milinda mi bobo endelo baitomba pitɔlɔ etutu e bodedja. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Endelo ibia badaaka na konga batomba milinda mi bobo na pitɔlɔ ta maseli ma bobo. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Enakoboa, iyana ayeyoaka moomi o moki; baseka basusu baoka hiɔ ko baso bawɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Ta ndanda e bulu mogamo momɔti mookama bo: “Indjani moomi o moki! Imanani asongana na nde!” <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Iboa baseka basusu baso basisoa ko babɔngedja milinda mi bobo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Baseka ba milabolabo bawadja ibia ba konga bo: “Lopani ndambo e pitɔlɔ e bino, modjɔ mo milinda mi biso midoi adimea.” <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Baseka ba konga basɔmbedja bo: “Ediiti enɛnɛ ebwaniti bokoka iso na nu. Edii bopele o kɛɛni pɛpɛlɛ asomba e bino ta dii bato ibia bakatɛkise.” <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Ta ehole ekɛkɛ bo asomba, moomi o moki aimea. Baseka ibia basabwanedjaka bakwea na nde ta ndako e tɛkɛ e moki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndako e tɛkɛ e moki: edii esika ebɔngedjamaka ta tina e tɛkɛ e moki.</char></note> ko badipa modipe. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, baseka bakina baimea pongono ko bagama bo: “Kumu, kumu, lodipoa!” <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Endelo asɔmbedja bo: “Naotɔndeakani sooti mɛnɛ bo: nataodjebakadeani.” <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Iboa sɛndjɛlɛni, modjɔ mo, otadjebakadeani isu kaoko ngonga.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e basali basato</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19, 11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />«Edaabi ondingo moto omɔti oimea mbuti na bokɛɛ mɔɔngɔ: abeya basali ba nde ko abapa elomu e bobanea leka lo nde. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Apa taleta djitano ta dii omɔti, djibae ta dii okina, ko emɔti ta dii moto o basato: engi moto bobwana na ngulu e nde, ko akɛɛ mɔɔngɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Iyona o bolodja taleta djitano akɛɛ nadju, akɔe na dju mombongu ko aso abakea djikina djitano diko. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Oko mondumba momina momɔti iyona obolodjaka taleta djibae abakea djikina djibae diko. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Endelo iyona obolodja oto taleta emɔti akɛɛ alongea mombɔndɔ ta kpɔtɔ ko apusea taleta dji moswa nde.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />«Ngɔngɔ dji ehole eyai, moswa basali ahula ko abala na bu bo: “Tɔndeanini mondumba mokɔi na nu na bodieli bo mbi.” <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Iyona otombaka taleta djitano abatama ko amolwɛɛ taleta djikina djitano ko abala bo: “Moswa mba, opani taleta djitano. Indja djikina djitano djibakeabi mba.” <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Moswa nde amosɔmbedja bo: “Bopele! Odii mosali mopele ko o iyɔngi. Abo odaaki na iyɔngi ta midjɔ mikɛkɛkɛkɛ, naoimedjadea kapita o midjɔ minɛnɛnɛnɛ. Doa asepe engbanga emɔti na moswa wɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Iyona otombaka taleta djibae adoa pongono ko abala bo: “Moswa mba opani taleta djibae. Indja djikina djibae djibakeabi mba.” <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Moswa nde abala na nde bo: “Bopele! Odii mosali mopele ko o iyɔngi. Abo odaaki na iyɔngi ta midjɔ mikɛkɛkɛkɛ, naoimedjadea kapita o midjɔ minɛnɛnɛnɛ. Doa asepe engbanga emɔti na moswa wɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Ta suka, iyona otomba oto taleta emɔti abatama pongono ko abala bo: “Moswa mba, nakadjebe bo odii moto mopipo: okatswɛ mbuma ta polo edai wɛ pɛpɛ boana, ko okandoane mbuma ta polo edai wɛ pɛpɛ bomɛsɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Naoka bɔɔ, ko na kɛɛ apusea taleta e wɛ ta kpɔtɔ. Naboa indja iyo iyeye tomba taleta e wɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Moswa nde amosɔmbedja bo: “Mosali mobe ko o emɛli! Odjebaka bo nakatswɛ mbuma ta polo edai mbi pɛpɛ boana ko nakandoane ta polo edai mbi pɛpɛ bomɛsɛ? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Tina ndani oisa taleta e mbi ta ndako e mbombi e palanga, bɛngi ta ihule di mbi nabwanaki natombe taleta e mbi na moo itomba o diko <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Iboa, motinoani taleta emina ko epani na moto iyoyo odii na taleta doomi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Modjɔ mo bapadea eka ekina ta dii moto iyona opeli ko aimeadea na leka lonɛnɛ; endelo moto odii pɛpɛ eka, bamotinoadea nongo moo eka opeli iyo. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Ta tina etingi na mosali omina iyona o mobe, modumbani sokolu ta modidi, iho esika eyeadea iyo biyo ko na bokpɛkɛnɛ miino.” »<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sambi e suka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />«Ehole edoabi Mwana o moto ta ekumu e nde na babwɛndi basusu, adaabi ta ekumu ta kiti e nde e bokumu. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Bikomi bisusu bidaabi biputoanake ta boso bo nde. Abɔtodjabi bato bamɔti na bakina ondingo mondumba mokabɔtodje mobaneli o tito bhata na kambeli; <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />aisabi bhata ta ebɔ e nde e baami ko kambeli ta ebɔ e nde e bali. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Iboa mokondji abalabi na ibia badaabi ta ebɔ e nde e baami bo: “Doani ino ibia badjongoami na Sesa, sangoani Bokumu bosia bobɔngedjama ta tina e bino donga mbangi e ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Modjɔ mo nadaaka na ndja opakanini mia; naokaka posa e bomwaka ko opakanini madiba; nadaaka mokɛndɛli ko oasɔkɔnini; <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />nadaaka mbundu ko olwadjanini bisendja; nadaaka na epeko ko okamoakanini; nadaaka ta bɔlɔkɔ ko odoani aindjanini.” <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Iboa bato ba bodju bamosɔmbedjabi bo: “Kumu, ehole ndani eoɛnɛ iso na ndja ko loopa mia? Ehole ndani eoɛnɛ iso na posa e bomwaka ko loopa madiba? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ehole ndani eoɛnɛ iso mokɛndɛli ko loasɔ ta dii iso? Ehole ndani eoɛnɛ iso mbundu ko loolwadja bisendja? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Ehole ndani eoɛnɛ iso na epeko isa ta bɔlɔkɔ, ko iso lodua aoindja?” <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Ko mokondji abasɔmbedjabi bo: “Naotɔndeakani sooti mɛnɛ bo, oko mondumba mokɔɔ ino na omɔti onɔi mokɛkɛ ta tei e denga di mbi, edii wɛtoko mbi moto okɔmedjano.”<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />«Ngɔngɔ djimina mokondji abalabi na ibia badaabi ta ebɔ e nde e bali bo: “Dongani mbuti na mbi, bato balakedjamake! Kɛɛni ta mosa mo kɔbili mobɔngedjama ta tina e djabulu ko na babwɛndi ba nde! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Modjɔ mo naoka ndja ko oipanini mia; naoka posa e bomwaka ko oipanini madiba; <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />nadaaka mokɛndɛli ko oiasɔnini; nadaaka mbundu ko oilwadjanini bisendja; nadaaka na epeko ko ta bɔlɔkɔ, ko oidoani aindjanini.” <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Iboa ibo pongono bamosɔmbedjabi bo: “Kumu, ehole ndani eoɛnɛ iso na ndja isa na posa e madiba, isa mokɛndɛli, isa mbundu, isa na epeko kaoko ta bɔlɔkɔ, ko loiokɔmedja?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Mokondji abasɔmbedjabi bo: “Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: oko mondumba modaa ino pɛpɛ bokɔmedja omɔti iyoyo onɔi bokɛkɛ, oikɔmedjani mbi pongono.” <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Iboa, ko bato mina bakɛbi ta etumbu e kɔbili, endelo bato ba bodju bakɛbi ta bomɔ bo kɔbili.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dan 12, 2.</char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Badaledji ba Bayudha bakɔi inginda ta tina e Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mal 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11, 45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Ehole emadja Yesu bileho ibia, abala na batingami ba nde bo: <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />«Odjebakani bo ediki masu mabae bɛngi tɛkɛ e Pasika<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 12, 1-27.</char></note> eimee: ko Mwana o moto adii mbuti na bomokaba bɛngi abakame ta ekulusu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Iboa ba nganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na basuku ba Bayudha bakɔɔ inginda ta ikanda di nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ okabeebo Kaipa; <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />ko batomba meko bapee Yesu na mbombi ko bamowoe. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Ekahia babalaka bo: «Lodae pɛpɛ bomopea ta ndelo e tɛkɛ modjɔ mo bato basaka mongangale.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwali omɔti asopea malasi ta molo mo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mal 14, 3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoa 12, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Iyana adaaka Yesu ta Betania, ta ndako e Simona, moto osɛnɔkɔ na mabha, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />mwali omɔti abatama mbuti na nde apeaka molangi mo momɔti mo alibatele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alibatele: ibanga di mokobo mopu, dikakɔe na bu milangi bɛngi baisake malasi.</char></note> molumake na malasi ma motswiya monɛnɛ: ko ehole edaaka Yesu ta mesa, mwali omina asopea malasi ta molo mo nde. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Ama ɛnɛ batingami iboa, baoka bobe ko balemoa babala bo: «Tina ndani e bobedja malasi ibobo? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Babwanaki bomatɛkɛ na motswiya monɛnɛ ko bapi palanga djimina ta dii bakwali!»<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Ehole eɛnɛ Yesu iboa abala na bu bo: «Tina ndani etungeakadea na nu mwali iyoyo? Akɔi modjɔ mopele adii mbi. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Modjɔ mo, okadikameni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dit 15, 11.</char></note> na bakwali bihole bisusu; endelo mbi otadikamabini na mbi bihole bisusu. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Aka sopea malasi ta mokuku mo mbi aselingoakadea bopuseama bo mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 14, 8 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: esika esusu etɔndɔbi ibo Bwɛndi Bopele imumu ta ngondo esusu, basɔngɔbi pongono modjɔ imumu mosakɔɔni mwali iyoyo ta tina e bomolɛdjɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudhasi apalakadea akabe Yesu ta dii banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mal 14, 10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22, 3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Iboa omɔti ta tei e batingami doomi na babae, iyona okabeebo Yudhasi Isikaliote, akɛɛ ta dii banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />ko abawadja bo: «Epadeani ino nde nakakaba Yesu ta dii ino?» Iboa, bamoputa na pata dji palanga tuku djisato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Djk 11, 12.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Banga ta ehole iyena ahombaka mwɛngi bɛngi amokabe.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayaki mia ma Pasika na batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mal 14, 12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22, 7-14</ref>.<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13, 21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Busa bo mbangi bo mapa mapɛpɛ boisa bole, batingami bakɛɛ awadja Yesu bo: «Apalakadea wɛ loɛngɛbɛnee mia ma Pasika djɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Kɛɛni ta ngando enɛnɛ ta dii moto songolo ko balani na nde bo: “Molehi abali bo: Ehole e mbi emei mbuti; edii ta di wɛ esika ekɔɔdea mbi tɛkɛ e Pasika na batingami bambi.” » <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Batingami bakɔɔ oko mondumba mobapa Yesu mitindo, ko baɛngɛbɛnɛ Pasika. <verse eid="MAT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Aimea busa mɔkɔmɔkɔ, Yesu adaaka ta mesa na batingami doomi na babae. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Ta ehole eyakaka ibo abala bo: «Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: omɔti o bino akabadeani.» <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Balumaka na ndjokwa enɛnɛ ko moto na moto amowadjaka bo: «Kumu, edii mbi?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Edii iyoyo oyakakadea na mbi saani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 14, 20 ko na nase.</char></note> emɔti, edii iyo moto okabadeani. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwana o moto akɛdea oko mondumba motɔndea Makomi ta tina e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Ndj 22, 2-19; Isa 53.</char></note>; endelo ndjokwa ta tina e moto iyona omokabi! Ebɔngɔkɔ ta tina e nde adae pɛpɛ bobotama!» <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yudhasi, moto omokabadea, atomba kɔpi ko awadja bo: «Molehi, edii mbi?» Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Edii wɛ moto osabala.»<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mia masɛnɔke</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mal 14, 22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22, 14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Ta ehole eyakaka ibo, Yesu atomba ipa, ngɔngɔ dji nde bosakoa Ndjakomba, adibuka, apa na batingami; ko atɔndɔ na bu bo: «Tombani, yakani, iyeye edii mokuku mo mbi.» <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Ngɔngɔ djimina atomba kɔbɔ e vino, ko ngɔngɔ dji bosakoa Ndjakomba, abapa ko atɔndɔ bo: «Mwakani ino basusu, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />iyeye edii makiya ma mbi, makiya ma Mokongo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mokongo: kombe iyeye einedjakadea pongono bwela, bookana ko bodhimeana (Boindja Mal 14, 24; Luk 1, 72; 22, 20; Bik 3, 25; 7, 8) Boɛngɛ Boi 24, 8; Yil 31, 31-34.</char></note> masopei ta tina e bato banɛnɛ, bɛngi badie ekutubanedji e pekato. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: natamwabi naikina vino iyeye mbunoko busa bomwakabi mbi na nu vino e yeene ta Bokumu bo Sesa.» <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Ngɔngɔ dji boemba Ndjembo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjembo dji tɛkɛ: etingodjaka Ndj 113-118.</char></note>, baimana bakɛe ta ngomba dji mele mi Olive.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndɔ bo Petelo amoinganeadea</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mal 14, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22, 31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoa 13, 36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Iboa Yesu abala na batingami bo: «Ta bulu bo busa ibubu, odumbadeani edhimeli e bino ta tina e mbi, modjɔ mo Makomi mabala bo: “Nabomadea mobaneli ko bwela bo bhata bonanganadea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Djk 13, 7.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Endelo ngɔngɔ dji bosisoa bo mbi ta bogwa nasuadea boso bo bino ta Galileya.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petelo atomba kɔpi ko abala na nde bo: «Nongo bato basusu bakadumbadea edhimeli e bobo ta tina e wɛ, mbi pɛpɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Naotɔndeakadea sooti mɛnɛ bo, oko ta bulu bo busa ibubu, boso kɔkɔ abekoe, oinganadeani mbala dji sato.» <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Petelo amosɔmbedja bo: «Nongo ekadaa bo nagwɛ engbanga emɔti na wɛ nabwaniti boinganea.» Ko batingami basusu babala oko mondumba momina momɔti.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aangɔni ta Getesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mal 14, 32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22, 39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu aimea na batingami ba nde ta esika ekabeebo Getesemani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Getesemane: kombe e monɔkɔ mo alamiɛ etingodjakadea songa e munɛ.</char></note> ko abala na batingami bo: «Daani na mbondo iyaya, ta ehole esatubadea mbi ta tina e boangɔnɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Atomba Petelo ko na baana baami ba Djebede babae. alumaka na ndjokwa ko na bosatungea. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Ko abala na bu bo: «Molema mo mbi molumi na ndjokwa mbuti na bogwa; dikamani iyaya ko osɛndjɛlɛni engbanga na mbi.» <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Akɛɛ moo bohali, akwa boso ta kpɔtɔ ko aangɔnɔ bo: «Sesa, ekabɔngɔ, dongedja mbuti na mbi kɔbɔ iyeye e saya. Ekahia pɛpɛ bokɔ oko bopala bo mbi, endelo mondumba mopalakadea wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Asɔmbɔ mbuti na batingami, ko abatanea bawɛli. Iboa abala na Petelo bo: «Obwanitini bohɔnɔ bosɛndjɛlɛ nongo ngonga emɔti engbanga na mbi? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Sɛndjɛlɛni ko angɔnɔni bɛngi odaeni pɛpɛ bokwa ta bomekama. Mwembo modii mopipo endelo mokuku modii na bwɛmbu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Asatuba naikina mbala e babae ko angɔnɔ bo: «Sesa, ekadaa bo odongedje kɔbɔ iyeye bɛngi nadae pɛpɛ boemwaka, yɛɛ bo bopala bo wɛ bokɔɔme!» <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Asɔmbɔ naikina abatanea oko bawɛli; modjɔ mo miso ma bobo makɔkɔ mandi. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Abakina, asatuba naikina ko ainga yuunga mbala e basato oko na mibalo mi mina mimɔti. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Ta suka, adoa ta dii batingami ko abala na bu bo: «Owɛlinioko, ko ohemakadeani oko? Edɛdiyeye ngonga eimei ko bakabi Mwana o moto ta mɔmɔ ma bato ba pekato. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Angɔɔni, lokɛe! Moto okabini abatami!»<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bopeama bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mal 14, 43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22, 47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoa 18, 3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Oko ta ehole ebalaka Yesu, Yudhasi, omɔti o batingami doomi na babae, aimea engbanga emɔti na emumu e bato banɛnɛ bapeli bipeko bi bila ko na pengu. Balomamaka na banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na basuku ba Bayudha. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Moto o mokaba abakɔɔ embete bo: «Iyona obhimbanadea na mbi edii iyo yona. Mopeani.» <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Mbala emɔti abatama mbuti na Yesu ko abala na nde bo: «Molehi, bosako!» Ko amobhimba. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Mina mbi modjɔ modoi wɛ akɔ mokɔɔ.» Iboa bato ibia babatama, baisa mɔmɔ diko di Yesu ko baso bamopea. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Omɔti ta ibia badaaka na Yesu agbula mɔmbi mo nde, akwɛlɛ mosali o nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ ko amolena itoi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Yoa 18, 26.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Iboa Yesu abala na nde bo: «Sɔmbedja mɔmbi mo wɛ ta igbogbo, modjɔ mo moto mosusu okatombe mɔmbi aane na mu akagwɛ oko na mɔmbi. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Olɛdjɛkɛdea bo nabwani boangɔnɔ Sesa, iyoyo obwani bolomeani edɛdi mɛnɛ bingbanga bi babwɛndi bonɔɔ doomi na ibae? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Ekadaa bo ekɔɔme iboa, mondumba ndani mobwani bokokedjama na Makomi mabala bo midjɔ mimina mitungi mikɔɔme iboa?» <verse eid="MAT 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Oko ta ehole emina iyena, Yesu abala na emumu e bato bo: «Oimanini na mɛmbi ko na pengu bɛngi odapeanini ondingo naimei mokondji o batɔmbɔki? Masu masusu nadaaka na mobondo ta tepelo ta tina e bolehani, ko oidoani apeani. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Endelo midjɔ imia misusu mikɔmi bɛngi bo Makomi ma batɛli makokedjame.» Iboa batingami basusu bamosundola ko batia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 26, 31.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu boso bo Ikita dinɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mal 14, 53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22, 54-55</ref>.<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoa 18, 13-14</ref>.<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Bato ibia bapea Yesu bakɛɛ na nde adii nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ akabeebo Kaipa, iho balehi ba mobeko ko na basuku baputoana. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Enakoboa, Petelo amokimanaka ngɔngɔ moo bohali, tii mbunoko ta ndako e nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ. Akwea ta ikanga ko adaa ta esika ekadae basindjili, bɛngi aindje mondumba mosukeadea modjɔ momina imua.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ na Ikita dinɛnɛ disusu bahombaka tati dji bokuta ta tina e Yesu bɛngi bamowoe; <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />endelo baibolodja eka emɔti, nongo ko apa bo tati dji bokuta djinɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 60 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndj 27, 12; 35, 11. </char></note>. Ta suka, bato babae baimana <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />babala bo: «Moto iyoyo atɔndea bo: “Nabwani bobuka tepelo e Ndjakomba ko naetonge na masu masato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 61 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Yoa 2, 19.</char></note>.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ aangɔ ko awadja Yesu bo: «Otasɔmbedjakadea nongo eka emɔti ta tina e tati idjidji djisusu dji opundakadea na bu?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Endelo Yesu apɔpɔnɔ. Iboa, nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ abala bo: «Ta kombe e Ndjakomba odii na bomɔ, olotɔndee na bokata seleka bo odii Kilito, Mwana o Ndjakomba?» <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Edii wɛ moto obali. Endelo naotɔndeakadeani bo: oko edɛdiyeye oɛnɛdeani Mwana o moto adii ta ebɔ e baami e Ndjakomba o ngulu; ko omɛnɛdeani pongono bodoa ta matute ma busa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 64 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Ndj 110, 1; Dan 7, 13.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Iboa Nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ aala bisendja bi nde ko abala bo: «Asingakadea Ndjakomba! Tina ndani ohombakadeani naikina batemo! Ookini mondumba mosingakadea iyo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Olɛdjɛkɛdeani bo?» Basɔmbedja bo: «Abɔngi na yogo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 66 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 24, 16.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, bamotswea bikɛtoa ta boso ko bamola mabɔtɔ; bakina bamogipea bipapata <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />ko babala bo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 50, 6.</char></note>: «Kilito, tɛlɛ tina e biso, ko lotɔndea osa oboma nda!»<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo ainganei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mal 14, 66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:5-62">Luk 22, 5-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoa 18, 15-18</ref>.<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Enakoboa, Petelo, adaaka adii na mobondo sokolu, ta ikanga. Mosali mwali omɔti abatama na nde ko abala bo: «Wɛ pongono odaaki na Yesu moto o Galileya.» <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Endelo aingana ta miso ma bato basusu, ko atɔndɔ bo: «Natadjebakadea eka epalakadea wɛ bobala.» <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Iyana akɛkɛ Petelo ta dɔɔngɔ di modipe mo ikanga mosali mwali okina amoɛnɛ ko abala na bato badaaka iyana bo: «Moto iyoyo adaaki na Yesu, moto o Nadjalɛtɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Amoinganea naikina na bokata seleka bo: «Natadjebakadea moto iyona.»<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Ngɔngɔ dji moo ehole, bato badaaka iyana babatama ko babala na Petelo bo: «Sooti mɛnɛ odii pongono omɔti o bato ibia, mondumba mo wɛ mo bobala moinedjakadea bopele mɛnɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Iboa abanga bosabhɛlɛ ko na agama bo: «Kanga Ndjakomba mɛnɛ natadjebakadea moto iyona!» Mbala emɔti kɔkɔ abekoa, <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />ko Petelo alɛdjɛ mobalo momobaleaka Yesu bo: «Boso bo kɔkɔ abekoe, oinganeadeani mbala djisato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 75 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Isa 26, 34.</char></note>.» Iboa aimana sokolu ko iho ayea na saya enɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Bakɛi na Yesu ta dii Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mal 15, 1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yoa 18, 28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Amaya busa, banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ basusu ko na basuku ba Bayudha bakɔɔ inginda di bodia meko bɛngi bahombe mondumba moboowa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Ta tina emina bamonanga mbɔti, bakɛɛ na nde ko bamokaba ta mabɔ ma gupɛlɛnɛlɛ Pilato.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudhasi asakomi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Bik 1, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Yudhasi, iyona okaba Yesu, ehole eɛnɛ iyo bo batitedji Yesu na ikambo, aoka saya ta molema ko akɛɛ asɔmbedja pata tuku isato dji palanga ta dii banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na basuku. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Abala na bu bo: «Nakɔi pekato ta tina e bokaba makiya madii pɛpɛ boda na modjɔ!» Endelo Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Eindjaka so na ye! Eindji wɛ mɛnɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Yudhasi adumba pata dji palanga ta tepelo ko asasuwa; ngɔngɔ djimina akɛe asakoma. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ baandoa pata dji palanga ko babala bo: «Mobeko motalopakadea ndjea e boisa palanga idjidji ta esika ekadedje ibo palanga dji tepelo, modjɔ mo edii palanga dji makiya.» <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Ngɔngɔ dji bookana, badia meko bo, basombe gbie e mokɔmeli o poke na palanga djimina, bɛngi bapusiake bakɛndɛli. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ta tina emina gbie emina ekabeame «gbie e makiya» mbunoko busɛbu. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Iboa mondumba mobalama na motɛli Yilimia ekokedjama bo: «Batomba pata dji palanga tuku isato, oko motswiya motombamaka meko na bana ba Isalɛlɛ <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />ko bamopa ta tina e gbie e mokɔmeli o poke, oko mondumba mopani Kumu mitindo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bolangama boputoanake bo Djk 11, 12-13 na midjɔ midonga ta dii Yel 18, 2-3; 19, 1-2; 32, 6-15.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato awadji Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mal 15, 2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23, 3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yoa 18, 33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu asamba ta boso bo gupɛlɛnɛlɛ; ko gupɛlɛnɛlɛ amowadja bo: «Wɛ odii mokondji o Bayudha?» Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Edii wɛ moto osabala.» <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Endelo aisɔmbedja nongo eka emɔti ta pundi dji banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na basuku ba Bayudha. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Iboa Pilato amowadja bo: «Otaokakadea midjɔ misusu imimi miopundakadea na bu?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Endelo aimosɔmbedja nongo ta iwadja imɔti, ta mondumba mo bo gupɛlɛnɛlɛ akamoa bobuke.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamotitedji na ikambo di bogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mal 15, 6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23, 13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoa 18, 39-19, 16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Engi tɛkɛ e Pasika, gupɛlɛnɛlɛ adaaka na momɛsɛno mo botingoa mo bɔlɔkɔ omɔti o hɔmɔkɔ na emumu e bato. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Enakoboa, badaaka na mo bɔlɔkɔ omɔti odjebamaka bobuke na kombe e Yesu Balabasi. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ehole eputoanaka emumu e bato, Pilato aso abawadja bo: «Moto opalakadea ino naotingoeni nda: Yesu Balabasi isa Yesu okabeebo Kilito?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Modjɔ mo adjebaka bo badaaka na ikuwa ta tina emina bakabaka Yesu ta mabɔ ma nde. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Ta ehole edaaka Pilato adii ta kiti ekataka iyo makambo, mwali o nde amolomea bwɛndi bo: «Pɛpɛ bosaisa ta modjɔ mo moto iyona o bodju, modjɔ mo busɛbu nanɔngi bobuke na ndjɔti ta tina e nde.» <verse eid="MAT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na basuku ba Bayudha bapangoaka bimumu bi bato bo, bawadja batingoe Balabasi ko baowodje Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Gupɛlɛnɛlɛ asɔmbɔ bobala ko abawadja bo: «Moto opalakadea ino ta tei e bobo babae naotingoeni nda?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Balabasi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato abasɔmbedja bo: «Ekɔkɔ mbi na Yesu, iyo okabeebo Kilito nde?» Ibo basusu basɔmbedja bo: «Abakame ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Abawadja bo: «Bobe bokɔi iyo nda?» Endelo bagamaka naikina na ngulu bo: «Abakame ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Ehole eɛnɛ Pilato bo, eidaaka naikina na tina, endelo mongangale mongalaka oko bongala, atomba madiba, asosa mɔmɔ ta boso bo emumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dit 21, 6-8.</char></note> ko abala bo: «Makiya ma moto iyoyo matabakamadea ta molo mo mbi! Endelo makiya ma moto iyoyo mabakamadea ta melo mi bino!» <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Emumu e bato basusu basɔmbedja bo: «Kina bo makiya ma nde mabakame ta melo mi biso ko na baana ba biso!» <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Iboa Pilato abatingoa Balabasi; ko ngɔngɔ dji bobomedja Yesu ndii, abapa bɛngi abakame ta ekulusu.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basodha Batai Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mal 15, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoa 19, 2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, basodha ba gupɛlɛnɛlɛ baloka Yesu bɛngi bakɛe ta esika e sambi, ko baputoanedja engbanga esusu e basodha baso bamohika. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Bamoiwa bisendja ko bamolwadja mokoto mokpetu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mokoto mokpetu: ta monɔkɔ mo Bagɛlɛki, kombe iyeye etingodjakadea bo mokoto molwaka basodha ba Loma.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Bayoa egbala emɔti e ndjubɛ bamobakea ta molo mo nde, ko bamoisa mososongo momɔti ta ebɔ e baami. Ko bakwa magbunda boso bo nde bɛngi bamotae, na babala bo: «Mokondji o Bayudha, bosako!» <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Ko bamotsweya masɔi, batomba mososongo ko bamoboma ta molo. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Ngɔngɔ dji bomotaa, bamoiwa mokoto, bamolwadji bisendja bi nde ko bamoloka bɛngi bakɛɛ amobaka ta ekulusu.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abakami ta ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mal 15, 21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23, 26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19, 17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Iyana aimanaka ibo, batanea moto o Silɛne okabeebo na kombe e Simona, ko bamopea na ngulu bɛngi atombe ekulusu e Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Asama bo imea ta esika ekabeebo Gologota, etingodjakadea bo «Esika e Engɔngɔlɔ e molo». <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Iho, bapa Yesu vino eputoanedja bo na bole bo boyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Ndj 69, 22.</char></note> bɛngi amwake, endelo ehole emeka iyo, alona bomwaka. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Ngɔngɔ dji bomobaka ta ekulusu, bakabana bisendja bi nde na bodjiboma djeke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Ndj 22, 19.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, badaa ena ta tina e bomosɛndjɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Ta diko di molo mo nde, bakoma ta ibaya makomi ma botingodja tina e modjɔ mo motitedja na bu ta bogwa bo: «Moto iyoyo edii Yesu, mokondji o Bayudha.» <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Bapundji babae pongono babakama ta ekulusu engbanga na Yesu, omɔti ta ebɔ e nde e baami, okina ta ebɔ e nde e bali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 53, 12.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Bato banɔkɔ na ndjea badaaka bamosinga na bogbɔkɛ molo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 26, 61; Yoane 2, 19.</char></note>; <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />babalaka bo: «Okadaa Mwana o Ndjakomba, tita ta ekulusu wɛ moto obukaka tepelo ko oetonge na masu masato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 26, 61; Yoane 2, 19.</char></note>, ko saheledja wɛ mɛnɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ na balehi ba mobeko ko na basuku ba Bayudha bamotaka pongono ko babalaka bo: <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />«Aheledja bato bakina, endelo abwaniti bosaheledja iyo mɛnɛ! Akadaa mokondji o Isalɛlɛ, atite ta ekulusu edɛdiyeye bɛngi lomodhimee! <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Akasapɛ na Ndjakomba modjɔ mo atɔndɔ bo: “Nadii Mwana o Ndjakomba.” Naboa, ekadaa bo Ndjakomba omina akamopale, amotingoe ke edɛdiyeye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Ndj 22, 9.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Bapundji babakama na nde ta ekulusu bamosingaka oko mondumba momɔti.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bogwa bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mal 15, 33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23, 44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Banga ta ngonga e midi mbunoko ta ngonga e basato e ngɔngɔ dji midi modidi mokwa ta ngondo esusu. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Ko mbunoko ta ngonga e basato ta ngɔngɔ midi, Yesu agama na moholi mopipo bo: «Eli, Eli, lema sabakatani?» Etingodjakadea bo «Ndjakomba o mba, Ndjakomba o mba tina ndani osundolini?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 22, 2.</char></note>» <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Ndambo e bato badaaka iyana baoka babala bo: «Abeakadea Eliya!» <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Mbala emɔti omɔti o bobo apota akɛɛ atomba imbusu, adidindedja ta vino e ngai; ahangea imbusu imina ta sɔngɔ e mososongo bɛngi apɛ Yesu amwake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndj 69, 22.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Endelo bakina babala bo: «Kina, loindje Eliya akadoadea amoheledja!»<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yesu agama naikina na moholi mopipo ko asɔmbedja mwembo mo nde. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Iboa esendja enɛnɛ edaaka ta ndanda e Esika Esɛnɔke ko ta Esika enɔi Esɛnɔke e tepelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 26, 31-33.</char></note> ealeya bipasa bibae banga o diko mbunoko o nase. Kpɔtɔ djikumana, mabanga manɛnɛnɛ mabatoana, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />makila madipoama ko mikuku mi badhimi banɛnɛ bagwa basisoa ta bogwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Baimana ta makila ngɔngɔ dji bosisoa bo Yesu ta bogwa, bakwea ta ngando enɛnɛ esɛnɔke ko basainedja na bato banɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Iyana amabo ɛnɛ mokumano mo kpɔtɔ ko na midjɔ mikɔmɔ, kapita o basodha mokama ko na ibia badaaka na nde ta tina e bosɛndjɛlɛ Yesu baluma na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ ko babala bo: «Sooti mɛnɛ, Iyoyo adaaka Mwana o Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MAT 27:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Iyana, edaaka na bali banɛnɛ baindjaka na bohali: bakimanaka Yesu bodonga ta Galileya bɛngi bamokɔmedje. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Ta engbanga e bobo edaaka na Malia o ngando e Magadala, Malia, nange e Djake ko na Yosepu, ko na nange o baana baami ba Djebede.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basambei Yesu ta ikila</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mal 15, 42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23, 50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Moomi omɔti o modieli o kombe e Yosepu, moto o Alimatayo, adoa mɔkɔmɔkɔ. Adaaka pongono motingami o Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Ko Yesepu akɛɛ ta dii Pilato amowadja mokuku mo Yesu. Iboa Pilato apa mitindo bamopɛ ta dii iyo. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yosepu atomba mokuku, ko amohua na molangiti moyeene <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />ko amosambea ta ikila di yeene dilongedja iyo ta tina e nde ta ibanga dinɛnɛ. Ngɔngɔ djimina, ahilingodja ibanga dikina dinɛnɛ bɛngi adipe ta monɔkɔ mo ikila ko ayana. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Enakoboa, Malia o ngando e Magadala ko na Malia okina badaaka badii na mobondo ta dɔɔngɔ dikina diyɛlɛmɛni na ikila.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bosɛndjɛlɛ bo ikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Puma sɛɛnɛ, etingodjakadea bo, ngɔngɔ dji isu di Mosɛlingo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kombe iyena inedjaka isu di batano, di sɛlingoaka Bayudha tɛkɛ e sabata (Boɛngɛ Mal 15, 42; Luk 23, 54; Yoa 19, 31,42).</char></note> mo sabata, banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na Bapalisai bakɛɛ engbanga atanea Pilato <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />ko babala na nde bo: «Mokumi, iso lolɛdjɛkɛdea bo mokosi iyo ehole edaaka iyo na bomɔ abala bo: “Ta disu di basato, nasisoabi ta bogwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 63 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 16, 21; 17, 23; 20, 19.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Ta tina emina, pa mitindo baise basindjili ta ikila mbunoko ta isu di basato, bɛngi bo batingami ba nde basaka doa aiba mokuku ko babale na bato bo: “Asisoi ta bogwa.” Bokuta bomina bosaka doa abakana naikina bonɔ bokuta bo boso.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato abasɔmbedja bo: «Indjani basindjili. Kɛɛni ko basɛndjɛledjani ikila na mondumba mo palakadea ino.» <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Bakɛɛ ko baɛngɛbɛnɛ mondumba mo bosɛndjɛlɛ ikila: babaisa ta ibanga di gbakasana na bu ikila bɛngi basɛndjɛlɛke.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Bosisoa bo Yesu ta bogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mal 16, 1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Ngɔngɔ dji busa bo sabata, ta disu di mbangi di eyenga, Malia o ngando e Magadala ko na Malia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 27, 56.</char></note> okina badoa aindja ikila. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Mbala emɔti, baoka mokumano mo kpɔtɔ monɛnɛ; modjɔ mo obwɛndi o Kumu atita ta busa adoa ahilingodja ibanga dinɛnɛ ko adaa ta diko di du. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Angɛsɛkɛ ondingo mokalikali ko esendja e nde epu mɛnɛ ondingo mbua o matai mapu. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Basindjili bangongoma bobuke na bɔɔ mbunoko baimea ondingo bato bago. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Endelo obwɛndi atomba kɔpi ko abala na bali bo: «Ta tina e bino, pɛpɛ bobangani. Modjɔ mo, nadjebakadea bo ohombakadeani Yesu obakama ta ekulusu; <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />adiiti iyaya; ekahia, asisoi ta bogwa oko mondumba mo balaka iyo. Doani aindje esika edaaki iyo asambi. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Ko kɛɛni pɛpɛlɛ atɔndea batingami ba nde bo: “Asisoi ta bogwa ko asui boso bo bino ta Galileya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 26, 32.</char></note>; iho omoɛnɛdeani.” Iyena edii midjɔ midaaki na mbi bɛngi naodjebedjeni.» <verse eid="MAT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Bali bakina pɛpɛlɛ mɛnɛ ikila na bɔɔ, ko baluma na mongandi monɛnɛ, bapota ebango atɔndea gala adii batingami ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Mbala emɔti, Yesu asongana na bu ko abala na bu bo: «Asɔni ndese!» Babatama mbuti na nde bamopea mako ko bakwa magbunda ta boso bo nde. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Iboa Yesu abala na bu bo: «Pɛpɛ bobangani. Kɛɛni abalani na denga di mbi bakɛe ta Galileya: iho baɛnɛdeani.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tati e basindjili babaneaka ikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Ehole edaaka bali na ndjea bakɛkɛ akɛe, ndambo e basindjili bakwea ta ngando enɛnɛ batɔndea banganga o Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ midjɔ misusu mikɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Ngɔngɔ dji boputoana bo banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ na basuku ba Bayudha ta ikita, baokana ko baapa basodha pata dji palanga djinɛnɛ <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />ko babapa mitindo bo: «Obatɔndeadeani bo: “Batingami ba Yesu badoi na bulu ta ndelo edaaki iso lowɛli baibi mokuku mo nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 27, 64.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Ko modjɔ momina mokaimea ta matoi ma gupɛlɛnɛlɛ, lodjebadea bosola na nde ko lokɔe na ngulu bɛngi odaeni pɛpɛ bodia bɛndɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Iboa, basodha batomba pata dji palanga ko bakɔɔ oko mondumba mo baloma ibo. Ko isolo di mina dinangana ta tei e Bayudha basusu mbunoko busɛbu.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asainedji ta dii batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mal 16, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24, 36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20, 19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bik 1, 6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Batingami doomi na omɔti bakɛɛ ta Galileya, ta ngomba ebatɔndeaka Yesu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 26, 32.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Ehole e moɛnɛ ibo, bakwa magbunda; endelo ndambo emɔti ta tei e bobo baisaka kitɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu abatama mbuti na bu ko abala bo: «Bokondji bosusu bopami ta dii mbi ta busa ko na kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Kɛɛni, imedjani bikomi bisusu batingami ba mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Bik 1, 8.</char></note>; babatisani na kombe Sango, na Mwana ko na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />ko balehani bo basumee midjɔ misusu mi olomani mbi. Djebani bopele bo: nadii engbanga na nu masu masusu mbunoko ta suka e ngondo.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>